const TARO_CARDS = [{"id":"major-00","name_ru":"The Fool","name_en":"","type":"major","suit":null,"number":0,"img":"major-00-fool.webp","element":"Air","astro":"Uranus","upright":{"short":"The beginning of a journey without guarantees: a clean slate, lightness and trust in life as it calls you beyond familiar territory—and the arcana asks only whether you will step into the unknown.","keywords":["beginning","spontaneity","life-belief","liberty","innocence","new horizons","risk"],"archetype":"arcana Zero is out of order: it is both the beginning of the journey and its eternal possibility. A fool is a young man on the edge of a cliff with a flower in his teeth and a look up to the sky; he does not know what is down there, and that is why he can step. In Waite's tradition, innocence is not as ignorance, but as unobstructed: a consciousness without the weight of past defeats, able to see in the stranger not a threat, but an invitation.\n\nThe card describes the state of a clean start -- a new project, a move, a confession of feeling, the first page. It says, trust is now more important than calculation, details can be refined on the road. The fool reminds us that every master has once been a beginner, and freedom begins where the need for guarantees ends. In the case of the equation, his advice is usually simple and bold: walk.","daily":"The typical Fool's day is spontaneous: going where you didn't plan to go, having a conversation with a stranger, starting what you put off \"Monday,\" a good time of travel and experimentation -- but check that you have your documents, your wallet and your common sense. The day is favorable for undertakings that don't need preparatory bureaucracy.","career":"In work, a card means a new project, a change of field, a startup, or a first task in unfamiliar territory, and there is not enough experience, but there are no templates to prevent a fresh solution from being seen, and customers often value this view. The fool supports the initiative from the bottom: suggest, try, make mistakes quickly and cheaply.","love":"In a relationship, it's the unsafe phase of falling in love: lightness, flirting, wanting to break off the two of you on a no-route trip. For singles, it's a sign that the encounter will come unexpectedly and not be like the usual scenario at all. In an established union, the card calls to bring back the game and try together what you both feared.","health":"The energy is high, the body is asking for movement: walking, sports, changing environments are better than tonics. The card is good for starting a new program - training, eating, sleeping patterns. The weak spot is inattention: rushing on the road, extreme tricks, missed first symptoms.","esoteric":"On the Tree of Life, the arcana lies between Hokma and Keter, the path of the Aleph, the ox, the element of air: pure impulse of the spirit before any design. Uranus gives the card the qualities of surprise and awakening; meditation on the Fool helps to let go of control and enter the flow. In practice, it is the best arcana for initiations, the beginning of learning and the first meeting with the teacher."},"reversed":{"short":"Leaping without wings: impulsivity and naivety turn into risk and irresponsibility – or, conversely, the fear of the first step keeps a person on the edge until the window of opportunity closes completely.","keywords":["recklessness","naivety","negligence","first-step fear","stagnation","frivolity"],"archetype":"In an inverted position, the jump remains, but the choice disappears: the person falls, not flies. It is impulsiveness, which is mistaken for courage, naivety, which is used by other people's interests, adventure without a reserve parachute. Classical interpreters agree: an inverted Fool is a risk without looking back, stupidity, disguised as freedom, or childish helplessness in a situation that requires an adult decision.\n\nThe card can also show the second extreme, the stupor at the edge, the conditions are ripe, and the person checks and weighs and postpones everything until the window of opportunity closes. The arcana question is: where does healthy carelessness end and irresponsibility begin, and do you honestly call cowardice caution?","daily":"In everyday life, an upside-down Fool is a day of distraction: lost keys, double-paid bill, late for the bus you were chasing. Bend to the proven routes and don't start big things: they won't have your attention. Beware of \"profitable\" offers from persistent people - the card classically points to simpletons who are riding. If you feel cornered by indecision, start with the smallest step: it will relieve half the fear.","career":"Professionally, it's risk without assessment: unsigned contracts, work on a word of honor, projects started on emotions and left in the middle. There's also a possible reverse drawing of a talented employee who has been preparing for months for a promotion and never submits it. The card warns against adventurous schemes and promises of quick money.","love":"In a relationship, the inverted Fool is immaturity: one of the two plays lightly, avoiding any responsibility, or, on the contrary, afraid of the first step for fear of looking stupid. The romantic scenario of “happened by itself” often turns into chaos without obligations, where no one owes anything to anyone. For couples, the card is a warning against rash decisions made on courage. The adult conclusion of the arcana: freedom in love creates reliability, not the absence of promises.","health":"The main risks are inattention: domestic injuries, sprains in the \"drive\" training, the consequences of small symptoms that are neglected. The card also indicates a lack of system — treatment is rushed halfway, prescriptions are taken somehow, hence prolonged malaise. Put in the basic order: appointment to the doctor, taking the alarm clock, avoiding extreme extremes until better times. The body now needs not feat, but accuracy and a little regime.","esoteric":"In a spiritual sense, the inverted Aleph is an impulse that has not found its way: practices are started out of curiosity and abandoned, teachers are replaced as podcasts, and the free way turns into wandering. The card warns of pseudoteachers selling someone else's naivety, and of spiritual materialism - collecting experiences without depth. Working with it requires honesty: pick one door and enter."}},{"id":"major-01","name_ru":"The Magician","name_en":"","type":"major","suit":null,"number":1,"img":"major-01-magician.webp","element":"Air","astro":"mercury","upright":{"short":"All the power is in your hands: the will, the concentration and the ability to connect the plan with the work; there comes a moment when you can, know and know exactly where to start moving towards the goal.","keywords":["will","mastery","concentration","initiative","manifestation","guile","resource"],"archetype":"The magician stands at a table with tools of all stripes -- a wand, a cup, a sword, and a pentacle -- all available to him at the same time, one hand raised to the sky, the other lowered to the ground, the classic \"up above, down\" formula acting through him, is the first arcana of conscious will after innocent zero: the design that found the hands.\n\nThe card represents the moment when understanding, eloquence and determination coincide. You don't just want to, you can and you know where to start. Mercurian nature gives you the flexibility of the mind, the trading vein, the talent to translate complex into understandable. Magician is the arc of self-actualization: the world responds to someone who articulates intent and reinforces it with action.","daily":"The day is good for negotiation, shopping, paperwork, and everything that needs to be clear and quick to think. You can do several things at once — Mercurian energy likes multitasking — but keep a list so that nothing gets lost. It's good to start learning something new or apply a skill that was idle. In the evening, re-read the message: on these days it's easy to promise too much or write to the wrong recipient.","career":"Direct Magic is a professional card: the project requires your competencies, and you know it. Great time for presentations, interviews, deals and defense of ideas; the negotiator reads the interlocutor with such energy and gently leads to the decision. The leader gives authority without pressure — you are listened to because they understand. Watch the temptation to turn work into a show: the focus should end with the result, not applause.","love":"In love, the Magician is a period of attraction when words and gestures are targeted: courtships are inventive, deep conversations, expressive pauses. The single card promises to meet a person of bright mind, often from social circle, study or work contacts. It is useful for a couple to start a common cause - from repair to an English course: joint action unites more than confessions. The shadow of the arcanum is beautiful speech without action: if the relationship is held only on them, it is time to test them with business.","health":"The card is connected to the nervous system and the conductive channels of the body: energy is invigorating, but it can be \"overdry.\" Well, things are going well that require coordination and fine motor skills; diagnostic procedures during this period are accurate, specialists' hands are confident. Careful with caffeine, stimulants and lack of sleep - the Mercurian race drains nerves quietly.","esoteric":"The way of Beth, the \"home,\" connects Keter and Bina: the will that builds its dwelling in matter. Mercury makes the Magus the patron of the Hermetic arts, from astrology to the art of memory; his main instrument is the word spoken with force. In the ritual, the arcana corresponds to the concentration of intention before any work begins: first to collect attention in a point, then to act."},"reversed":{"short":"Power flows through your fingers: talent is wasted on small things, words diverge from deeds, and confidence covers the void – there may be a dexterous manipulator or his own inner imposterity.","keywords":["manipulation","trickery","impostorship","squandered","fuzziness","blurred"],"archetype":"The inverted Magician is the same magician, but the table is turned to the public, not to the cause. The will is scattered into a dozen small undertakings, promises outpace opportunities, and confidence masks emptiness. In the worst case, the card points to a manipulator: a person who deliberately uses trust to sell the illusion of competence, from a miracle seller to a colleague who appropriates other people's ideas.\n\nMore often, however, the arcana talks about inner imposterity: ability is there, but fear of exposure causes them to hide or simulate activity instead of activity. The simple and unpleasant way is to pick one goal and make it work, checking each statement against fact. Until that is done, any charisma is a cheap trick.","daily":"In everyday life, there's no end to the bustle: ten things started, no completed ones, mixed records, lost time on \"important\" calls. You're at increased risk of cheating -- check check checks, change, subscription terms, don't be rushed. Defer major purchases and decisions: today they're made out of excitement, not necessity.","career":"At work, an inverted Magician is a smeared focus: meetings instead of decisions, reports instead of a product, three projects instead of one completed. The card warns of unscrupulous partners and the temptation to embellish reporting — reputation caught inaccuracy is the slowest to appreciate. There is also a crisis of competence: the task has grown, and the skill has remained the same. The honest answer is to learn or delegate, not to nod understanding.","love":"In relationships, the arcana points to play: misunderstandings, double lives, manipulation of guilt or jealousy as a way to keep it together. Sometimes it's just chatter -- promises of golden mountains instead of specifics that make the partner feel warm and anxious. For singles, the card advises you to test words with your hands: a brilliant storyteller is not always a reliable person.","health":"Energy is depleted through nerves: insomnia, tics, stuttering, exacerbation of chronic stress reactions are typical markers of this period. Symptoms can get confused and flash, making it difficult to diagnose: write them down so you don't confuse the doctor with blurry descriptions. Beware of self-medicating through advertising - the inverted Magician trades wonderful pills. Helps reduce stimulation: fewer screens and caffeine, more water, sleep and measured walks.","esoteric":"In a spiritual sense, inverted Beth is a word detached from meaning: conspiracies without understanding, techniques without ethics, the magic of impression instead of the magic of change. The card warns of the substitution of the goal by means — collecting tools instead of one completed work. It also indicates a drain of power: promises made lightly continue to act and draw energy. The practical cure is silence and one completed ritual: small, executed precisely, restores the channel."}},{"id":"major-02","name_ru":"The High Priestess","name_en":"","type":"major","suit":null,"number":2,"img":"major-02-high-priestess.webp","element":"Water","astro":"Luna","upright":{"short":"The answer is already within: silence, intuition and knowledge that comes before words – the card advises you to stop looking for logic in other people’s conclusions and carefully listen to your own quiet voice.","keywords":["intuition","mystery","subconscious","voice","silence","esoteric","premonition"],"archetype":"The priestess sits between the white and the black pillars, Yachin and Boaz, behind her back a veil of grenades and palm trees, and she holds a half-hidden scroll of law. She doesn't answer questions -- she knows the answers before they're asked. It's the lass of the subconscious: the part of the psyche where everything we know how to forget is stored.\n\nIn the layout, the card suggests stopping and listening. The solution does not require another analysis, it is already ripe somewhere below the level of words, and its first manifestation will be a quiet \"I just feel.\" The priestess patronizes secret knowledge, dreams, omens and random encounters that carry meaning. Her condition is respect for silence: what is revealed too loudly loses its power.","daily":"A day of quiet signals: write down your dreams, notice repetitive numbers and phrases, trust your first impressions of people. Anything that is done without noise is good -- chores, reading, planning without public announcements. It's not a time to reveal your plans: let them mature. If someone presses for an instant response, take a pause -- the Priestess is on the side of those who know how to say \"I'll think.\" In the evening, dedicate to the restoration: bath, music, silence.","career":"In work, the card points to hidden information: unspoken partners' motives, unsubscribed conditions, a job that has not yet been announced. It's now more profitable to be the most informed than the loudest -- listen, write, match. Research, analytics, everything confidential are going well. If your project is yours, keep it quiet until it's ready: premature discussion attracts competitors and skeptics faster than support.","love":"Here, the Priestess is a deep, almost wordless understanding, or rather a beautiful inaccessibility that beckons. To single people, it often means a person with a rich inner world who will have to be solved long and carefully. In a pair of cards, the card calls for a subtle hearing: the loved one speaks not so much in words as in moods, and it is important now to catch this.","health":"The moon controls fluids and rhythms: keep an eye on sleep, drinking patterns, and body cycles. The card is favorable for diagnosing subtle, implicit natures -- examinations, counseling, psychotherapy: the latent is now easily manifested. Mind-calming practices -- meditation, breathing, yoga nidra -- are useful.","esoteric":"The way of the camel, the Himel, crosses the Abyss between Kether and Tiferet: the Priestess is the guardian of the passage to where not everyone is allowed. The moon gives her the gift of reflecting light differently through a dream, a symbol, an image. In practice, it is the lark of divination: working with a mirror, water, cards, dreams. Meditation teaches her to distinguish the voice of intuition from the voices of fear and desire - the first sounds calm and does not rush anywhere. The commandment of the arcan is to know, but not give away."},"reversed":{"short":"Silent inner voice: Intuition is ignored for the sake of the “right” arguments, and secrets from defense turn into a fog of omissions, in which everyone around you wanders – including yourself.","keywords":["ignore","secret","quibbles","displacement","anxiety","superficiality"],"archetype":"The inverted Priestess is an inner voice that is muted, and the person ignores the premonitions because the logic is \"righter,\" and then marvels at the obvious trap into which his own feelings have led him. The other pole is a glut of mystery: secrets, inconsistencies, the control of people by hints, when loved ones are forced to live in fog and guesswork.\n\nSometimes the card shows the repressed: dreams, anxiety and desires that ask for attention and are forbidden. The mind without exit begins to speak with body language — insomnia, flashes, obsessive thoughts. The Arcana advises honest dialogue with itself: diary, therapy, silence without a phone. Intuition does not turn off when not listened to, it simply turns to the language of problems.","daily":"On a day when the internal compass lies: They want to be wrong, they want to be wrong, decisions are made out of spite or stubbornness. Postpone important elections - They're made out of anxiety now. The opposite is also noted: The person drowns out the “strange anxiety”, and it turned out to be a true instinct. Practice a little honesty with yourself: To write down a dream, to admit envy, to call fear by its name. No phone or news tonight The noise of the information is especially misleading today.","career":"At work, the card warns you that the information you lack is there, and it's being deliberately held. Read the contracts in fine print, clarify what's left behind, don't rely on verbal assurances. There's also the possibility of your own superficiality: the decision is made at the top, the details are not studied, and it will come out sideways.","love":"In a relationship, the inverted Priestess is a fog: ineffects, secret correspondence, \"sucks itself\" instead of talking. One of the two knows more than he says, and this asymmetry erodes trust faster than open conflict. For singles, the card indicates fascination with the image, not the person: the fantasy of the partner replaces the partner himself; the medicine is to say the uncomfortable out loud; even if the truth turns out to be bitter, it will stop the slow suffocation of the omissions.","health":"The physical card is related to repressed states: psychosomatics, hormonal disruptions against chronic stress, sleep disturbances and cycles. The typical story is \"nothing seems to hurt, but there is no strength\": the body signals accumulated, and the list of tests finds nothing. Don't brush it off - start with the nervous system: regimen, therapy, load reduction.","esoteric":"The spiritually inverted way of Gimel is an attempt to cross the Abyss without preparation: practices deeper than readiness give instead of insight a clouding. The card points to a blocked channel of perception: the person is either afraid of his abilities or, conversely, gives fantasies for revelations. In both cases, the cure is one - grounding and discipline: a dream diary with fact checking, simple practices, a mentor with sober eyes."}},{"id":"major-03","name_ru":"The Empress","name_en":"","type":"major","suit":null,"number":3,"img":"major-03-empress.webp","element":"Earth","astro":"Venus","upright":{"short":"Everything grows when it is cared for: abundance, creativity, sensuality, and the maternal warmth of life; ideas and relationships yield yields if they are patiently nurtured rather than rushed to another’s schedule.","keywords":["abundance","fertility","care","creativity","sensuality","motherhood","crop"],"archetype":"The Empress sits among ripe wheat, at her feet is a sickle moon, her dress is embroidered with pomegranates. The Venusian nature of the card speaks in the language of growth: a garden that is watered, a child that is loved, an idea that is allowed to ripen. After the priestess' silence, this is the first loud yes to life - generous, bodily, earthly.\n\nLike an archetype, it connects mother, hostess and creator: the same principle nourishes both the living and the hand-made. In the Empress's case, the sign of harvest and pregnancy, whether literal or creative: the project has gained juice and will soon be born. The card reminds us that abundance does not come to those who are ashamed to want; to feed others, you need to be fed yourself.","daily":"A day of bodily pleasure and simple joy: cook, host, bring beauty to the house, walk where green is. It's good to buy things for comfort, plants, products from the market, not from the list. Care for loved ones today comes back a hundredfold - but put yourself on the same list of care.","career":"In the Empress case, it's a growth project that requires regular care, not a leap: team, budget and customer relationships need to be watered like beds. Creative jobs, catering, beauty, education, all things that make people's lives more enjoyable. The card advises the gardener's style: create conditions, not push deadlines.","love":"One of the great cards of family happiness is tenderness, sensuality, the desire to indulge and be spoiled. For couples thinking about children, the Empress traditionally promises conception; for everyone else, a period of honey heat even years later. The card advises single people to go out of their heads into their bodies: taste, smell, dance and touch bring to life those whom the mind would not allow. Beware of turning care into service for a partner, love does not work on the principle of a buffet with free supplements.","health":"The card is good: the body recovers, the treatment is gentle, the body responds gratefully to care. Especially good natural nutrition, massage, water treatments — all the pleasant and useful things at the same time. When planning pregnancy, this is one of the strongest indications of the deck. The flip side is the tendency to excess: sweet, feasting, relaxation; pleasure works in dose, not infinity, so indulge yourself consciously.","esoteric":"The Dalet Way, the doorway, connects Hokma and Bina: life comes into shape through the gates of love. Venus makes the Empress the patroness of fertility in every sense, from crops to inspiration; her elements are land, water and everything that blooms. In practice, arcana is used to bless the home, attract wealth, sanctify gardens and any endeavors associated with growth. Meditation on her returns the basic trust of the world feeds me, the soil from which real generosity grows."},"reversed":{"short":"Distortion in care: hypercare and dissolution in other people's needs strangle loved ones - or there comes a creative drought, and life is put on its own, forgotten by its own tired hostess.","keywords":["hyper-guardianship","stagnation","dependence","neglect","suffocating","scarcity"],"archetype":"The upside down Empress is a failure in the mechanism of feeding life. The first option is hyper-care and dissolution in other people's needs: the person is so busy with the role of \"feeding\" that he forgets to eat; help becomes control, and generosity becomes the eternal duty of another; the second is creative drought: ideas are not fertilized, the body is sluggish, joy is replaced by the list of duties and other people's expectations.\n\nOften, the card indicates a disregard for one's own physicality: sleep, food, rest and touch are put off for later, and the soil of life is exhausted. Arcana suggests going back to the basics: cook delicious, sleep, say no to excess work. The fruit does not ripen according to the schedule of other people's demands - restore the land, and the growth will resume itself.","daily":"In everyday life, when care is stalled: the house is cluttered, food is on the run, loved ones receive irritated notations instead of warmth. There is a possible reverse skew — a day completely eaten by other people's requests: you are like a babysitter, a courier and a support service in one person. Put simple order: one hour on yourself without guilt, normal food, the rejection of even one imposed role. The house comes to life after the owner, not the other way around.","career":"Professionally upside down Empress is project stagnation and team burnout: resources are invested and no growth is due to everything but the main one being watered. To the manager, the card points to micromanagement: employees choking under care and learning to think for themselves; to the creative professions, she promises a block — drafts without finalities, ideas without courage; the cure — delegation, priorities and honest vacation: harvest is not harvested from depleted land.","love":"In relationships, the card depicts a suffocating love: the partner is decided, fed, tested — and slowly suffocates; or the reverse picture is indifference, when loved ones live next to someone who has long been unaware of their needs; for single people, it indicates dependence on the opinion of relatives or ex: the heart is occupied with an old attachment, and the new one does not fit.","health":"The card shows the physical consequences of self-starting: excess weight from eating stress, swelling, lethargy, exacerbations against the background of chronic sleep deprivation. Women may have cycle failures and signs of reproductive depletion - an excuse to visit the doctor, not for the heroic \"go away.\" Start with the simple: sleep, eating according to regime, movement for pleasure and one honest conversation with the doctor.","esoteric":"The spiritually upside down Dalet is a door hammered on either side: fear of receiving or fear of giving. The card points to a distortion of the Venusian principle: love has become a bargain (“I care, you must”) or self-punishment (“I can’t, not everyone can’t, yet”). The healing practice is simple and bodily: delicious food without guilt, body care, beauty around — as a ritual of acceptance of the world."}},{"id":"major-04","name_ru":"The Emperor","name_en":"","type":"major","suit":null,"number":4,"img":"major-04-emperor.webp","element":"Fire","astro":"Aries.","upright":{"short":"Structure conquers chaos: the power, order, and responsibility of the one who holds the frame; the result comes through discipline, clear rules, and the word that is kept no matter what.","keywords":["power","structure","routine","responsibility","stability","paternalism","discipline"],"archetype":"The emperor sits on a stone throne with the heads of rams, a sign of the connection with Aries and Mars, and holds the ankh and the power: power over life and the world is given to the one who can withstand the weight. Behind him are bare rocks: order begins where convenience ends. It is the lap of law - not external coercion, but an inner axis around which you can build.\n\nIn the context, it means a period when discipline brings results: rules, boundaries, direct conversations, signed commitments. The emperor is the father of the deck: protects, provides and demands to grow up. His strength is not in screaming, but in immutability - he is today what he was yesterday, and therefore he can be trusted with the future.","daily":"Order day: take out the papers, put the system in the closet and budget, negotiate with the household about the rules. It's good to schedule, pay bills, deal with legal matters — the routine under this arcana is easy and productive. Meeting with older people — parents, mentors — requires respectful tone, even if you argue.","career":"Direct Emperor is a time of management decisions: process building, regulations writing, responsibility taking. The bosses are in this period of fact and numbers, not emotion — come with a plan, not a complaint. The card is favorable for working with government agencies, documents, real estate, building a business on solid foundation. Ask for a raise with reason: your stable value is visible and ready to pay.","love":"In relationships, the arcana gives you trustworthiness: the partner who holds the house, clear agreements, protecting the family as a matter of honor. The male energy here expresses love in deeds — security, presence, problems solved; the female card gives you the right to demand consistency instead of promises; The shadow is turning the union into a charter: if romance is reduced to schedule and control, add to the design of a window of freedom. Parents are reminded to guide, not suppress, and educate, not follow.","health":"Aries fire is associated with head and muscle strength: neck strains, migraines from responsibility pressures, pressure surges from chronic \"I have to do it myself.\" The card recommends regular exercise - the regime trains blood vessels and nervous system better than one-off feats. A good period for routine treatment, operations with a clear protocol, disciplined rehabilitation: the organization of the patient directly affects the outcome. And do not carry the whole world on your shoulders alone - ask for help in time.","esoteric":"The Way of Hay, the window, connects Hokma and Tiferet: light enters the world through an ordered frame. The Martial Fire of Aries makes the Emperor the patron of all forms that hold power, from the circle of ritual to the law of the state. In practice, the arcana corresponds to the altar and the boundaries of the circle: before calling for a force, make sure that there is someone to say stop."},"reversed":{"short":"Power that has lost its footing: tyranny and control for control’s sake – or the crown without will, where no one makes decisions and everything hangs on the moods, habits and clues of others.","keywords":["tyranny","rigidity","abuse","weakness","loss of control","stubbornness"],"archetype":"The inverted Emperor is a throne that has lost its foundation. The first option is tyranny: control for control, orders instead of arguments, \"because I said so,\" power that requires submission instead of trust. The second is the reverse extreme: a man in a crown but without will -- no decisions are made, duties sag, a house or department lives by mood and other people's clues.\n\nThe card often points to conflict with the power figure -- the boss, the father, the state -- or to one's own rigidity, where the rules that saved yesterday stifle today. Arkan asks a direct question: does the structure serve you or do you serve the structure? The healthy answer is to review the laws, remaining the author of your system, not its hostage.","daily":"In everyday life, the day when order turns into despotism: picking on trifles, scandal over the wrong hanging of a towel, the household walks on the strings. Or vice versa, the economy is on its own: bills are overdue, repairs are suspended, no one is responsible for anything. Find the middle: three really important rules that are respected by everyone, including you. Strength training today is better replaced by stretching, too, the body asks not for pressure, but flexibility.","career":"At work, the card warns of toxic leadership, whether it's yours or yours: humiliation of subordinates, decisions by force, a cult of \"toughness\" under which incompetence hides. There may be a crisis of structure: regulations are outdated, the system is stalled, and it's scary to change. The good move is to document what's happening and build a legal footing: the inverted Emperor retreats to facts and paper. Owners are audited by control: where you push, people stop thinking.","love":"In a relationship, the arcana paints two ills: a domestic tyranny where love is measured by obedience, and a power vacuum where no one wants to take responsibility even for a vacation. Partnership turns into either a barracks or a communal room for two guests. Jealousy and surveillance are common markers of this card.","health":"The body is the first to report tyranny or chaos: hypertension, neck and jaw cramps, stomach problems from constant fist-gathering. The suppressed anger settles into the muscles and blood vessels -- there are safe ways to release it: sports, pear fighting, frank conversation. At the reverse pole, lethargy, excess weight, \"hampered\" health plans: basic discipline returns, and form returns. Pressure, pulse and sleep are three numbers that should be followed especially during this period.","esoteric":"Hay's spiritually inverted window is a frame that has become a cage: a form that was designed to protect the light has shut it down. The card indicates the abuse of power in practice -- hard methods, self-inflicted violence, authority built on the fear of students -- and the opposite: promiscuity without any framework. The test is healthy: after your discipline, people have more life or less?"}},{"id":"major-05","name_ru":"The Hierophant","name_en":"","type":"major","suit":null,"number":5,"img":"major-05-hierophant.webp","element":"Earth","astro":"Taurus","upright":{"short":"Knowledge tested by generations: a teacher, tradition and meanings that are more than one person; time to learn from masters, observe the rules of the environment and formalize the main thing in an accepted form.","keywords":["tradition","teaching","spirituality","continuity","ritual","education","community"],"archetype":"The hierophant in the three-crown tiara blesses two novices; the keys at his feet open both the outer doors of the temple and the inner meanings. He is the high priest of the deck, the guardian of succession: knowledge that will outlast individuals if transmitted correctly. Taurus gives him the patience of the earth to teach slowly, thoroughly, for life.\n\nIn the layout, the arcana indicates entering into a tradition: religious, scientific, corporate, family, marriage, marriage, a diploma recognized by the community, a craft learned from a master, the card respects the rules not as a cage, but as a channel, in which power flows, not spills.","daily":"A day of appropriate rituals: family dinner on Sundays, congratulations on all the rules, visits to elders. It's good to seek advice from a mentor, to sign up for training, to fulfill previously made promises. The formalities - statements, registrations, official ceremonies - go smoothly. Not a good day for outrage: the environment values decency, and you can be original tomorrow.","career":"Arcan points to the structure of a corporation, a university, a government agency, a code and hierarchy industry. It's going by the rules -- certification, seniority, recommendations; it's expensive to break protocol now, but it's profitable to follow. It's a good time to mentor and find mentoring, teaching, publishing in your field. If you're building your own school or methodology, the Hierophant suggests that you set it up with standards: certification turns opinion into a system.","love":"Here, the card almost always speaks of marriage: an offer made in front of a family, a ring worn in ritual, a union recognized by both parties. It blesses couples willing to go from \"meet\" to \"we are family,\" including legal and church decorations. The value of the period is shared values: the convergence of views on money, children and holidays is stronger than passion.","health":"Taurus is associated with the throat and neck: take care of the throat, watch the thyroid gland, do not overextend your voice. The card favors classical medicine: an experienced doctor, proven protocols, a sanatorium for the purpose work better than exotic methods. The regime helps - food and sleep by the clock literally cure. From prevention, it is ideal to leisurely walks, moderate food and refusal to self-medicate \"on the advice of a friend\" in favor of qualified care.","esoteric":"The way of Vab, the nail, connects Hokmah and Hesed: that which binds wisdom with mercy into the stable construction of tradition. The Hierophant is the hierophant of the Eleusinian mysteries: he is not a god, but an intermediary who introduces the initiate into the hall. In practice, this is the lass of teachers and transmission lines - choose a school and a mentor as you choose the keys to your home."},"reversed":{"short":"Crisis of trust in institutions: rules no longer make sense, dogma reveals falsehood – a person has to choose between a loud rebellion against the system and quiet personal faith without intermediaries.","keywords":["dogmatism","revolt","false-guru","lack of freedom","personality","crisis"],"archetype":"The inverted Hierophant is the collapse of authority. A person finds himself for years following rules no one has believed in for a long time: ceremonies without meaning, rules without reason, titles without rights. The reactions range from quiet retreat into personal spirituality to loud rebellion against all traditions at once, with the same risk of pouring the baby with water.\n\nThe other side of the card is the false guru: the teacher who demands submission instead of understanding, the system that passes dogma for truth, the group where doubt is equated with betrayal. Arcana offers a fundamental revision: which of the rules you have adopted are really yours? Keep the essence and replace the shell - a faith that has grown out of experience, stronger than inherited furniture.","daily":"In everyday life, the day of breaking the usual scenarios: family ritual suddenly seemed meaningless, \"so it is\" causes irritation, and the requests of relatives are protests. A good time to honestly re-assemble the way: leave what works, and abandon the performances for others. Careful with demonstrative decency - freedom does not have to be noisy. In the evening, talk to older people in a human way, without the role of obedient or rebellique: behind the ritual there is often a simple need for contact.","career":"At work, the card shows a conflict with corporate culture: instructions written for another era, bosses substituting meaning for regulations, KPI instead of business. You can leave the system — change your profession, your practice, freelancing — or internal emigration, which is worse than leaving. If you are the leader, check if you require obedience where you need understanding. The constructive way is to propose new rules officially: the inverted Hierophant respects not rebellion, but reform.","love":"In relationships, arcana often means a union that doesn't fit into the pattern: age, religion, status, \"unconventional\" family composition, and the pressure of an environment that requires conformity. A couple faces a choice: live their own story or someone else's script. There may be a crisis of loyalty to tradition within marriage, where the roles of \"husband\" and \"wife\" are fulfilled and people in them have long been lost. A healthy solution is to rewrite the contract together: customs should serve the couple, not the couple customs.","health":"The body reacts to the incarceration of the throat and neck: the lump in the throat of the unspoken, hoarseness, clamps from the eternal \"hold on well.\" The psychosomatics of this arcana is illness from living in someone else's scenario: the symptoms recede when the person stops playing the imposed role. Be more discerning with \"proven folk\" methods and fashionable cleansing systems - the inverted Hierophant trades them as well.","esoteric":"The spiritually inverted Vav is a line of transmission, torn or altered: a teacher who usurped the space between man and truth, a tradition that became a cell for the spirit. The card warns of sectarianism in all garb, from religious to business-esoteric, and revenge on the system at the cost of one's own soul. The practical way out is direct connection: texts without intermediaries, practice without entourage, personal experience as a supreme commentary. A true teacher, after testing, rejoices in your independence."}},{"id":"major-06","name_ru":"The Lovers","name_en":"","type":"major","suit":null,"number":6,"img":"major-06-lovers.webp","element":"Air","astro":"Twins.","upright":{"short":"A heart choice made honestly: a union in which love coincides with values and a yes decision to one person simultaneously speaks the mind, feelings and actions without looking back.","keywords":["love","heart-select","harmony","union","commonality","attraction","sincerity"],"archetype":"Adam and Eve stand under the wings of the archangel Raphael, the healer; behind Eve, the tree of knowledge with the serpent; behind Adam, the twelve lights of the tree of life; Waite’s card is not so much about romance as it is about choice: the conscious preference of one path, one person, one value system over all others.\n\nThe Gemini nature of the arcana adds a second story, the meeting of opposites: the male and the female, the mind and body, freedom and intimacy are connected not by erasing differences, but by their agreement. In the equation, Lovers mean the harmony that comes when a decision is made without self-deception: heart, mind and action look in the same direction.","daily":"It's a day of choice between \"need\" and \"want\" -- the card tells you to listen to the second one if the first one isn't a security issue; it's nice to meet friends, reconcile after quarrels, have dinners together and buy for two; it's a good time to decide on a solution that you've been through for a long time: options are explored, it's time to say \"yes\" to one and \"thank you no\" to the other; give the evening to your loved ones - the phone will wait.","career":"In work, lovers often mean a choice of proposition: two positions, two customers, two paths of development, and both look decent. Choose a value match, not just a number: the card warns that compromise will cost you dearly later. Partnerships, joint projects, deals that are beneficial to both parties are favorable. Colleagues are friendly; negotiations are better conducted in the logic of \"we should both benefit\" rather than in the fight for the last word.","love":"The main plot is a meaningful encounter: a kindred spirit, in which you want to become better, not more comfortable next to a person. For couples, this is a period of harmony and decisions - to move together, marry, plan children: the union receives a blessing. For singles, the likelihood of fateful acquaintance, often through friends or on a trip. The shadow side is triangles and temptations: the card honestly shows that any choice is worthwhile, and advises not to try to sit on two chairs.","health":"The harmony card is good for the state: the body responds to joy, chronic reactions subside when internal conflict is resolved. The psychosomatics of lovers are diseases from unspoken and unlived choices: while the heart is in two places, the symptoms hold. Couple practices help - dancing, yoga together, walking for a long conversation.","esoteric":"The way of Zayin, the sword, connects Bina and Tiferet: choice always cuts off, and that's his power. Archangel Raphael makes the arcana a card of healing through union -- when opposites recognize each other, the tension that fueled the disease goes away. In alchemy, it's a sacred marriage, a compound of mercury and sulfur, giving birth to the philosopher's stone."},"reversed":{"short":"Discord: values diverge, choices are postponed for later, and temptation offers what one wants without conscience – a card requires honest certainty instead of sitting on two chairs at once.","keywords":["squabbling","temptation","hesitation","disharmony","treason","choice-shift"],"archetype":"Inverted lovers are mismatched. Outwardly, the couple may persist, but the values have already diverged: different goals, different truths, talking only about everyday life. Or it's avoidance of choice, the person keeps two options open, without giving himself to anyone, and calls this position freedom.\n\nThe classic third story is seduction: a situation where you want to take what you want without your principles. The card warns that the cost of such a gain is self-respect, and it is more expensive. Arkan offers an honest audit: where I am not living my life? A gap made in truth heals faster than a union supported by lies.","daily":"In everyday life, the internal swing: you want the opposite at the same time, decisions are postponed, and small choices - what to eat, where to go, who to answer - are swelled to excruciating. Check if you are living under someone else's script: the schedule drawn up by others is especially annoying today. A good move is a small honest \"no\": one person, one habit, one imposed business.","career":"At work, the card indicates a conflict of values: a project that is profitable but unpleasant; a team that is good but a product that is shameful; the offer is big but the company is foreign; to accept such an offer for fear of emptiness is to plant a bomb on your own motivation; there are also intrigues: alliance against a colleague, flirting with a customer for the sake of a contract - short-term gain, long-term damage to reputation.","love":"In a relationship, inverted lovers are cooling and disengaging: intimacy is kept in habit, passion is left to a third person or fantasy, and conversation about the main thing is constantly postponed. There is a situation of choice between two people — or between a relationship and the freedom that a person is afraid to lose. Treason here is not always the bed: more often it is an emotional withdrawal when the heart has moved and things have not yet. Arcana requires honesty: to decide, even if the certainty is painful, it still treats better than uncertainty.","health":"Bodily internal conflict is reflected primarily in the heart and nervous system: arrhythmias amid anxiety, pressure surges, insomnia with thoughts of “suddenly.” Chronic indecision keeps the body on constant alert — hence fatigue that does not go away after the weekend. Helps reduce internal bifurcation: one main priority, one honest conversation, one accepted price. Practice what connects the mind and body — massage, dance, breathing with an emphasis on long exhalation.","esoteric":"The spiritually inverted Zayin is a sword turned on itself: a choice not made in time cuts off the slow one. The card points to the gap between the path and life: the person practices the sublime, and everyday life remains false, and this gap eats up the power. It is possible to work with the shadows of the union - projections on the partner when he loves his own fantasy. The practice of healing - confession to yourself: give each of your desire a price and decide whether you pay it consciously."}},{"id":"major-07","name_ru":"The Chariot","name_en":"","type":"major","suit":null,"number":7,"img":"major-07-chariot.webp","element":"Water","astro":"Cancer","upright":{"short":"Will has ridden opposites: confident movement to victory where you hold the steering wheel; concentration, discipline and noble pressure lead to success faster than blind luck.","keywords":["victory","will","control","forward","ambition","self-control","triumph"],"archetype":"The chariot stands under a stellar canopy; the chariot in a crown with a laurel and eight-pointed stars holds not the reins — there are none at all — but the scepter. Two sphinxes, black and white, he maintains the balance of his will: opposites pull apart exactly until the driver becomes a single center.\n\nThis is the lark of offensive energy after the Lovers' internal choice: direction taken, now speed. The card means victories achieved by concentration, not luck: the city is taken because no one from within has interfered with movement. Cancer nature adds a motive of defense - Chariot most often rushes forward for those whom it loves.","daily":"Traffic day: travel, business meetings, transportation decisions -- all the arguments, if you're driving literally and figuratively. It's good to start things that require pressure: a call you've been avoiding, a conversation you've been honest with, a training session you've been working on. Plan your route in advance -- rushing to this card is dangerously fraught.","career":"The arcana is the career leap: a project where you set the pace; a contest, a tender, a new market. Victory is achievable, but not for nothing; the chariot requires total concentration and no spraying. Lead hard, but fair: the team must know the route and the reward. Great expansion times — business trips, branches, foreign cities. And watch your opponents: the victory card is not liked by everyone.","love":"In relationships, Chariot gives you the dynamic: a stormy romance, joint roads, couples who move, build and conquer - together and quickly. The card promises single people familiarity in motion: the road, the gym, the airport, a friend's car. In a couple, it is important to synchronize the steering wheels: if one pulls into the city and the other into the mountains, quarrels become regular.","health":"The energy is powerful, but it's shocking: you can get hurt from rushing, stretching, you can get clamps in your back from the steering wheel and the office chair. The card is good for the sport of achievement -- races, competitions, body-to-season -- the goal disciplines better than persuasion. Cancer controls your stomach: in stressful races, keep digestion safe, eat regularly, not on the run. Good recovery time from injuries -- schedule movement brings you back into shape faster than you expect.","esoteric":"The Heth Way, the \"fences,\" connects Bina and Gebura: the will that shields the field of victory from chaos. The two sphinxes, the light and the dark, make the Chariot a card of hermetic equilibrium: power flows through someone who does not identify with either of the opposites. The stars on the canopy are a celestial mandate: the victory is given more easily by the top."},"reversed":{"short":"Horses have suffered or stood up: there is a lot of energy, there is no direction, aggression burns fuel in vain, and circumstances, rivals or their own raging emotions have taken control of the situation.","keywords":["loss of control","aggression","forcefulness","slip-up","resistance","goalless"],"archetype":"Inverted Chariot: Horses are carried or standing up. Energy is there, no direction: throwing between targets, aggression on the ground, a road spent bypassing traffic jams of his own character. In another version, towing: the person has learned, gathered, announced the start - and does not move, because fear runs from the inside.\n\nThe card also warns of a loss of control over a situation they thought they were: competitors, circumstances, or their own emotions have seized the reins; the advice of the arcana is to return to the center: less gas, more steering wheel; sometimes the winning action today is to stop and fix the chariot, rather than prove speed with a broken axle.","daily":"In everyday life, you're running around, you're getting annoyed by traffic jams, you're getting hurt by loved ones, and in the evening you can't remember where the day went, and there's a high cost of rushing -- fines, bruises, broken things -- and the opposite is possible: paralysis before a case that's long overdue is a \"time to start\" -- camping without leaving. The best strategy is one direction for a day and deliberately slow pace: speed will return when management returns.","career":"At work, the card draws a campaign without strategy: maximum activity, minimum results; the department fights with the next department, and the client goes to the one who is calm; you can intercept control - the project is taken away, the team is reassigned, your rules of the game have been changed without warning. Aggressive pressure is now harmful: force without direction reads like panic.","love":"In a relationship, an inverted Chariot is a race and a braking act at the same time: the partner pushes, rushes events, makes checks with jealousy, or, on the contrary, the union stalls on the spot - talk about moving goes on for years. The card advises single people to cool down: desperate hunting scares away those who are interesting. In a couple, a fight for the wheel is dangerous: two drivers in the same car break twice as fast. Hand the steering wheel to where you have competence, agree on the route - and remove your elbows.","health":"The body signals overheating of the system: pressure surges, insomnia from overexcitation, exacerbation of gastritis and ulcers — the stomach suffers first from racing and repressed anger. There are injuries from rushing and sports to wear out: ligaments do not keep up with ambition. When towing — the reverse picture: stagnation, swelling, weight gain from sedentary anxiety. Treatment — rhythm: regularity instead of records, eating in peace, sports with pleasure, sleep as a strategic task.","esoteric":"The spiritually inverted Heth is a fence without gates or gates without fences: the force is either locked in fear or dissolved without a channel. The card indicates a struggle with oneself, disguised as a struggle with the world: external enemies are a projection of the internal split of the Sphinxes. In practice, it warns of afterburning: accelerated techniques taken without preparation break the channel, not advance."}},{"id":"major-08","name_ru":"Strength","name_en":"","type":"major","suit":null,"number":8,"img":"major-08-strength.webp","element":"Fire","astro":"Lev Lev","upright":{"short":"The real power is soft: the beast is tamed not by whiplash, but by calm breathing and patience; endurance, self-control and compassion take what the hardest pressure would not take.","keywords":["inner","softness","patience","passion-taming","courage","self-control","compassion"],"archetype":"A woman in a wreath of roses effortlessly closes the lion's mouth; the infinity sign above her head says that the source of this power is not muscles. The lion is our passions, instincts and fears; they are tamed not by prohibition, but by tame: the beast gives strength to those who do not fear or humiliate him.\n\nAfter the victory chariot, the arcana teaches the next level of skill: to win without fighting. It's the resilience of long-term tension, the ability to withstand the anger of others without responding in kind, to remain calm where the fists would be easier. The card promises that gentleness in this story is not weakness, but the highest form of control.","daily":"A day when the little things are annoying: traffic jams, queues, other people's slowness — the card offers a training of self-control instead of a flashback. There are things that require patience: long conversations with children and the elderly, monotonous work, caring for animals and plants. A great day to apologize first or to extinguish an incipient quarrel with a smile. In the evening — physical discharge: accumulated in a day will find a way out of itself, if not helped.","career":"At work, arcana means a situation where the result is not pressure, but influence: a complex client, a capricious manager, a conflicting colleague — everyone copes with a calm, consistent tone. Favorable time for painstaking tasks that require endurance: long negotiations, training newcomers, quietly correcting other people's mistakes without public confrontation. But do not confuse patience with endless compliance: mark boundaries quietly and firmly.","love":"In relationships, Strength is the art of taking a partner alive: with a character, habits and moods, without trying to rewrite him to yourself. The card is good for couples in turbulence: tenderness and humor extinguish quarrels more effectively than judging who is right. For single people, she advises you to look at restrained adults next to you, not spectacular lions: passion is tested for years, not the first date. Shadow is to endure the unacceptable: to tame the beast does not mean to live in a moat.","health":"The card is about the heart and the spine, which is what rocks and holds: back exercises and soft cardio in joyful mode are useful. The emotional component is more important than stress: chronic suppression of anger hits the heart and blood pressure more noticeable than fatty foods. A good period for dealing with addictions: daily soft struggle with habit wins jerks and breaks.","esoteric":"The way of Tet, the snakes, connects Gebura and Hesed: a force flowing between severity and mercy, like a snake between stones. The lion and the infinity sign make the arcana a card of working with fire energy: breathing practices, working with instincts, everything where power requires tame, not locking."},"reversed":{"short":"Failure to control the beast: outbursts of anger and rash actions, for which then shame, or suppressed emotions, self-doubt and resource, exhausted to the bottom.","keywords":["self-doubt","breakdown","emotion-suppression","exhaustion","uncertainty","rawness"],"archetype":"The reversed Force is a malfunction of the beast. The first scenario is that the lion has broken out -- outbursts of anger, breakdowns, rash acts that are then shameful. The second is that the lion is on chains -- emotions are crushed, desires are forbidden, the person lives on pain-relieving wills and calls it calm.\n\nOften, the card speaks of a compromised confidence: the eternal comparison of oneself with others, the imposter syndrome, the fear of appearing weak, which is masked by rudeness and painful acquiescence. Energyly, this exhaustion is a resource that has been taken on credit for too long. Arkan advises against heroizing survival: recovery is also a work of strength, sometimes the most difficult.","daily":"In everyday life, the day of low brightness: everything is infuriating, any \"no\" is perceived as a personal insult, and there is no strength to restrain yourself, hence the breakdowns on cashiers and loved ones. Or vice versa: apathy, when even the series watch laziness, and desires are silent. The first means is to slow down before it breaks: sleep, food, water, no important conversations on the hungry nerve. The second is a small honest pleasure without excuses: it brings to life faster than self-flage.","career":"At work, the inverted Force is a resource at zero: tasks that were easy yesterday are annoying today, mistakes are falling over loss of concentration; there may be a crisis of confidence after public failure: criticism beats harder than usual, and hands drop; dangerous and the reverse strategy is to push, scream, push: short-term work, long-term burns the team and you.","love":"In relationships, the card shows two damages: flashes and humiliations, after which the loved one walks quietly, or complete numbness of feelings when both live as neighbors. Jealousy and possessiveness are typical masks of fear of “I’m not good enough.” And there is also fatigue from patience: for years, the corners were smoothed out, and today the cup is overflowing.","health":"Bodily suppressed or raging elements hit the heart, blood vessels and hormonal system: panic attacks, tremors, lumps in the throat, appetite swings. Chronic self-repression is a known factor of hypertension and digestive problems: the body continues to scream until it is heard. Immunity decreases - everything that was dormant worsens. The arcana recipe: daily gentle discharge of anger - sports, paper, screaming in the car - full sleep and abandoning the role of the eternal hero: recovery begins with permission to be tired.","esoteric":"The spiritually upside down Tet is a snake biting its tail: energy locked in fear or released unconscious. The card indicates a fear of its own power: a person feels the beast in himself and therefore keeps him hungry, and a hungry beast sooner or later tears the chain. In practice, it warns of violent awakening techniques — forced work with fire burns."}},{"id":"major-09","name_ru":"The Hermit","name_en":"","type":"major","suit":null,"number":9,"img":"major-09-hermit.webp","element":"Earth","astro":"Virgo","upright":{"short":"The lantern is raised above, and is seen further: solitude, the search for truth, and wisdom that matures in silence; time to step away from the noise, to put aside the urgent and finally to hear your own answer.","keywords":["solitude","sense","wisdom","light","silence","mentorship","depth"],"archetype":"The elder stands on top, lighting the path with a lantern that shines with a six-pointed star, the seal of Solomon, and he came up here not from poverty but from saturation: the world was lived, and now what remains is sought after: the staff is the support of the path, the snow underfoot is the silence in which the main thing is heard.\n\nThe hermit is the lap of pause between the heads of life: the retreat is not an escape, but a pilgrimage inwards. He comes when the answers are no longer outside — in advice, news, entertainment — and the only unexplored territory is the inner one. His gift is depth: what they find themselves will never be taken away.","daily":"A day with you is good for you: disassemble archives, photos, books, clean up files and thoughts, walk alone without headphones, keep a diary, keep your phone away, answer the questions \"why is so silent\" gently: you just need silence, and that's okay.","career":"At work, the Hermit is a time of individual expertise: analysis, auditing, research, anything that is done in silence and requires depth, not speed. Perhaps a temporary separation from the team — remote, studying, working on your own methodology; do not think of it as excommunication. A good period to become a consultant: experience accumulated in noise now sells better in silence.","love":"In love, the arcana is rarely easy: it talks about the distance that at least one of the two needs - a pause for reflection, separate rooms, a trip alone. Couples who can give each other air come closer from this period; couples who perceive silence as a threat - with a crack. For singles, the Hermit advises not to force the search: now it is more valuable to understand why you need a relationship. The shadow - to turn \"personal space\" into a fortress from which they do not even come to the call of love.","health":"The card indicates the need to reduce the workload: regime, sleep, fasting menu, pauses between business — the body asks not for heroism, but for silence. The girl's connection with digestion will remind you that food is calm, food in anxiety is harmful. A good period for a sanatorium, a full examination, work with a psychologist — everything thoughtful and systemic.","esoteric":"The Yod Way, the hands, connects Tiferet and Yesod: the light, compressed into a point, becomes the seed of the next cycle. The lantern with Solomon's seal makes the Hermit the patron of the inner teacher, the voice that recognizes as its own after years of testing. In tradition, it is the lair of initiation through loneliness: not all truths are conveyed by words. Meditation on it is the practice of silence: even twenty minutes without incoming information gives the mind that silence in which direction is heard."},"reversed":{"short":"The solitude has become a trap: isolation is prolonged, suspicion replaces the living world, silence no longer cures - the hermit has forgotten that his lantern exists for people walking in the dark.","keywords":["isolation","loneliness","isolation","flight","suspicion","pause"],"archetype":"The upside down Hermit is a retreat that has ceased to be a choice. The isolation is prolonged: the person stays in the house for weeks, cuts off contacts and calls it independence, and keeps him there fear or old resentment, the light of the lantern narrows to a ray of suspicion, people seem either a threat or unworthy.\n\nThere may be a second skew: the perpetual seeker collecting teachings and solitudes to never complete anything and let no one in. Or the person who has run away into a noise to avoid being left alone with questions. Arcana suggests going back to the middle: silence is needed dosed — like salt, not air.","daily":"In everyday life, the days go by the same way: home, work, home, text, read and unanswered, meetings canceled for the fourth time in a row. First, it's comfort, then it's a cage that you built yourself. Notice if conversations are reduced to correspondence, and leaving the apartment requires overcoming. The antidote is simple and unpleasant: one live contact a day - a voice call, coffee to a person, a queue in which you stand, not a courier.","career":"At work, the inverted Hermit is professional isolation: you've been cut off from the exchange of information, or you've rejected everything new yourself, defending \"your method.\" Expertise without contact degrades: the market has gone forward, you argue with the version of five years ago. It's possible to go into the shadows after a conflict - silently fulfilling the minimum, which reads as a piece of firing.","love":"In a relationship, the card shows a wall: the partner is next to you, but everyone is in their room; conversations are replaced by everyday life and intimacy by politeness; or it is loneliness after a breakup, prolonged beyond all time: resentment guards the door better than any lock; the upside-down Hermit honestly says to single people, you are not “not yet met by that,” you do not go out where they are met.","health":"Isolation has a precise physiology: sun and movement deficits, vitamin D below normal, sleep disturbances, depressive episodes, compromised immunity. Self-diagnosis in the four walls is insidious: the Internet finds diseases that don't exist and misses those that do exist, go to a living doctor. Particular attention to prolonged melancholy: if the grayness of the days has become the background for more than a month, it's a medical issue, not a character.","esoteric":"Spiritually upside down Yod is a hand clenched in a fist: the light received for transmission is held and smoldering. The card points to a false recluse -- a proud \"I am above this world\" behind which the fear of intimacy hides -- and to reclusiveness as an escape from the incomplete. The teachings obtained in silence are tested by the service: if knowledge does not return to people, it dies."}},{"id":"major-10","name_ru":"Wheel of Fortune","name_en":"","type":"major","suit":null,"number":10,"img":"major-10-wheel-of-fortune.webp","element":"Fire","astro":"Jupiter","upright":{"short":"The wheel turned: fate changes the frame, and luck favors those who managed to grab the rim - ahead of a fateful meeting, a sudden proposal and a turn of circumstances for the better.","keywords":["fate","fortune","cycle","change","turning point","karma","fateful meeting"],"archetype":"There's a huge wheel in the sky with the letters of the name of God and the word TORA; on the disk itself, there's a sphinx at the top, a serpent Typhon at the bottom, and Hermanubis with a staff rising with the turn. At the corners of the card, there are four cherubim with books: laws remain as long as chance rotates. This is the most eventful lasan of the deck: life takes the next frame.\n\nJupiterian nature gives a generous twist: change is more often in favor of the one who is ready. A card means a favorable coincidence, a fateful encounter, a sudden offer - something that can not be ordered, but can be earned by readiness. Its wisdom is in discernment: the wheel spins situations, but not you; the center remains yours if you do not give it.","daily":"A day of surprises: plans change, and it's better to meet it as a plot, not a disaster. Keep the schedule air, unbuilt windows, in which fate will make its way. Accept an unexpected invitation, respond to a random message, buy a ticket if it suddenly becomes cheaper: small turns today add up to a large pattern.","career":"In your career, it's a turning point card: a sudden offer, a reorganization, a new market, a chance that won't happen again. Act fast but not fussily -- the wheel lifts those who are already holding onto it, and your willingness is counted as merit. Good career lotteries time: contests, grants, public bids -- the odds of success are higher than usual.","love":"In love, the Wheel is fateful: an encounter that happened \"accidentally,\" a return from the past, a sudden turn where everything seemed clear. For singles, it is a sign of increased mobility - fate introduces on the road, at events, through friends of friends, not in the sofa silence. For couples, the card promises a renewal of the cycle: a second honeymoon or honest conversation, after which everything changes.","health":"The card suggests that you should take a regime change in peace: moving, season, new schedule — your body is now easily rebuilt if you don't resist it. A good time to change your health approach: a new doctor or a random course turns out to be accurate. Jupiter warns of excesses — liver, weight and appetite require action, especially during the holiday weeks.","esoteric":"The Kaf Path, the palms, connects Hesed and Netzah: destiny is the grip the universe holds us and we hold on to it. The Sphinx at the top of the wheel is the knowledge that keeps the balance on the spin; Typhon at the bottom is the force of decay, without which a new turn is impossible. In practice, the arcana corresponds to working with rhythms: astrological transits, lunar cycles, start times. Meditation on the Wheel fosters equatitude - the ability to remain the center while both take and fall go along the rim."},"reversed":{"short":"The rim has sunk: a streak of bad luck and delays, resistance to inevitable change and bets against the flow; they do not argue with the rhythm of life - they wait for it, accumulating strength for a new turn.","keywords":["setback","change-resistance","entanglement","bad-moment","gamble","pressure"],"archetype":"The inverted wheel is the phase where the rim sags: delays, cancellations, \"not in time,\" events drag along like the tide of an inept swimmer. Often it's resistance to change that still happens: the person holds onto the obsolete -- the position, the relationship, the old version of himself -- and the spin turns into grinding.\n\nThe card warns of another: trying to beat fate, from casinos to adventurous schemes. At the bottom of the wheel, it is cold for anyone who has been there by stupidity, not by cycle. The advice of the arcana is simple: distinguish between regularity and chance; do not bet everything on random. The strip will change - the wheel knows no exceptions, and this is his consolation.","daily":"In everyday life, a day of minor disruptions: meetings that fail, a technique that picks the moment to break, money that goes into the unexpected. Don't take it personally, it's the weather, not the sentence; slow down the stakes and the pace, duplicate the important. Give up gambling decisions -- lottery tickets, spontaneous big purchases, arguments -- humor and a backup plan will help: whoever laughs at the wheel rolls softer than the one who curses every spoke.","career":"At work, the card draws a long time: projects freeze, decisions are postponed, efforts are not converted into results, and the temptation to rush anywhere if something happens is great. It is a trap: change pushed through the recession phase costs twice as much. Check if you are holding on to a place that has long stopped growing, the wheel removes those who are stuck in the rim with their teeth.","love":"In a relationship, the inverted Wheel is a band where both carry: quarrels in circles, returning to the same topic, \"as much as possible\" - or an external storm that hits the union: moving without consent, family intervention, circumstances are stronger than plans. For single people, she advises not to draw conclusions about love from an unsuccessful period: now lie the calendar and circumstances, not your chances. It is important for couples not to make decisions at the bottom of the cycle: wait for the rise and assess the relationship soberly.","health":"Bodily period is unstable: exacerbations come \"in bad time\", treatment stalls, tests jump - do not change dramatically the scheme and doctors because of one bad week. Liver, metabolism and weight are vulnerable: Jupiter excesses in the bad streak beat more noticeable. Careful with self-medication \"miracle courses\" - excitement in health matters is expensive.","esoteric":"The spiritually inverted Kaf is a hand-wrestling struggle: a person argues with the rhythm in which he lives and calls it freedom. The card points to karmic trampling: the same lessons come with new faces until they are learned, and to superstitious fear of fate, paralyzing will. The practice of these weeks is to distinguish between my decision and the flow; the first is all will; the second is trust without drama."}},{"id":"major-11","name_ru":"Justice","name_en":"","type":"major","suit":null,"number":11,"img":"major-11-justice.webp","element":"Air","astro":"Libra","upright":{"short":"The arc of honesty: nothing disappears without a trace, and the decision will be made on the merits, not on sympathy.","keywords":["fairness","truth","responsibility","cause and effect","law","impartiality","balance"],"archetype":"Justice is the lark of precision calculation. The sword in the raised hand says, the decision is final, the scales in the left hand say that the cold logic is balanced by intuition. In the world of this card, nothing dissolves in the air: every deed, word, even unspoken intention returns to its author.\n\nWhen it falls, the time to pretend is over, and the circumstances are such that the facts fall into place, and with them you have to acknowledge your own role in what happened, not punishment or tribunal, but the restoration of broken order.\n\nThe arcana associated with Libra teaches you to see the dispute on both sides and choose not convenient, but the right one.","daily":"The day is good for settling the agreements: pay back the debt, close the formalities, re-read the terms of the contract before signing. The overdue domestic dispute — about money, schedule, duties — will be resolved by discussing the case, not feelings. Everything that is now divided equally, will no longer be a cause for grievances.","career":"Cases require legal precision: write down agreements, prepare for audits, certifications, or compensation negotiations, and the outcome will be objective, especially if your hands are clean. The card protects lawyers, auditors, intermediaries, and anyone who makes personnel decisions: the promotion will come as a measure of merit.","love":"Relationships are tested for honesty, and it's time to talk about not who loves whom more, but whether the union is fair: who invests, who uses, what everyone really expects, and it takes away the accumulated grievances better than any reconciliation, and promises lonely people to meet with a mature and decent person — often associated with law or older.","health":"The body reminds us of balance: exercise and rest must balance each other, otherwise the body will count. Attention zone — kidneys, lower back, skin; a good moment for examination and a second, sober opinion instead of self-diagnosis. Recovery is now smooth, if you follow the doctor's prescriptions.","esoteric":"Esoterically, it's the arcanum of karmic accounting: the evening inventory of the day -- without excuses or self-flagellation -- is markedly leveling events. The scales of the figure are correlated with the Egyptian Maat, whose pen weighs the soul after death. In practice, the image of the sword is used to cut off lies: the point cuts illusions, and the firm hand holds only what you really own."},"reversed":{"short":"Libra tilted: bias, avoidance of uncomfortable issues and decisions made in other people's interests.","keywords":["bias","self-deception","evasion","dishonesty","red tape","skew"],"archetype":"Inverted Justice is a trial that has been held without you or against you, and someone else's merits are written in someone else's column, someone else's mistakes are hanging on you.\n\nOften, the card describes the internal accuser: a person judges himself more severely than any tribunal, drags not his cargo - or, conversely, self-justifies and shifts the blame outside until the lesson is learned.\n\nArcan warns that an attempt to circumvent the law – state, human or karmic – will result in a double count.","daily":"There may be confusion in documents and promises: double-check bills, receipts, oral agreements — anything that is not fixed risks being interpreted against you. Disputes with utilities and sellers will take longer than it would cost. Large purchases postpone: today's price does not reflect values.","career":"There's a lot of unfairness at work, with the bonus being sympathetic, the mistake being overblown, the idea being misnamed, the formal process getting dragged out or complicated -- keep copies of documents and get a lawyer in. A separate warning is for you: a little bit of \"trick\" with reporting will end up being checked, and one-sided decisions today are better not made at all.","love":"The pair accumulates a score of mutual claims: one gives, the other takes for granted, and both keep silent about inequality. The past is used as a weapon in current disputes, jealousy is dressed up as care - such an exchange \"justly\" kills intimacy. It can be a heavy division of property and mutual friends.","health":"The symptoms confuse you and the doctors: diagnoses change one by one, treatment fails to work — look for the reason deeper than the first appointments. The body signals chronic imbalance: unilateral exertion, lack of sleep, attempts to drown out stress with alcohol. Second opinion is mandatory, self-medication now plays the role of a biased judge.","esoteric":"In magical work, the card points to unclosed karmic accounts, tribal stories where someone has been lied to or stripped of their own, and cleansing won't work until they've done an honest review of their own actions: first confession, then absolution. The amulets of justice are now weak; the most powerful thing is not to participate in other people's intrigues."}},{"id":"major-12","name_ru":"The Hanged Man","name_en":"","type":"major","suit":null,"number":12,"img":"major-12-hanged-man.webp","element":"Water","astro":"Neptune","upright":{"short":"A voluntary pause that changes everything: the world viewed upside down is a very different place.","keywords":["pause","new-look","let-off","sacrifice","suspension","enlightenment"],"archetype":"The hanged man hangs from the living tree calmly and almost blissfully, of his own choosing, not as a punishment, but as a stop for insight: while life is frozen, the eye learns to see the upside down as straight.\n\nIn the scenario, the card says, it's useless and harmful to force events, and it's not about action that you need to change your optics, and sometimes you just need to flip the problem so that the answer becomes obvious, and the pause is not a waste of time, but an investment of time.\n\nArcana is connected with the subject of voluntary sacrifice: stepping back for two, giving up the small for the main, and whoever can hang in the uncertainty without panic comes out with a gift that is not accessible to the horny.","daily":"The day asks you to slow down: move an important purchase, don't send a written heated letter, let the situation persist. It's good to take a break from the usual route - a walk, the other end of the city, someone else's hobby refreshes your eyes. What in the morning seemed like a problem, by the evening may be just an unfortunate angle.","career":"The project is stalled, the partners are silent, the results are not moving, and the card suggests that we take a pause -- rethink the approach, gather the missing information, do what was postponed, and an active assault now will yield less than patient retraining.","love":"Relationships need a break, not a revolution: stop demanding immediate answers and look at the partner from the outside with their circumstances, their fears, their love language. Sometimes a sincere concession, even the sacrifice of time and comfort, melts the ice faster than the clarification. The lonely card hints that while you are in love with your own script, the real person passes by unnoticed.","health":"Your body asks for a recovery mode: sleep, water, slowing down. Chronic stress is not treated with heroic exercise, but with relaxation — yoga, massage, swimming are good. Diagnosis may require rechecking: take your first test, the picture will clear up later.","esoteric":"At a deep level, it's the initiatory arcana, the initiate suspended between heaven and earth to see the world from the inside out. Yoga, meditation in inverted postures, the practice of mindful pause between inhalation and exhalation, all have the same effect -- shifting perspective. The Isa Rune and the principle of standing in the flow are close to his spirit: strength is born from stillness."},"reversed":{"short":"The hanging was prolonged: the pause from fruitful turned into a swamp, and the sacrifice into a vain one.","keywords":["entanglement","sacrifice","resistance","martyrdom","hesitation","stagnation"],"archetype":"The upside down Hanged Man is the one who hangs not by choice but by inertia. The pause, conceived as a strategy, has become a way of hiding from the decision; the person waits for life to take him off the tree.\n\nThe second facet is ostentatious sacrifice: to suffer on display, to collect gratitude for something that no one asked for, a martyr of this kind does not want an outlet because the role feeds him attention.\n\nArcan warns that the world has changed its perspective, and you look the old way. Until the extra is released, the new does not enter - suspension without a purpose turns into emptiness.","daily":"The day falls into procrastination, with things hanging for weeks, little things swelling into rubble, see if you're doing too much for those who are used to taking it in silence, unload the task list to three points and do it -- any movement down to the ground is now more healing than a beautiful hanging.","career":"At work, you're making it a strategy: projects don't move because no one wants to make a decision, and you might be making sacrifices for someone else's outcome -- overwork, other people's tasks, promises that they'll appreciate later -- and the card tells you to say the price of your patience out loud or get out of the hang.","love":"The relationship is stuck in a perpetual waiting: the partner is not ready, the conversation is postponed, you live in a pause that no one wants, sacrifice is not a virtue, but a way to avoid the honest question of whether you really need this relationship, and if you give more than you get, and be proud of it, the card suggests taking the halo and talking straight.","health":"The long-term waiting pattern is hitting the body: lethargy, swelling, stagnant sedentary behavior, exacerbations that last for months, treatment rushes halfway through, it's assigned, it's abandoned, it takes the discipline of simple actions: moving daily, the course of therapy to the end, not heroic jerks through force.","esoteric":"In a mystical sense, inverting is a blocked initiation: a person is afraid of letting go, without which there is no transition, and clings to an old person; practitioners can slip, a gift can feel stolen; completion techniques and earthy practices are useful, walking, bodywork, bringing back into the flow."}},{"id":"major-13","name_ru":"Death","name_en":"","type":"major","suit":null,"number":13,"img":"major-13-death.webp","element":"Water","astro":"Scorpio","upright":{"short":"The end of a chapter that cannot be cancelled: the old is gone, making way for the new, is the only true guarantee of the card.","keywords":["completion","transformation","transition","let-up","inevitableness","renewal"],"archetype":"Death in the Tarot is not a grave, but a doorway. The rider on the card moves slowly and irresistibly: what must end will end regardless of our petitions. The white rose on the banner reminds us that there is a renewal hidden behind each end.\n\nIn the layout, the card announces the end of the cycle: relationships, work, life, version of yourself. Trying to hold the obsolete is more painful than the transition itself. Death spares those who do not cling: it takes shape, but not essence.\n\nIt's an arc of deep purification, and just as nature doesn't disappear, it bends into a new life, a personal story, thrown off its shoulders, becomes the ground for the next season.","daily":"A good day to take apart the closet, the closet, and the phone book is to throw away, give it away, say goodbye. Finish what's been hanging for a long time: the application, the return, the last letter. The break with the annoying habit will pass easier than usual.","career":"So, the work is changing eras: the project is closed, the team is disbanded, the profession stops feeding, the card advises not to save the drowning, but to take the experience and leave beautifully, the abrupt change — dismissal, changing the field, selling the business — now is not risk, but timeliness.","love":"Relationships have reached the point of no return: they will not be the same, either through rebirth of the union on new terms or through an honest goodbye. Clinging \"for the children,\" \"apartments\" and \"for eight years already\" prolongs agony and hurts everyone. For singles, the end of a long love affair with an inaccessible person, making room for a living feeling.","health":"The card rarely talks about physical death — often about major restructurings: surgery, treatment, abandonment of the old way of life. Chronic illness can finally be called by its name and brought under control. The period requires respect for the process: the body changes, do not rush it, but do not hide from examinations — early honesty here saves.","esoteric":"The scorpion nature of the arcanum makes it a card of initiation into the mystery of transformation: the old self dies ritually to free a larger figure. In practices, Death works with letting go -- letters that won't be sent, things that will be burned, names that will not be spoken, and she's also a patron of ancestral work and fine-tuning the heritage of the family."},"reversed":{"short":"The transition is stuck halfway: the old is already dead, but he is held by the hand and not allowed to leave the room.","keywords":["change-resistance","stagnation","clunging","lengthened","fear","unfinishedness"],"archetype":"Inverted Death is the rider who is forced to stand, change is ripe and announced many times, but the person holds on to the broken: to the relationship that works from memory, to the work that exists in the credits, to the former.\n\nThis card describes the half-life in the hallway between the rooms: the door is closed back, the front is not open, and the handle is swinging all the time, and the longer the delay, the tougher the final push.\n\nSometimes it shows the opposite – too frequent, superficial “dyings”: a person burns bridges over trifles, avoiding the only real transition that is truly terrible.","daily":"Life gets overgrown with nuisances: repairs are in the middle, things of the dead are in half rooms, letters accumulate for months without answer. A day requires one decisive throw-out, physical or paper. Stuck questions will not be solved by themselves: the longer you pass them by, the more expensive the final bill will be.","career":"Professional stagnation with symptoms of collapse: salaries are delayed, projects are folded, and everyone is holding on to a sinking place for fear of change. The card honestly warns: there is nothing to save, saving energy to prepare for the new is more profitable than heroic defense. There is also an internal option - a job that you secretly hate for years, but do not dare to leave.","love":"The relationship is inertia: the couple have long since broken up morally, but continue to share homes and holidays. Each new round of quarrels repeats the old scenario - no end, no beginning. The card says directly: the held is forcibly decomposed and bullied both.","health":"Chronic conditions that are treated halfway: the course is abandoned, the symptoms are drowned out, the cause is thriving, the body is stuck in the disease as the psyche is in the old role of victim of circumstances, and another dangerous: ignoring obvious symptoms for fear of diagnosis.","esoteric":"In subtle practices, inverted death is a sign of an unclosed transition: the spirits of undetached connections, the work of loss that has been forbidden and unlived. A person can carry someone else's uncompleted grief for years. Ritual forms of completion - commemoration, a letter to the deceased, the symbolic burial of an object - open up frozen energy. Until the transition is lived, force circulates around without entering life."}},{"id":"major-14","name_ru":"Temperance","name_en":"","type":"major","suit":null,"number":14,"img":"major-14-temperance.webp","element":"Fire","astro":"Sagittarius","upright":{"short":"An angel pours water from a bowl into a bowl without a drop past: the art of mixing the inmixable with measure and patience.","keywords":["moderation","balance","patience","synthesis","middle-of-the-road","healing"],"archetype":"Temperance is an alchemist among the arcana: one foot on a stone, the other in water, and the flow between the bowls is just as much as it should be. The card states that opposites do not have to fight, fire and water, if the proportions are right, give the cure.\n\nIn the scenario, it promises a period of smooth flow: conflicts subside not because someone won, but because a formula for coexistence has been found, the results come slowly, but without cracks: everything built at that time is long.\n\nThe Sagittarius nature of the arsan guides him to a higher goal: Moderation is not the boredom of the ascetic, but the precision of the archer saving power to hit. Its law is simple: less, but better, and every day a little bit.","daily":"A quiet day without turmoil, and it's a gift: a steady rhythm, normal activities, no sudden turns. It's good to clean up your diet and regime, gently negotiate with a difficult person. Everything you start requires dosage: little by little, but every day - that's how repairs and health are done.","career":"The processes align: controversial projects get a balanced plan, divisional conflicts converge on compromise; the best time for negotiations, where you need not pressure, but neat assembly of positions, and for learning a new craft. Avoid extremes — no rushes, no downtime: steady pace is now more profitable than jerks.","love":"Relationships enter a safe haven: after storms, you want silence and warm little things. The card teaches you to connect things — his friends and yours, the city and the country, silence and conversation — into a common way without winners. A couple in crisis can recover through care without demands.","health":"One of the great recovery cards is that the body adjusts its own balance when you stop disturbing, shows diet, regimen, water, swimming, walking, a good period for rehabilitation and for going beyond extremes, both therapeutic fasting and stomach holidays, and alcohol and stimulants are especially undesirable now.","esoteric":"In the Tarot Thoth, this arcana is called Art, which is also called the alchemical stage of dissolution and connection. The meditation on water transfusion trains subtlety: how much strength to take and when to stop. The card patronizes healing, charging water, mixing traditions. Fourteen is the double five: freedom, pacified by measure."},"reversed":{"short":"The proportions are broken: something in life is overflowing, and something has long dried up.","keywords":["extremes","excess","impatience","imbalance","disorder","swing"],"archetype":"Inverted Moderation is an alchemist who drops flasks. One cup is spilled: work eats life, passion eats your head, caring for others your own resources, instead of synthesis, you get a swing from extreme to extreme.\n\nOften, the card indicates impatience: the person wants the result immediately and drains the main thing with the water, or vice versa, stuck in a warm swamp of comfort, avoiding any tension until the skills rust.\n\nThere is a bright line: sometimes a coup means a cleansing crisis — the body and mind themselves have begun to draw the poison, a process that is unpleasant, but leads to a new equilibrium, if not disturbed by panic.","daily":"The everyday signal of excess: food, TV shows, spending, cleaning at night — all excessive. Choose one habit and cut it by a third instead of total prohibitions. Haste breaks things: do not cook soup faster by stirring every half minute. Return to the day at least one real pause.","career":"At work, there's a swing: abruptly after abruptly, or lull to a stupor, agreements collapse because of inconsistency. Teams pull in different directions, resources are crooked, timelines are against opportunities. Don't sign up for projects without clear credentials, it's easy to get caught between two fires with someone else's tasks in hand.","love":"The emotional roller coaster: the merger without a trace, the ice distance. Someone in a pair requires too much at once — attention, guarantees, change — and this burns out the feeling. There is a novel on the contrast of attraction and quarrels, which is held by adrenaline, not intimacy. The cure is one, boring and effective: measure.","health":"The biases are obvious: overeating or dieting hard, coffee against insomnia and pills for the consequences, sports jerks after months of lying down. The body rebels against extremes with exacerbations. Recovery starts small — sleep by the clock, water, daily step — without exploits and prohibitions at once.","esoteric":"In practice, an inverted card warns of a broken measure: an overdose of energy, a mix of incompatible traditions, work at exhaustion. Healing techniques require reassembly — less force, more accuracy. Sometimes it is a sign of a cleansing crisis: pus came out before the wound closed."}},{"id":"major-15","name_ru":"The Devil","name_en":"","type":"major","suit":null,"number":15,"img":"major-15-devil.webp","element":"Earth","astro":"Capricorn","upright":{"short":"The chains we call necessity: a card of attachments, shadow desires, and the power of matter.","keywords":["attachment","dependence","temptation","shadow-side","materialism","passion","control"],"archetype":"The devil is sitting on a pedestal, but look at this: the chains on the captives at the foot are long and loose, you can take them off at any time. That's the whole point of the arcana: the cage is not kept locked, but by the habit of wearing it.\n\nThe card describes everything that our weak side possesses: passion that is passed off as love, work that eats personality, substance, money, status, approval. It doesn't forbid wanting, it invites us to look desires in the eye and ask who uses whom.\n\nThe shadow part of the arcana is honest, like a surgeon: it shows the material from which freedom is made; the acknowledged fear loses power over actions; the aloud desire loses its fever; therefore, the devil, contrary to reputation, is not evil, but sober.","daily":"Temptation day: sales, delicious, \"another episode.\" Check your budget and refrigerator against your real needs. There's a little blackmail, maybe, with guilt, favor, old debt; notice where you're being held and where you're holding yourself. One honest look at your chains weakens them by half.","career":"Businesses smell like hard play: manipulation, gray schemes, a tyrant boss or a conditional partner, and you can count honestly what you get for your loyalty and what you pay in return. Work can be money-based and it can be strangling, and it goes up, and you can refrain from questionable deals: exit is always more expensive than entry.","love":"Passion with a cage-like flavor: jealousy, possessiveness, a bond that has long been displeased but holds — habit, money, fear of emptiness. The card doesn't necessarily portend a break: it demands honesty of desire. If the union is built on control, ask yourself what you fear.","health":"The arcanum zone is all kinds of addictions: sugar, nicotine, alcohol, endless scrolling. The body signals overstrain where you artificially turn yourself on. There are problems of an intimate nature and purely psychosomatic reactions from the unspoken.","esoteric":"The devil is the master of the material plane and the guardian of the initiation: the one who has not met his own shadows remains his driver. In practice, the arcana is used to work with subconscious programs, remove attachments and money blocks, recognize other people's manipulations. His lesson is harsh: force through the denial of desires is false; the real comes through their subordination to the spirit."},"reversed":{"short":"The chains are unbuttoned: the dependence is seen from the outside, and the hand has already found the clasp.","keywords":["release","looseness","manipulation","return","detox","borderline"],"archetype":"The inverted Devil captures the moment when the prisoner blinked: enough. The chains still ring, but the clasp is found. It's a card out of toxic bonds, codependent relationships and habits that were held only on inattention.\n\nOften it captures the epiphany itself, and you can see who is pulling the strings and how, and that very appearance is a disinfectionate puppeteer, and healthy anger is healing when it turns into action, not a new way of biting yourself.\n\nThe shadow of the arcana is a liberating display: quit smoking and started to get stuck, went from tyrant to controller, true freedom is tested by time, not by declaration.","daily":"A good day to unload: cancel your obligations, pay back your debt, throw away the trash that eats up space, say it out loud to one person for weeks, but out loud, and the manipulations that you see today by your salespeople, your family and your colleagues won't work again: knowledge makes them helpless.","career":"The work bond is weakening: you can refuse a toxic customer, get out of a swamp project, demand a review of the terms and get consent. Release comes through documents and facts, not through the stage. Beware of demonstrative gestures: going nowhere out of pride is the same trap, only now your own.","love":"The separation period: the couple breaks out of the circle of jealousy-guilt-forgiveness or breaks up completely; the return of control looks unusually quiet — no wars, just boundaries appear; perhaps a farewell to the dependence on someone else's approval: for the first time, likes not the abstract \"someone\", but yourself; the bonds held on fear lose the magnet.","health":"Detox time in every sense: the body willingly lets go of the accumulated, if you help with water, movement and sleep. Addictions are treatable — especially with the support of loved ones and professionals. Set success in the environment: fewer triggers around, more alive instead of surrogates.","esoteric":"A magically inverted arcana is a sign of a successful exorcism of one's own shadow: programs are recognized and discharged. Liberation practices, from birth ties to financial curses, work only when one changes behavior, not just candles. Force returns through simple acts of will: said no, and did not change his mind by morning."}},{"id":"major-16","name_ru":"The Tower","name_en":"","type":"major","suit":null,"number":16,"img":"major-16-tower.webp","element":"Fire","astro":"Mars","upright":{"short":"Lightning strikes at the foundation: the false collapses suddenly - and precisely because it was false.","keywords":["collapse","suddenness","revelation","release","crisis","truth"],"archetype":"The tower built on the sand has endured years, to one loud blow. The lightning on the card is not an accident, but an audit: anything that is held on self-deception does not withstand contact with the truth. The crown flies from the top, vanity always falls first.\n\nThe tower arrangement promises not trouble at all, but the dismantling of concrete constructs: relationships based on illusions, careers based on talents, reputation-facade, destruction is swift and painful, but it releases what has been walled up alive.\n\nAnd after the fall, the amazing thing is that the land is closer than it seemed from the top floor window. The Arcana of Mars is not about punishment, but about forced honesty, the fastest form of growth.","daily":"A day of surprises: technology breaks down, plans break down, news comes in without warning. Don't cling to the script - the restructuring goes faster without resistance. It's good to acknowledge aloud what was clear long ago: an acknowledged problem explodes quietly. By evening there is usually a strange relief.","career":"Professional thunder: layoffs, project failures, team breakdowns, public failure of a beautiful strategy. If your design was fair, the blow will only hurt extra. Don't rebuild the collapsed one -- build lower, wider and with your materials.","love":"The relationship was in crisis-exposure: the secret came out, the unsubscribed came out, \"we're fine\" ended. It's not necessarily a break-up — sometimes it's the only way a couple sees each other for real for the first time. The union on an honest foundation will survive the storm and grow stronger; the facade relationship will collapse, freeing both. It hurts and cleanses.","health":"The acute states: exacerbation, trauma, fever, sudden diagnosis — the body screams where you haven't listened to a whisper in years. The card requires immediate response and complete honesty with the doctors. Often, an acute crisis turns out to be a turning point: correctly treated, it removes the entire chronic background.","esoteric":"The tower is a card of illumination by force: an awakening that was not asked for, a destruction of ego constructs by lightning from above, used in magic to break enchanted circles and remove old negativity — the image works loudly and requires respect. The main lesson of the arcana is not to be attached to forms even the most beautiful."},"reversed":{"short":"The storm hangs in the air or has already passed the side: the tension requires an exit - planned or spontaneous.","keywords":["delayed crisis","fear","blast","drag-down","evasion","discharge"],"archetype":"The inverted tower is a thunderstorm that somehow doesn't start. Everybody feels the pressure, everybody's waiting for the explosion, and it's delayed, and it's getting more expensive every day. It's a card of slow dismantling, the walls cracking for months, and nobody dares to start a serious analysis.\n\nThe other sense is the catastrophe inside: everything is held on the outside, and the inside is already collapsing - sleep, nerves, faith in what is happening, a person supports his face at the cost of health and sincerity.\n\nThere is also a favorable option: lightning struck nearby, the debris passed by, then the card says briefly - the terrible is over, it's time to get out of under the table and calmly dismantle the blockage.","daily":"Getting excited: little things get upset, the equipment breaks down in turn, the house slides into conflict. Make it a regular exercise, talk, tears, or it will happen on its own and not where it is convenient. Check the fuses literally and figuratively: where the tension accumulates, it eventually breaks.","career":"The crisis is smoldering: the organization is cracking, but officially \"everything is under control\"; cuts are whispered, strategy is falling apart; don't wait for official letters - update your resume, warm up your connections, put valuables in your portfolio; if you're cooking the blast yourself, lay the foundation in advance: cutting is hotly expensive.","love":"The relationship hangs over the breakup: both know it's over or it's about to change, but it's the same play, and it's broken through by domestic breakdowns and grievances, silence about the big stuff eats away at intimacy from within, and the only safe way to tell the truth is to tell it yourself before life tells it for you.","health":"The harbingers are there: pressure, panic waves, insomnia, the body prepares its thunder if you keep pulling. Chronic stress has already picked a weak spot and works on it. Planned discharge — vacation, therapy, examination — is always cheaper than emergency. After the experience of shock, apathy is possible: it is repair, give it a deadline.","esoteric":"In practice, the inverted tower warns of accumulated negativity in space or body: cleansing is necessary, but gradual, otherwise it will whip at once. The letting techniques work better than the power ones. Sometimes the card reports a preventative blow: the defense worked, thank you and reconsider your lifestyle. The lesson is to relieve tension in small portions without bringing to lightning."}},{"id":"major-17","name_ru":"The Star","name_en":"","type":"major","suit":null,"number":17,"img":"major-17-star.webp","element":"Air","astro":"Aquarius","upright":{"short":"After any storm, the sky can clear up: hope, quiet healing and a source that is enough for everyone.","keywords":["hope","inspiration","healing","renewal","faith","calmness"],"archetype":"The star comes after the Tower, and the place in the deck explains it: when the superfluous collapses, you can finally see in the sky. The figure by the water pours without counting and without fear: the inner source does not become impoverished by sharing it.\n\nIt's a card of the quiet gifts. Not triumph, but breath; not victory, but the belief that it's worth going further. It heals after loss slowly, without miracles, but inevitably, like grass growing through asphalt.\n\nThe aquarius nature of the arcanum calls not where it is brighter, but where yours is, and the recipe for trust is simple: one foot in the water of intuition, the other on the solid ground of practice.","daily":"An easy day without feats: what has been pressing recently lets go of itself. It's a good walk, water, creativity without purpose or criticism, a call to an old friend. Recovery is noticeable in the small things - in the morning you want to get up again. Share warmth: generosity is coming back quickly and with interest.","career":"The work is breathtaking, the project is given a second wind, the idea is given credit, the team is given air. The card is conducive to creative planning, learning and the future: no money rain, but the river cooks. Work on inspiration, today it is not a whim, but fuel. What is sown now will rise generously, a little later.","love":"The wounds of the past heal, and the heart is heard again. The pair returns an optional tenderness: an evening is worth more than a hundred explanations. After a hard experience, the card promises a person who breathes easily next to him, often met unexpectedly and \"off the list.\" The love of this card is soft: like water is simple and indispensable.","health":"One of the best recovery cards: strength is restored, treatment hits the target, the psyche releases stress. Especially favorable for rehabilitation, water procedures and everything soft. Take the course to the end The improvement will be gradual and sustainable. Useful sleep, clean water and time in nature.","esoteric":"The star is hope as a virtue, not self-comfort, and in practice, it's charged with water and talismans, opens the creative channel, builds work with the future, and seven small stars around the big one are a reminder of the alignment of the inner centers."},"reversed":{"short":"The sky is tightened: faith is lost between deeds, and it seems that the inner source has dried up.","keywords":["disappointment","lack of faith","creative-block","self-doubt","gloom","ravages"],"archetype":"The upside down Star is the night that the sky was forgotten, and it's okay, because the belief that anything makes sense disappeared, and the person continues to do things, but it's dark inside, like a house with the electricity turned off.\n\nOften it's the fatigue of the giver, the water that's been poured on others, on work, on other people's crises, and you don't notice where your own comes from, and the frustration with people, the path, and yourself sounds equally deaf.\n\nThe arcana has the pride of the resentful idealist: the world is not perfect, and he punishes everyone with distrust, and heals it in one way: by allowing himself to want again.","daily":"A day in gray: nothing bad happens, but joy passes by, like behind glass. Don't ask for the positive, start small: hot shower, favorite music, ten minutes of silence. Put aside big decisions: nothing grows in a dry place, first pour yourself.","career":"Creative and motivational: work has become a mechanic, ideas seem silly at the start, other people's successes are annoying. You may have been doing someone else's work for a long time, talent is asking for its own channel. Don't tear up hot, but put back into the schedule what fed your soul: learning, experimenting, talking to people of your own element.","love":"Feelings under a layer of ash: after a grudge, it is hard to believe that love is gentle. In a couple, it is possible to be cold - not from dislike, but from fear of getting burned again; the partner needs proof of security, not reproaches. The card honestly says to the lonely: you are not defending yourself from people, but from your own hope. Start with friendship - it is more honest than romance now.","health":"Decline without a clear illness: sleep doesn't restore, pleasure doesn't heal, vitamins seem to pass by, usually due to a long disregard for one's own needs: the body has gone into a state of economy, help soft regime and mandatory psychological relief.","esoteric":"Mystically upside down, the channel is closed: the source is there, the tap is closed with resentment and distrust. Practices go idle, mascots are silent, predictions do not come true. Start by reconnecting with yourself: diary, water, honest answers to simple questions."}},{"id":"major-18","name_ru":"The Moon","name_en":"","type":"major","suit":null,"number":18,"img":"major-18-moon.webp","element":"Water","astro":"Fish","upright":{"short":"A night where the light is only half yours: intuition is sharpened, but fog hides the contours.","keywords":["illusion","anxiety","subconscious","intuition","uncertainty","dream"],"archetype":"The moon only lights up the path in part: there's a road between the two towers, and how much you can see is an open question, and cancer is creeping out of the pond, and consciousness is just beginning to rise from the depths, and this is the subconscious territory, where fears live without a name and desire without an address.\n\nAnd the card says, something in the situation is not what it seems. You don't have to be fooled, you can be fooled into drawing the missing with fear or with a dream. Facts are few, anxiety is many.\n\nBut the moon is not only a dark one. It's a night navigation organ: where logic is blind, there's a sensitive intuition, and the fishy nature of the arcanum asks you not to turn on the high beam, you go slowly and listen.","daily":"It's a foggy day, the information is contradictory, people don't agree everything, and you want to decide immediately and without reason. Wait in the morning, it's usually clearer. Write down your dreams and anxious thoughts: they look smaller on paper. Trust the persistent feeling of \"something is wrong\" - it's data, not suspicion.","career":"The work is murky: promises are beautiful, documents are at odds with words, a colleague smiles too broadly. Check the details, record the agreements in writing, avoid vague projects. There are rumors and behind-the-scenes games — respond with facts and restraint. Big financial decisions are best postponed until clear.","love":"Relationships smell of understatement: jealousy whispers, imagination draws, partner keeps silent about his. Before you start an inquest, separate the facts from the fears — often the storm is internal. Sometimes the card honestly warns: there is a secret. Single — charm, like a projection: look at the person for longer than three dates.","health":"Symptoms are blurred, diagnoses are inaccurate, health is jumping — a typical moonshot. The main focus is on the psyche: anxiety, insomnia, vivid dreams, old fears on the surface. Sleep patterns, restriction of news and stimulants, support of a psychologist. The body can \"dream\" a disease that is not: check calmly, without twisting.","esoteric":"The moon is a lark of initiation into the subconscious: working with dreams, active imagination, lunar cycles. It increases divinatory sensitivity and requires grounding at the same time: practices without support on this card are dangerous. The road between the towers is the route of the night wanderer: you can go, you can not run. The element teaches respect for the unenlightened."},"reversed":{"short":"The fog thins: fears lose scale, the hidden surfaces, the road gradually manifests itself.","keywords":["clarification","fear-out","lie-out","quiz","let-off","landing"],"archetype":"The upside down moon is the dawn after a long night of doubt, what seemed like a monster in the dark turns out to be a bush by the road in the light, fears lose their power, they are dispelled by facts - or they are just tired of holding on.\n\nOften the card captures the moment of unpacking: the secret becomes apparent, the intrigue is revealed, and even though the truth is unpleasant, it is easier than the unknown, the voice of intuition is again distinguished from the voice of anxiety.\n\nThere is also a shadowy version, which is the opposite of immersion: the person hides in fantasy from reality, and the suppressed anxiety settles in the body, then the arcana advises you to pull the fears out into the light with your hands, one at a time.","daily":"Solutions day: a confusing case unravels, a misunderstanding is explained in two sentences, anxiety recedes for no apparent reason. Good time for honest conversations that have been delayed. Take apart the rubble on the table and in the drawers - order now works like a spell of clarity. The evening promises a calmer sleep than usual.","career":"The work fog dissipates: the true state of projects is revealed, the reasons for delays and the motives of partners are revealed, the lack of information is filled, often from an unexpected source, negotiations are more honest, conditions can be revised, decisions are made on facts, not on feelings, and they will be accurate.","love":"Distrust is replaced by clarity: a conversation that has been feared for months is simple: if there has been a deception, it will open up itself, without detective work, and it will liberate both. In healthy couples, calm intimacy returns and good dreams. Single people will end their years of falling in love with the image: a place is made free for the real person.","health":"The anxiety symptoms recede: the tests bounce back, sleep recovers, fear of illness loses grip. If the therapy is wrong, it will now be found right. The psyche stabilizes -- fix the sleep hygiene result with fewer stimulants. The body shows where stress lived for years.","esoteric":"In practice, an inverted arcana means a way out of the dark: the mist that is induced subsides, the suggestions of others are lost; dreams become fruitful, instead of the dance of images, clear answers come; it is beneficial to cleanse space and regain your strength from fears."}},{"id":"major-19","name_ru":"The Sun","name_en":"","type":"major","suit":null,"number":19,"img":"major-19-sun.webp","element":"Fire","astro":"Sunshine","upright":{"short":"Noon without clouds: life force, success and joy you don’t need to deserve.","keywords":["joy","succession","vitality","clarity","heat","recognition"],"archetype":"The sun is the kindest card of the deck: a child on a white horse, sunflowers above the wall, a light that has nothing to prove, and all life reaches to it not for a reward, but because it is so arranged.\n\nIn the scenario, it announces a fruiting period, and success is not a lottery, but the natural outcome of what grew quietly and long, and clarity replaces guesswork: you can see far away, both the road and yourself in it.\n\nArcana reminds us of the main source: joy does not reside in achievement, but in the ability to shine. The child on the card is happy not because he won, he does not participate in the competition at all.","daily":"Day with open windows: things get along, people smile, the body asks for movement and air. Spend time in the sun, with children, in a game without purpose. Home affairs are solved easily - even prolonged repairs argue. Allow yourself pleasure without benefit: just joy is also the case.","career":"The recognition band: the project is successful, the leadership is good, your name sounds louder. The card is public — presentations, talks and interviews are brilliant. It's a good time to start your business, expand, take a responsible role. Energy is restored faster than it's spent: it's on the rise.","love":"Relationships in the best possible form: warmth for no reason, laughter for small things, the desire to show the loved one to the world. For couples waiting for a addition, the card is traditionally favorable — it carries childish energy in the literal sense. Solitude is not a problem now, but a pause in the sun: dating happens easily and without strategy. Love openly — today it is safe.","health":"One of the best health cards is strength, immunity is strong, treatment is quick, especially good for children and anyone who recovers from illness, sunshine, sports, active rest, the body asks for movement. One thing is caution: even the sun shines rhythmically, beware of overheating and overload.","esoteric":"The sun is a lark of light initiation: joy as a spiritual technique, not a reward for austerity. In practice, a card is used to charge amulets of luck, strengthen vitality and protect children. Sunlight meditation warms the energy pillar from bottom to top."},"reversed":{"short":"The sun is behind the haze: success is not canceled, but delayed, and joy must be awakened.","keywords":["cloud-cloud","delayed","burnout","quiescent","vanity","infantile"],"archetype":"The sun upside down is the same afternoon seen from the smoke-filled room, and it's okay, the lights are still there, but between you, the curtain is fatigue, resentment, perpetual busyness.\n\nThe card describes a muffled joy: there is achievement, and you don't want to celebrate; love is nearby, but you feel it through strength. Sometimes it's just a delay: success comes later than deadline, recognition comes after an extra lap.\n\nThere is a shadowy line, childishness, turned the wrong side: whims, demanding everything at once, an ego waiting for applause without work, or the burnout of someone who shone everyone and forgot to pay himself.","daily":"Half-hearted day: everything works, but without taste; the sun shines, and not enough heat. Don't make yourself happy, remove from the day extra, will remain the main thing. Help someone in small things: someone else's smile often turns yours. Go to bed early - many \"gray days\" are banal lack of sleep.","career":"The work is going on, but the recognition is late: there are results, there are no awards and no praise - the registration of your merits moves slower than desired. Don't force: the card promises that success will come later. The more dangerous is star disease or overload for the sake of applause.","love":"Feelings are alive, but they're muted: life ate romance, couples love \"from memory.\" Sometimes the card is about the inner child: someone in the union once lost warmth and now asks for it clumsily. Bring back play and stupidity in the relationship - they cure better than serious conversations. Single: first joy for yourself, then finding a partner.","health":"Energy is below normal: lethargy, decreased immunity, \"I'm not sick, but I'm not living\"; the reasons are more often regimen: little light, movement and real rest; walking in daylight hours and vitamins prescribed by a doctor are literally necessary; burnout is treated only by real rest, not by imitation.","esoteric":"An inverted arcana speaks of a closed solar channel: power flows, but in a subtle trickle. The practice of luck works half-heartedly — first restore the resource, then recharge the talismans. Sometimes it is a sign of children's programs: the inner child is waiting for permission to shine. Meditation in the morning sun, play, creativity without a judge returns the connection. The lights were not turned off — just forgot to open the curtains."}},{"id":"major-20","name_ru":"Judgement","name_en":"","type":"major","suit":null,"number":20,"img":"major-20-judgement.webp","element":"Fire","astro":"Pluto","upright":{"short":"The trumpet of the archangel calls to rise: a time of honest reassessment of life and second birth.","keywords":["wake-up","call","revaluation","revival","atonement","second-hand"],"archetype":"On the card, the sleepers rise from their graves after hearing the trumpet of the archangel. It's not a sentence, it's an invitation: life asks for an account -- not before the judge, but before the present. What is the next thing we've lived, and what remains in the ground?\n\nIn the case of Judgment, it means waking up after a long sleep: suddenly it becomes clear who you were supposed to be. The call comes through chance, a book, illness, conversation - but it is instantly known: it is mine.\n\nArcana is also forgiveness: old guilt that you've been dragging around like a sack for years is absolved -- not an excuse, but a let-down. You can't have a rebirth with the burden of the former. Pluto's nature makes the process profound and irreversible.","daily":"Call day from the past: a message from an old friend, a message that changes plans, an offer that beats your heart. Answer it's not an accident, it's a schedule. It's good to close the eternal family matters: call your parents, end an old quarrel. The case started today promises to update more than planned.","career":"The call for change of the professional scale: the experience suddenly adds up to a new role — promotion, business, vocation. Past mistakes are no longer a stigma: partners and employers are willing to give a second chance. Don't reject the call out of convenience — the rejected comes back louder. It's good to go back to the old project on new terms.","love":"Relationships are judged by conscience: who was right is no longer important; whether they are both ready to start over by other people matters: the past is for real, not \"okay, forget\"; the return of a significant person is possible - not a repeat of the old circle, but a new chapter with it. The lonely card promises to awaken a feeling that was believed to be buried.","health":"Recovery after a long streak: the body hears the command \"up\" - the strength returns, the chronicle recedes. A good period for decisive steps: surgery that was postponed, a course that changes the quality of life. The emotional part is also important: let go of resentment relieves half of the symptoms. The body now speaks the truth directly - listen the first time.","esoteric":"The court is the lap of the grand call: every tradition has a trumpet that wakes the sleepers; in practice, it opens up work with purpose and tribal memory, helps you hear your real name; meditation on sound — the bell, the gong, the voice — brings you to the depths."},"reversed":{"short":"The trumpet sounds and you pretend to be asleep: the call is postponed, self-criticism replaces action.","keywords":["call-out","self-flagellation","delay","fear","long-standing","stagnation"],"archetype":"The upside down Court is a man who pretends not to hear, and the call has been long and persistent: change jobs, end relationships, start treatment, go, and he finds a hundred good reasons to stay.\n\nThe other face of the arcana is the judge turning inward: a perpetual trial of himself without the right to appeal. These people are not wrong, they are \"just terrible,\" and this formula is more reliable than any jailer.\n\nAnd the opposite happens: the sentence is passed on to others and not appealable, a resentment that has become a worldview, and until the case is reopened, no new housing can be built in the old prison.","daily":"Deferred Decision Day: Unanswered letters, later calls, a question that needs to be resolved yesterday, notice where you pretend you haven't heard, and one call made today will take off the load of a whole week.","career":"Self-defeating stagnation: it's time to change a role or a place, but it's not the time. You may have recently given up an opportunity out of fear of scale, see if it's back in another way. Self-exploration after failure eats up more energy than failure itself.","love":"The relationship is on hold because of the unsentenced sentence: someone continues to punish a partner for a long history — or is guilty as a cross himself. Forgiveness was offered; you did not accept it. Fear of intimacy after a painful experience is possible: the past judges the present. One honest decision allows you to move forward is to forgive or let go.","health":"Health suffers from long-term decisions: the exam is delayed for the third month, the course is thrown in the middle, \"it will pass\" has become the main diagnosis. Self-flagellation adds its own: immunity is the first to lose ground. Set yourself a day of decisive action for health - and spend it. A patient body is waiting for your \"yes\", but keeps counting.","esoteric":"Mystically upside down, the Court is deaf to the call of the soul: the practice is formal, the destination is stomping, the gifts lie unpacked, the birth program of condemnation will be passed on until someone breaks the chain, start with a small ritual of forgiveness - yourself, your parents, the abuser. Until the sentences are burned, the trumpet will sound again: it does not get tired."}},{"id":"major-21","name_ru":"The World","name_en":"","type":"major","suit":null,"number":21,"img":"major-21-world.webp","element":"Earth","astro":"Saturn","upright":{"short":"The final chord sounds like the beginning: the cycle is completed, the experience is collected, the dance inside the wreath continues.","keywords":["completion","integrity","accomplishment","execution","journey","recognition"],"archetype":"The world is closed by the Major Arcana, a dancing figure in a laurel wreath, and at the corners there are four elements that have passed with you all the way. The magician began with one rod; here there are two, and both are in their hands freely, without effort.\n\nIn the layout, the card announces the completion of a big cycle: diploma, house, project, stage of life — the whole thing is done and done. It's not the finish line, it's the exit to orbit: after one is finished, the person sees the next one from a height.\n\nSaturn here is not a rigorous examiner, but a contented builder: the limitations you've been through have turned out to be the framework of the whole. The main gift of the arcana is integrity: the disparate pieces of life are first put together into a pattern.","daily":"Closed gestalt day: final touch, final cleaning, delivery of a long-bought gift. Finish everything that has hung for months, each closed question adds to the ease. It's good to take stock and plan the next season: the horizon is far away.","career":"A major achievement: the project is completed, the goal is taken, the level is officially recognized, the card favors protection, releases, signing long-term contracts and awards, a great moment for going international or long-distance work trip.","love":"Relationships are experiencing their \"world\" -- an anniversary, a wedding, a home, or just a deep sense of \"we made it\" -- lessons learned are not wasted, they are the foundation of our current intimacy. A single card tells you that the cycle of loneliness is complete, you've come out of it as a person ready for a big thing, you may meet on a journey or with a person from afar.","health":"The body is in harmony: systems work together, recovery from disease is complete, without residual effects. It's a good time to establish healthy habits - they lie in fertile soil. Travel and activity in nature are especially healing. Preventive examinations are carried out calmly: the body has nothing to hide.","esoteric":"The world is the end of the Great Work: the four elements dance around the wreath, and none argues with the others. In practice, the card is used to close magical cycles, thank you rites and initiation to a new level. The wreath is not a cage, but the frame of the picture: the dance continues within the form that protects."},"reversed":{"short":"Nearly finished: there is one step left before the end, which for some reason is not done.","keywords":["unfinishedness","delay","formalization","perfectionism","fear of a new cycle","lack"],"archetype":"The Upside Down World is a dance that stops a step before the final: diploma unprotected, book nine-tenths completed, move hovering on boxes, almost everything done, and that's what \"almost\" deprives the reward.\n\nSometimes the card shows the finale as a formal one: the seal is standing, the inside is empty, the person ran the wrong way, and triumph doesn't smell like triumph, the closing is complete. It hurts more than a simple lapse.\n\nThe third sense is the fear of the end of the cycle: it's scary to let the finished thing out into the world, because after that you have to become the one who is already unapologetically \"ready,\" Arcana gently reminds us that a wreath is not a ceiling; behind it begins the sky.","daily":"The house is full of months of finishing touches: one shelf, one call, one document. Finish something today, ease is guaranteed. See if you're dropping ninety percent for fear of judging the outcome. A little evening ending is the best sleeping pill.","career":"Projects are stalled at the finish line: approvals are delayed, the client is delayed, the release is postponed for the fourth time. Check if everything is really ready on your part, sometimes the delay is created by your own perfectionism. Don't cut the last stages \"for speed\": unsatisfaction will return to a rework. Celebrating early, throwing ridiculously, the finish is closer than it seems.","love":"The relationship is almost in a close relationship, almost introducing it to its parents, almost talking about the future, someone pulling the finale out of fear of responsibility or loss of freedom, and another story is possible: the form of life together has developed, but there is no dance in it.","health":"Treatment is abandoned at the last stage: \"better, why next,\" and the disease goes around. Rehabilitation requires a full course, not half: untreated stories accumulate with interest. Listen to the general feeling of \"life passes by\" - bodily lethargy often reflects unclosed life cycles. Finish it: the body will thank the energy.","esoteric":"An inverted arcana indicates an unclosed initiation: learning is interrupted, rite is not completed, and power is not built into life. The practice is many, and there is no integrity - knowledge lies piled up, not gathering into a pattern. Go back and finish: a completed ritual, a completed book, a duty given to tradition."}},{"id":"wands-ace","name_ru":"Ace of Wands","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"wands","number":1,"img":"wands-ace.webp","element":"Fire","astro":null,"upright":{"short":"A pure spark of fire: a flash of inspiration and determination to start your main business.","keywords":["fresh-start","inspiration","creative impulse","potentiality","determination","clean-energy"],"archetype":"The ace of wands is the root of the element of Fire and the seed of every undertaking. On the card, the hand from the cloud extends a living staff with young shoots: the idea comes as a gift, but it will grow in your hands. In the Kabbalistic way, this is Kether in the world of fire energy, a pure impulse of the will, not yet touched by doubt or form.\n\nThe card captures a moment when you have a desire to do something within you -- a project, a book, a move -- not a plan, not a result, but the heat of knowing, \"This is mine,\" and the staff shoots promise that the idea will be viable; it only needs space and a first step; the ace calls you to act at once: its energy is generous, but it's short, and it's easy to dissipate with endless preparation.","daily":"The day is a wake-up call, and you wake up before your alarm clock, and you have a list of things you want to start, and you have a good time to clean up, to sign up for a course, to send a long-delayed letter, and everything you do with excitement argues, and everything you do out of a sense of duty is stalling.","career":"The card is a start: a new project, a job, a business, or a first task that opens doors. The initiative is noticed by the management, the colleagues propose joint plans, and the idea looks audacious and promises growth. The main thing is to turn the idea into concrete first steps while others are still thinking.","love":"In love, the Ace of Wands is a flash of passion and a dizziness of novelty; it promises to be a lonely acquaintance that sparks from the first minute; for couples, a renewal of feelings and bold joint ventures; it is a fire of attraction, not quiet attachment: it requires an honest response to mutual tension.","health":"The vitality is high: quick recovery from illness, a surge of physical strength, ease of morning rises, a great time to start training or any practice for the body, the body responds willingly, the only risk of fire is overheating: excessive exertion threatens stretches and overload of the heart.","esoteric":"In magic work, the Ace is the lit candle on the altar: a channel of creative power through which intention passes without distortion. A card is good for consecrating instruments, starting practice, working with the center of the will. It enhances the rituals of success and protection, but it does not tolerate falsehood: fire burns the false.","gd":{"title_en":"The Root of the Powers of Fire","title_ru":"Root of the Fire Forces","why":"The ace is a pure, yet unformed element. In Golden Dawn, it's the Keter of Fire: the primary impulse of will and action to a particular form."}},"reversed":{"short":"The spark fades at the start: the idea is there, but there is no movement - doubt, distractions and delays eat up the momentum.","keywords":["delay","lack of direction","doubt","false-start","missed opportunity","wasted energy"],"archetype":"Turning over, the Ace shows the same fire without air, carries an idea for months, discusses it with everyone, and doesn't take a step, sometimes the card means premature: the ground is not ready yet, and trying to force events will only smoke.\n\nThe inverted Ace has two poles: the inner one, fear of failure and anticipation of the “perfect moment,” the outer one, the circumstances that block the start when projects stall and the promised support doesn’t come, the lesson is one: to regain the authorship of your own energy, to understand where it is draining, and rekindle it with small but real deeds.","daily":"The promising day is broken down into distractions: the work is not finished, the meetings are postponed, the equipment breaks down at the right moment, and it's useful to reduce the list of things to one task and bring it to the end, and it will restore the sense of control of your own energy.","career":"The project is delayed: funding is not approved, the contract is signed for the third month, a new place is all the time \"the other day,\" maybe it started without resources or understanding. The worst strategy is to push the wall; the best is to reassemble the plan, pick up the missing skills and restart the idea when it lights up again.","love":"Passion doesn't turn into action: correspondence is sluggish, dates are postponed, and in a couple, both wait for the first step from each other. Sometimes the card shows an obsessive fascination with no future, where there is fire, and there is no intimacy. Don't force the feelings - let them mature or admit the spark is false.","health":"There's a lot of energy, but it goes into anxiety and insomnia: the body requires movement, the nerves rest, and this conflict is exhausting. There are pressure surges and inflammations in the flat. Slow down, remove stimulants, start with gentle activity — walks, stretches, swim.","esoteric":"The upside down ace is a closed channel: power comes in jolts, rituals are disrupted, intentions are blurred by someone else's influence, the card may indicate bindings that quench wills, before you start a new one, clean up the unfinished business and get your name back.","gd":{"title_en":"The Root of the Powers of Fire","title_ru":"Root of the Fire Forces","why":"The ace is a pure, yet unformed element. In Golden Dawn, it's the Keter of Fire: the primary impulse of will and action to a particular form."}}},{"id":"wands-two","name_ru":"Two of Wands","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"wands","number":2,"img":"wands-two.webp","element":"Fire","astro":"Mars in Aries","upright":{"short":"The strategist’s pause before the hike: a world in the palm of your hand, a distant horizon, and a choice of direction that will determine everything.","keywords":["planning","direction","power","perspective","decision","design"],"archetype":"A man stands on a fortress wall with a globe in his hand, looking out at the sea, behind the solid walls of the built past, ahead of us is an open space of possibility: one staff is still fixed in the wall, the other is free, two wands catch a moment of choice between them.\n\nIt's the lap of personal power: a lot has been achieved, but you don't want to stop, and the only question is where to put your power next, and the card teaches that the real choice is to rise above the hustle and bustle and honestly answer yourself what horizon you really need.","daily":"A day for strategy, not a leap: budget for the year, plan your trip, talk to your loved ones about your season plans, and it's a good time to have a distance and a heart-to-heart conversation, and make important decisions without leaving them to others.","career":"Now, the current phase is over, the next one hasn't started yet: the deal is closed, the report is done, and it's a development issue, the card favors business plans, entry into new markets, talk about promotion, positions are strong, partners are trusting, agreements are being made that will last for a long time.","love":"The first fire has settled, and the couple decides whether to build a common house: talk about marriage, apartment, moving. The single card hints that it is time to leave the fortress - the old defenses are already redundant, and a new person is waiting where you have long looked.","health":"Stable is the best background for prevention: medical examinations, exercise plans, nutrition with a specialist. The card highlights the power of habits: what you lay down now will reverberate in years to come. Endurance sports, running, tourism are beneficial.","esoteric":"The two wands are the tower watcher: the ability to see destiny beyond momentary desires, and it's about the art of foresight and timing: whoever holds the globe owns the calendar, and the card reinforces the rites of success.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Dominion","title_ru":"Lord of the Lordship","why":"Mars in its own fiery Aries gives an almost undiluted will to assert itself. The two unleashes the power of suit - hence power, control and domination."}},"reversed":{"short":"Fear of stepping behind a wall: the decision is postponed, plans are poured in, and the comfort zone turns into a cage.","keywords":["fear of the unknown","lack of plan","delay","play-safe","uncertainty"],"archetype":"The Inverted Two is a man who has looked out at the sea for so long that he has forgotten why he went out on the wall. Every option seems risky, the globe in his hand turns into a heavy load. There are enough opportunities - not enough courage to dispose of them.\n\nThe other side is hectic planning without foundation: multiple goals at once, castles in the air, things started without a calculation of forces, both of which grow from the same root: the unwillingness to look honestly at real resources and real desires.","daily":"Small decisions eat up the day: you pick a fare, a route, a gift, and you stick with it, and you get your plans crumbling with other people's cancellations and forgotten details, and you get a viscous sense that life is passing by, and you make a small decision and you get it done, and that's enough to get you started.","career":"The project stalls because no one wants to take responsibility: meetings multiply, strategies are rewritten, deadlines are floating, you may be held up with promises of promotion, or you are afraid to leave a reliable company, check the facts: half of the \"risks\" live only in your head.","love":"The relationship is in limbo, both fearful of talking about the future and secretly checking backup options. Sometimes the card shows a person who, out of fear of loneliness, guards something that is long overdue to let go. Ask yourself honestly: are you building a common or guarding your own?","health":"The tension of indecision hits the nerves: sleep is shallow, muscles are pinched, anxiety is kept in the background all day, the body is waiting for a blow that is not there. Mode and grounding help: a stable schedule of sleep and eating will quickly convince the body that change is safe.","esoteric":"In the subtler sense, there is a fog on the observation deck: the practitioner confuses his path with the imposed, follows the predictions and fears of others, warns against fortune-telling out of fear and dependence on \"teachers,\" silence and self-will are more accurate than any advice.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Dominion","title_ru":"Lord of the Lordship","why":"Mars in its own fiery Aries gives an almost undiluted will to assert itself. The two unleashes the power of suit - hence power, control and domination."}}},{"id":"wands-three","name_ru":"Three of Wands","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"wands","number":3,"img":"wands-three.webp","element":"Fire","astro":"The Sun in Aries","upright":{"short":"The ships leave with the load of your plan: expansion, foresight and confident progress of the work started.","keywords":["expansion","vision","progression","result","abroad","rise"],"archetype":"The hero stands on the elevation with his back to the viewer and watches as the three ships that were sent to him sail under the sails. The main thing is already done: invested, ventured, sailed — now the matter matures itself. The three of the wands depicts the phase when the stuff starts working, and the fruit still floats to shore.\n\nIt's the lair of broad-mindedness and healthy ambition: what was a dream yesterday has become a date plan today. The card reminds us of the legal pause between sowing and harvesting -- wisdom is not about pulling sprouts, it's about keeping the goal in sight and keeping the movement going.","daily":"The good news about the case that was launched earlier: the application is accepted, the approval is passed, the purchase is approved, long-distance routes, travel bookings, documents and meetings on which the future depends are favorable, and communication with people from other cities is especially fruitful.","career":"Strong growth: the company is entering a new market, the project has been piloted, the foreign negotiations are successful, the previous investment of time and reputation is beginning to pay dividends, a good period of expansion is to expand staff, open a branch, bring the product to a large audience.","love":"Relationships move along the far shore: meeting your parents, sharing plans, moving in for a life together. A single card leads to a person from there, from another city or environment, and values not the flash, but the direction: love as the path chosen by the two.","health":"The dynamics are exciting: treatment works, tests improve, strength comes in, health resorts, rehabilitation, climate change are good, you approach health strategically: vitamins, routine testing, sports goal for the season.","esoteric":"The Three Wands is the magician's card: the ability to send intent into the invisible and wait for it to come back with a load. It patronizes long-range goals and amulets of good luck on the way. In developmental scenarios, it says that the soul has come out of a tight harbor, and it is already driven by a favorable wind.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Established Strength","title_ru":"Lord of the Assented Force","why":"The solar core organizes the Aries impulse: the will no longer just rushes forward, but becomes a stable position and character."}},"reversed":{"short":"Ships have lost their course: expectations are not met, the horizon is narrowing, and expansion has to be postponed.","keywords":["delay","horizon-narrowing","disappointment","shortsightedness","self-restraint"],"archetype":"In the inverted Troika, ships don't come back on time, and the person on the shore stops seeing the sea, plans stall: suppliers fail, the market changes, allies disappear, often the cause is not an external storm, but a tight-limited design.\n\nThe card also speaks of short-sightedness: a solution without regard for long-term consequences counts. Another voice here is false modesty, where the person himself refuses wide doors because he is \"early\" and \"out of order.\" The cure is one: to return the horizon to his eyes and honestly see where he is actually going.","daily":"The trip is broken, the promised call does not come, the papers are stuck in the authorities, the breakdown of the household cancels the plans of the weekend.","career":"Expansion is frozen, the contract is in question, investors are silent. You may overvalue the market or underestimate the timing, you will have to cut ambition. The card also warns of nostalgia for past successes instead of finding new directions. Recalculate the plan and do not fear smaller scale for the sake of preserving essence.","love":"The future together is hazy: one couple is afraid of commitment, the move is delayed, the relationship develops jerky and backwards. Single cards draw in a narrowing circle of acquaintances similar to each other. Ask yourself if the old experience prevents you from looking at new people directly.","health":"Recovery is slower than you want: therapy has to change, the effect of the procedures is weak, strength is restored by waves, problems of the legs and vision, swelling, do not check yourself with other people's deadlines: small daily measures work better than rare large efforts.","esoteric":"The inverted Three is the reverse wind: motivation fades, rites give a delayed effect, the path seems abandoned. A card can show an unfulfilled promise to its own destiny. Reclaim the discipline of small step: daily practice is more important than a grand pilgrimage postponed never.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Established Strength","title_ru":"Lord of the Assented Force","why":"The solar core organizes the Aries impulse: the will no longer just rushes forward, but becomes a stable position and character."}}},{"id":"wands-four","name_ru":"Four of Wands","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"wands","number":4,"img":"wands-four.webp","element":"Fire","astro":"Venus in Aries","upright":{"short":"The garland over the four wands: a holiday, a fret in the house and a well-deserved respite on the threshold of a new stage.","keywords":["holiday","hearth","harmony","housewarming","community","stability"],"archetype":"Four wands form a gate under a garland of flowers and fruits; bouquet figures dance beneath them, a cozy castle is visible behind them; the harvest is harvested; the house is built; it's time to open the doors to guests; the four wands are the warmest and most secular arcana of suit.\n\nThe card says, strength is measured not by stones, but by consent. The bridge holds because the four pillars are flat -- family, friendship, business, shelter -- and it falls on weddings, housewarming, anniversaries, and reminds us that milestones should be celebrated aloud, sharing joy with those around us.","daily":"The day is a warm family day: gather family at the table, celebrate the event, visit parents, do flowers on the balcony. Good time for housewarming and reshuffling. Even a regular candlelit dinner today becomes a holiday — allow yourself to rejoice for no reason.","career":"Team celebration: the project is successfully completed, the team received an award, the office celebrates an anniversary, corporate parties and acquaintances with partners' families are favorable - the agreements become more human at the table. The foundation of the case is reliable; formalize the relationship informally.","love":"One of the major marriage predictions is engagement, marriage, family reunion, moving into a common area, and relationships are in a quiet, happy state of being, and welcoming guests, and for established couples, the card suggests that courtship rituals be restored.","health":"Sustained health and emotional recharge from loved ones: recovery is received by the rear, stress is reduced without medication, domestic joy cures better than prescriptions, the only threat of the period is the festive table: too much food and wine will reverberate with the heaviness of the morning.","esoteric":"The four wands are a consecrated threshold and hearth: a card of home altars, family amulets, and the rituals of the house. It patronizes weddings, the celebrations of the wheel of the year, hospitality as an art. In the relocation plans, it promises that the new home will become a real home.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Perfected Work","title_ru":"The Lord of Perfect Work","why":"The four sets the result, and Venus softens and harmonizes the fiery impulse, and you get the complete structure: order, peace, and festive summing up."}},"reversed":{"short":"The holiday passes by: the supports have dispersed, the house without a frame, the transition period without simple human warmth.","keywords":["instability","transition","turf","crowd-crowding","delayed"],"archetype":"The garland is sagging, the pillars are gone, and the holiday is losing its frame, the family is going to the same table physically, but everyone is sitting on their phone, the house is, and the fireplace is not. The card often falls out during transitional times — repairs, travel, changing the city, when the usual way of life is temporarily dismantled.\n\nIt has a soft side, a private party with no public, but more often it's a lack of belonging: there's nowhere to lean, and every little thing is a fight. The lesson of the Upside-down Four is that it's not walls that build strength, it's attention rituals that you have to rebuild with your hands.","daily":"The life goes in a different way: guests postpone the visit, repairs are delayed, home quarrels over trifles, the move is not going according to plan. Don't demand from the period of a beautiful picture: clean up one room, cook your favorite dish - small islands of comfort will keep the balance.","career":"It's cool, the team is divided into groups, the bosses are saving on tradition, the promised banquet has become a thank-you message, business is suffering from turnover, and what matters now is not the speeches, but the spotlight care — personal conversations and the restoration of trust one person at a time.","love":"Turbulence: Talk about marriages gets stuck, families don't come together, life exposes differences, maybe living two houses or being separated, sometimes the card shows a union held on the front for guests, find an activity where you can be two without roles or expectations.","health":"Instability hits sleep and digestion first: without a regimen, the body doesn't know when to rest, migraines come after quarrels. Build a minimal frame of the day -- the same lift, warm food, walk. Resilience comes back through rhythm.","esoteric":"Unconsecrated dwelling: no center, no amulets forgotten, quarrels leave sediment in the walls. The card advises clearing the space, redefining the boundaries of the house and renewing family customs. A simple meal without screens is the strongest domestic action known long before complex rituals.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Perfected Work","title_ru":"The Lord of Perfect Work","why":"The four sets the result, and Venus softens and harmonizes the fiery impulse, and you get the complete structure: order, peace, and festive summing up."}}},{"id":"wands-five","name_ru":"Five of Wands","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"wands","number":5,"img":"wands-five.webp","element":"Fire","astro":"Saturn in Leo","upright":{"short":"The comical battle of five young men: rivalry, clash of characters and the excitement of testing one’s own strength.","keywords":["rivalry","conflict","friction","gamble","test","clutter"],"archetype":"Five young men waving their batons, it looks like a fight from the outside, but nobody's injured and their clothes are intact. Waite saw a contest here that tests strength, not maims. Five describes the environment of competition -- tenders, debates, matches, family disputes; wherever energy clashes with energy.\n\nIt's important: the card is not about war, it's about training. Without rivals, the master doesn't become a master. It asks if you can fight honestly, lose without offense and win without gloating. If you do, confusion becomes school; if you don't, it's a fight.","daily":"It's a day of polyphony, where the home is the same, the neighbors are the same, the queues are all in a hurry, and there's a debate about trifles, from parking to the menu for the evening, and it's a burst of energy, not a disaster: set up a board game tournament or go to a mass race, and the tension goes into play.","career":"Hot season: competitors are more active, ideas clash on the glides, the order goes to the strongest, the card is favorable for tenders, contests, public debates - the excitement works on reputation. One danger is to get carried away with fighting for the sake of the fight and forget what it is for.","love":"The couple has a little competition: who will overpower whom, whose job is more important, who will apologize first. Such frictions fuel interest when there is respect behind them; worse, when a quarrel becomes a way of life; the single card promises acquaintance through play and sports - the spark lives where there is a healthy challenge.","health":"Your body requires movement: a great time for team sports, martial arts, dancing. Adrenaline helps you set personal records, but warm-up is mandatory - in the heat of combat, it is easy to pull muscles. Nervous overexcitation is relieved by body fatigue, not by the sofa.","esoteric":"Five is a martial artel of young warriors: a school where the spirit is tempered by confrontation, it is associated with martial arts, ritual games, trials of initiation, and warns against magical excitement: the force taken for self-assertion quickly turns into a fuss.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Strife","title_ru":"Lord of Struggle","why":"Saturn limits and restrains the lion's desire to shine and dominate, and the Five itself is conflicted, so energy comes out as a struggle for place and the right to manifest."}},"reversed":{"short":"The fight is exhaled: the conflict goes inward or is carefully avoided, and unspoken irritation accumulates under the mask of peace.","keywords":["conflict avoidance","struggle","truce","anger-ridden","quarrel-weary"],"archetype":"The field after the fight: some have lowered their batons and negotiated, others are silently angry without speaking out. The bright option is the end of the war, the working lull, found a common language. Dark - the conflict is not resolved, but driven inward, from where he continues to gnaw.\n\nThe card also describes someone who is so afraid of arguing that he agrees with everyone, and then retaliates with quiet sabotage. Unspoken disagreement settles in body and relationships. Its lesson is to learn to have an honest, safe argument so that the world is real, not a truce before the next battle.","daily":"The family has stopped working out the relationship, but they've almost stopped talking, with the misunderstanding hanging in the air, and the unwashed dishes causing a storm, and there's a good outcome, and the old quarrel is finally over, and your move is to call things by their proper names: one quiet conversation takes a week of deafness.","career":"The conflict subsides: the team has a truce, the controversial project is closed, the competitor has left the market, but the card warns that keeping silent in meetings when a decision is wrong, and then slowing it down covertly is an expensive strategy.","love":"The truce is announced, but the bill is not paid: the grievances are hidden in the closet and are received by any chance. Sometimes, on the contrary, the card shows reconciliation after a loud quarrel - passion purified by a storm. It is simple to distinguish: after a real peace, it is easier to breathe, after a truce - quieter.","health":"Repressed emotions come out through the body: shoulder and jaw clamps, insomnia after seemingly calm days, exacerbation of gastritis. Chronic avoidance of quarrels exhausts as much as open struggle. Body practices and an emotional diary help - anger should become a word before it becomes an ulcer.","esoteric":"War gone underground: repressed anger manifests itself in the drain of power, a series of petty failures, self-sabotage of rituals. Recommended techniques for safe fire — load, fiery rituals of farewell to resentment. Peace bought by silence is not based on any conspiracy.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Strife","title_ru":"Lord of Struggle","why":"Saturn limits and restrains the lion's desire to shine and dominate, and the Five itself is conflicted, so energy comes out as a struggle for place and the right to manifest."}}},{"id":"wands-six","name_ru":"Six of Wands","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"wands","number":6,"img":"wands-six.webp","element":"Fire","astro":"Jupiter in Leo","upright":{"short":"A triumphant procession on a white horse: victory is recognized, laurels are worn, and those whose opinion is important applaud.","keywords":["victory","recognition","triumph","succession","glory","confidence"],"archetype":"The laurel wreath rider rides through the jubilant crowd, lifting a wand decorated with flowers. The six is the card of public victory: not a quiet \"it happened,\" but recognition through the eyes of those whose opinion is weighty. The exam is passed, the project is accepted, the candidate is elected - society confirms your victory.\n\nThe card has an honest caveat: laurels are woven by others. The six teaches you to accept praise without conceit, the horse is beneath you, but the road is paved by many. The victory shared with the team doubles; the prize melts. It is the laurels of the leader who is applauded while he remembers who he owes his triumph.","daily":"The good news is that you're praised, congratulated, exemplified. It's a good time to speak, to post, to interview -- the audience is kind. Enjoy yourself well by fulfilling the long-held promise of \"success\": joy, lived out loud, builds confidence.","career":"Professional triumph: the presentation was brilliant, the promotion was received, the project was recognized as the best. The card favors public professions and elections of any kind, reputation is at its peak. Use the moment for the next tasks - and thank the team out loud.","love":"You're chosen with pride and pride, with friends and family, beautiful gestures, social bragging, single Six, a fan who's nice to be around, and remember one thing: relationships don't live on stage, they live behind the scenes.","health":"Victory tone: the disease recedes, rehabilitation is ahead of schedule, training gives quick results. Confession cures psychosomatics better than pills. Be careful with fanfare - the temptation to \"break everyone\" in the room ends in overload: joy is also a load.","esoteric":"The triumphant card: the practice has borne fruit, and the environment has noticed it, and it's about the rites of recognition, the initiation of the degree, the blessing of the teacher, and it's about reputation and influence, and the advice is simple: blessings given to others come back multiplied.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Victory","title_ru":"Lord of Victory","why":"Jupiter expands the lion's confidence, status and recognition, and the six brings harmonious realization, so the result is victory and public acceptance."}},"reversed":{"short":"Laurels are inverted: recognition slips away, victory is contested or bought by intrigue, the ego sounds louder than the case.","keywords":["fall-off","oppressiveness","vanity","jealousy","ignobleness","false triumph"],"archetype":"The triumph turns into a scandal: the victory is contested, the award went to another, and yesterday's crowd hisses after. Sometimes it's an honest defeat - the result was weaker than the stated one; sometimes a victory bought by intrigue, and such a crown burns whiskey.\n\nThere's a quiet, frequent story, an unrecognized talent: the job is great, and you're not seen, and the bitterness builds up inside, and then the card asks the awkward question: do you work for the cause or for the applause? While laurels are more important than the road, every victory is imaginary. Free yourself from the appreciation, recognition will come back.","daily":"There is no expected ovation: effort went unnoticed, praise was appropriated by another, the home greets the news coolly, gossip and hurtful comparisons are possible. Don't ask for approval - fix the result for yourself: real satisfaction today is obtained in the business, not in the reviews.","career":"They gave the promotion to someone else, the idea was attributed to the boss, the client chose a competitor, the card warns of narcissism: confidence without results annoys the management, pause in the struggle for status and strengthen the texture — numbers and terms are more eloquent than regalia.","love":"Relationships become the arena of status: your partner is measured by achievement, demands admiration, is ashamed of you in front of friends; you can have a flaunted romance where you care about the picture, not the intimacy; or you feel like a statist in front of him; a love where you have to win applause is a performance, not a union.","health":"The stress of non-recognition is reflected in the body: pressure jumps, insomnia suffers, skin reacts with rashes, there is a risk of self-medication and dangerous experiments \"to spite everyone.\" Calm the inner triumphant: the body needs a regimen and a doctor, not records against all.","esoteric":"Pride on the altar: practice becomes self-exhibition, power flows into image maintenance, the card warns of envy and vulnerability to the flattery through which foreign influences enter, the old cure is reliable: anonymous good deeds without witnesses clear the channel faster than rites.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Victory","title_ru":"Lord of Victory","why":"Jupiter expands the lion's confidence, status and recognition, and the six brings harmonious realization, so the result is victory and public acceptance."}}},{"id":"wands-seven","name_ru":"Seven of Wands","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"wands","number":7,"img":"wands-seven.webp","element":"Fire","astro":"Mars in the Lion","upright":{"short":"One against six at the height of the position: defense of what has been achieved, character and readiness to defend their own to the end.","keywords":["defence","persistence","challenge","defense","persistence","winning position"],"archetype":"The young man on the high rise is fighting back with a pole from the six wands rising from below, and he is at the height, and therefore in the minority: the higher the position, the more people want to challenge it. The seven describe the defender: criticism flies, competitors persevere, but the ground underfoot is hard.\n\nThe card respects that weary courage: the hero fights not to capture, but to hold the house, the project, the principles, the boundaries. The opponent is strong, but attacks from below, and you see the whole field. The discipline of defense -- priorities, rest between battles, and refusing to surrender the main thing for petty concessions -- will help to withstand.","daily":"Defense Day: Family comes in with advice, vendors impose services, neighbors occupy parking lots. Choose the principle and stand up calmly; the ability to say no without excuses is more valuable today than eloquence. In the evening, be sure to recover - the defender needs sleep.","career":"You're being tested for strength: a colleague is pointing at your site, a client is haggling, the audience is criticizing. The position is stronger than it seems — you know the case from the inside, and they look from the doorstep. It's good to protect the budget, authorship, terms of the contract: give in to the secondary, hold the main thing — the onslaught will drown.","love":"Relationships are under pressure from outside: family members question their choices, exes remind themselves, life tests their strength; not rightness, but union, standing next to your partner against your circumstances, not above them; and in systematic \"education,\" the card gives you the right to draw the line firmly and definitively.","health":"We're running out of energy, but we have a reserve: chronic sores remind us of themselves when overloaded, immunity is held on the rest of the rest. The state of \"wounded, but standing\" only keeps working when you're on vitamins, sleep, pressure control. Health is a height that you can't take.","esoteric":"The guard on the wall: protection of the level achieved, guarding, resisting the influence of others. The card is favorable for creating shields, consecrating borders, abandoning other people's programs. The best defense is stability: who knows the value of his place, he has no need to convince anyone.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Valour","title_ru":"Lord of Valor","why":"Mars enhances the courage and fighting temperament of the Leo, and the Seven puts the conquered under the test, hence the need to hold the position with their own courage."}},"reversed":{"short":"The defense collapses: there are no more forces, positions are surrendered one after another, and distrust turns allies into besiegers.","keywords":["surrender","exhaustion","fightback","suspicion","defensiveness"],"archetype":"Hands down: the defender either lays down his arms and walks off the high ground, or fights with such frenzy that he alienates his friends. One is honest fatigue: a long siege has eaten up the supplies, and retreat sometimes saves more than the last frontier.\n\nThe second pole is more dangerous, defense, which is reflex: advice reads as attack, help as claim, intimacy as threat, so that not positions are lost, but people are lost. The card offers a revision: which of the guards is the battle, and which are the ruins of the past? Let go of the excess and allow yourself a break.","daily":"A day of defeats: the argument is lost, the line is gone, the thing is broken, you want to quit everything, or vice versa, you gnaw at each one for trifles. Stop: most of today's battles are not worth an hour of sleep. Pick one position that you really hold, let go of the rest.","career":"The projects that are protected are closed: budget cut, team disbanded, arguments broken, maybe you've held the outdated for too long. Another scenario is automatic resistance, which is tired of partners. Sign a truce with reality: keep the core of competence, revamp the shell.","love":"The partner is tired of proving that he is not the enemy: every offer is met with an attack, and he backs down in earnest. Or the relationship has become a siege - claims, phone checks, debt counting. The card calls for disarmament: state your fear out loud, and the war can end without winners.","health":"Long defenses are exhausting: sleep is not restoring strength, in the morning, weakness, irritability in the day, old sores are exacerbated by caffeine and lack of sleep. Reduce the body's defenses in a good way - warm food, massage, cancellation of unnecessary obligations. Admit fatigue - do not give up.","esoteric":"Besieged fortress from within: suspicion opens doors to the one being defended against, stubbornness keeps dead ties, the practitioner clings to old amulets and methods that no longer work, conduct a defense audit: remove what fears hold, leave what love holds.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Valour","title_ru":"Lord of Valor","why":"Mars enhances the courage and fighting temperament of the Leo, and the Seven puts the conquered under the test, hence the need to hold the position with their own courage."}}},{"id":"wands-eight","name_ru":"Eight of Wands","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"wands","number":8,"img":"wands-eight.webp","element":"Fire","astro":"Mercury in Sagittarius","upright":{"short":"Wands fly over the plain: events accelerate, news comes one after another, everything moves simultaneously.","keywords":["speed","lead","movement","flux","rapidity","junction"],"archetype":"Eight wands fly across the sky over the undetained land -- the only card of the suit without people: here is the speed itself. Eight describes the time when the processes started: letters fly, roads open, answers come before questions.\n\nIt's a synergy lace, where individual events add up to a single stream, and what's been going on for months is solved in a day, and fire in the wind burns and moves like one, and your job is not to control every spark, but to choose the direction and keep up with your own acceleration.","daily":"The day is going fast: calls, messages, unexpected offers, fees on the road. Write down — details will slip away. Travel, sending documents, short trips are favorable. If you wait for a long answer, it will come today. Flexibility is more valuable than a plan: adjust as you go.","career":"A sharp acceleration: the contract is signed, the deal is closed, several tasks have come at once, the results are waiting for Friday. Often the card means business trips, moving, international correspondence, everything is in favor of the initiative: whoever answers first, will receive.","love":"Relationships are taking off: confessions ahead of schedule, tickets for tomorrow, flirting in a week turns into an affair; couples — a time of two trips and fresh experiences; singles — a rush of acquaintance, perhaps on the way; fast does not mean superficial, if the heart is turned on.","health":"Metabolism speeds up, energy is a key: the body asks for running, bicycle, dancing, old clamps go away. One caution is rush, the main source of injuries and pressure surges. A minute of silence before eating and sleeping will preserve recovery.","esoteric":"The messenger card: sent to the subtle world comes back quickly, prayer gets an answer, the sign follows the sign. Patronizes work with the elements of air - breathing practices, mantras, magic of words. Indicates the acceleration of karma: sown grows in a matter of days, watch your thoughts.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Swiftness","title_ru":"Lord of Speed.","why":"Mercury is responsible for messaging and fast exchange, and Sagittarius is responsible for long-distance travel and scope, and the Eight makes the flow of events fast and almost unstoppable."}},"reversed":{"short":"The stream has run into a dam: news is late, business is stuck, and fuss creates movement without progress.","keywords":["delay","slowdown","change-resistance","bustle","lateness","lost pace"],"archetype":"The wands are heaped together: everything moves, but it misses the goal. Letters get lost, deadlines shift, people confuse agreements. Sometimes it's objective traffic jams — the weather, queues, other people's mistakes; sometimes it's an internal brake, when a person fears the speed at which he accelerated.\n\nThere's a third sense: change is too quick for the soul. Moving in a week, deciding in an evening, having a romance on the doorstep -- the pace exceeds the ability to digest, and then slowing down is not the enemy, but protection. The difference is simple: a pause that fills, heals; a pause that weighs is a signal to look for what is stuck.","daily":"Transport is still running, the Internet is lost when it's shipped, the courier is moving the delivery, the meetings are sprawling, or the day is bustling, and by the evening it's not clear what's done, don't push the events by force: make a short list of what's possible and go through it without panic.","career":"The process is stalled: the document is stuck in agreement, the client is gone after a hot interest, the release is postponed for the third time. The team simulates activities - meetings instead of solutions. Find a bottleneck: usually it is one. Duplicate channels and record the agreements in writing - the flow will recover.","love":"The messages hang unanswered, the date is postponed, the feeling of being on pause, and it torments the speed-adjusted, perhaps the partner is cold, maybe just overloaded, the opposite is that the relationship is carried around so that both have forgotten why they came together, you need a face-to-face conversation, not in correspondence.","health":"The fitness plan is broken, the treatment is having side effects, the tests have to be retested, the body needs a slower rhythm, vascular jumps from sudden exertion and insomnia from oversaturation of events are dangerous. Take away the stimulants, add water and breathing pauses: the pace should be yours.","esoteric":"Blocked channels: messages don't reach, signs get confused, practices get stuck. Usually it's overload -- too many teachers, rites and practices at once. Stop the outflows and listen: pause in answers is also the answer. Put your airwaves in order, and the messengers will find the address again.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Swiftness","title_ru":"Lord of Speed.","why":"Mercury is responsible for messaging and fast exchange, and Sagittarius is responsible for long-distance travel and scope, and the Eight makes the flow of events fast and almost unstoppable."}}},{"id":"wands-nine","name_ru":"Nine of Wands","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"wands","number":9,"img":"wands-nine.webp","element":"Fire","astro":"The Moon in Sagittarius","upright":{"short":"A wounded fighter on the final line: strength is running out, wound experience has become armor, and victory is closer than it seems.","keywords":["persistence","last","experience","alertness","endurance","win"],"archetype":"A fighter with a headband rests on a baton and guards the camp: nine battles behind, another onslaught ahead. Nine wands are the card of the last jerk: fatigue is real, but surrender would be a mistake, because the goal is almost achieved.\n\nThe hero's bandage says something important: he survived and learned a lesson, his caution is a memory of price, not cowardice. The card respects that mature vigilance. Ask for support if necessary, but keep your distance: what you held on to is about to pay off.","daily":"The day is checked before the finish: the repairs are almost complete, the report is almost ready, the series of cases is almost closed. If you want to drop in the middle, do not give in. Break the rest in a portion and go one by one. In the evening, note the past: you are further than you feel.","career":"The business marathon is on the last lap: the project is given up, the negotiations require final pressure, the competitors make final attacks, you have the advantage of experience, base, reputation, hold on, do not open new fronts, and after the surrender take a real rest.","love":"Old wounds make themselves felt: the partner has to prove that he is not from a past nightmare. Sometimes the card shows a person who, after pain, closed himself and defends himself against the one who loves. The wall once protected, now it is a prison - give the loved one a chance not to repeat another's mistake.","health":"Recovery from illness or prolonged stress is ongoing, but there is no full form: residual effects, fatigue, dosing the load and making sure to complete the treatment, and that's when many people drop out of therapy and roll back, and caution is a form of respect for the body.","esoteric":"Guardian Warrior: The power gained through trials becomes a talisman. The card is about species protection practices, memory of trials, working with teachers through pain. Initiation is almost complete, the final test is left. Carrying your scars with dignity is also a magical act.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Great Strength","title_ru":"Lord of the Great Power","why":"Nine concentrates the accumulated strength of the suit. The moon makes the reaction defensive and instinctive, Sagittarius does not give up the goal - hence the endurance and willingness to hold the line."}},"reversed":{"short":"Siege without meaning: defense has become paranoia, forces are exhausted, man is fighting with the shadows and sees no help.","keywords":["exhaustion","defence","mistrust","stubbornness","back-kick","stand-off"],"archetype":"War goes on because it's the way it is: a man has forgotten what he's protecting, but he can't stop. Every neighbor is an enemy, every pause is a trap. Sometimes it's true that it's a long-lasting siege, more often defensive automatism that has outlived its cause.\n\nThe second story is a fall in the last meter: nine stages are sustained, the tenth is failed not by enemies, but by exhaustion and unwillingness to ask for help. The pride of a wounded fighter is an expensive luxury. The card asks: are you defending life or the habit of holding the defense? Sometimes the courage to lower the staff and take up the hand.","daily":"Standby mode: noises annoy, questions are perceived as attacks, a breakdown causes a storm, relatives tiptoe and you're sure they created the tension, admit fatigue out loud - for one thing, one honest evening without defense lowers the degree better than a weekend.","career":"\"Only I Can\" has taken it to the limit: you hold everything, you don't trust anyone, you work hard and you get stuck on your colleagues, and the project is stuck. Delegate at least the periphery, fix the boundaries of the day, otherwise the next conversation will not be for the result, but for the tone.","love":"The partner gives up: attempts at intimacy are broken against a wall of checks and reproaches; one is eternally wounded, the other is eternally guilty; love does not require you to stop taking care of yourself; it asks you to distinguish the present person from the old pain; it asks you to end the war with the ex more honestly than to fight the innocent.","health":"Chronic fatigue has turned into exhaustion: sleep is not restoring strength, immunity is failing, old injuries are exacerbating, the body has long signaled surrender, but you wrote it down as weakness, you need a doctor's check, a leave of absence and cancellation of part of the obligations - otherwise it will end in a hospital bed.","esoteric":"The guard who forgets who he's watching: shields are lined up against everyone, including helpers, defenses are automatic, old attachments to grievances and birth survival programs around. Start with security clearance: a world where you can take off your armor at least for the night exists.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Great Strength","title_ru":"Lord of the Great Power","why":"Nine concentrates the accumulated strength of the suit. The moon makes the reaction defensive and instinctive, Sagittarius does not give up the goal - hence the endurance and willingness to hold the line."}}},{"id":"wands-ten","name_ru":"Ten of Wands","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"wands","number":10,"img":"wands-ten.webp","element":"Fire","astro":"Saturn in Sagittarius","upright":{"short":"Heavy knitting on the shoulder: the burden of responsibility is great, but the goal is visible, and to bring the matter to the end is a matter of honor.","keywords":["duty","responsibility","overload","finishing-stage","debt","persistence"],"archetype":"The man bent under a wand, but he walks to the house that's already visible. The ten is a card of the big burden: commitments made honestly or from outside have reached their maximum, and the load is meaningful, someone needs it, and the distance is finite.\n\nThe card captures a bitter pattern: we don't notice the moment when responsibility ceased to be a service and became a habit of dragging everything ourselves. The ten doesn't condemn labor, they ask about distribution: why are other people's logs in the knitting? The end is near; you have to walk with a straight back, not a crawl.","daily":"The to-do list is longer than a day, the household routinely shifts it to you, and you accept it. Prioritize what's real today, what's not yours at all. Ask for help directly, without hinting, and check the backpack -- half of the \"duties\" exist only in your head.","career":"The final line of a big project: deadlines are tight, reporting is multiplied, and the area that three should share is held by you alone, the card recognizes the irreplaceability, but warns: it's not far from burnout. Complete the stage, record the results - and immediately discuss the unloading.","love":"You carry everything: budget, lifestyle, emotional climate, plans for two, and the partner used to travel with luggage and considers it normal. The porter sooner or later bends or drops the knitting in the ravine. Talk about weight distribution in advance, not at the time of breakdown: love is when the burden is shared.","health":"The classic overload: back and shoulder pain, heaviness in the legs, pressure surges, perpetual fatigue in normal tests. The body asks for unloading before it breaks. Sleep, massage, delegation of household and prohibition of overtime are mandatory - recovery will begin as soon as you put the knit.","esoteric":"A cross that is carried voluntarily and has long outgrown: a card that points to karmic overloads — roles and ancestral duties taken without asking — its practice is the consecration of labor and honest inventory of the burden: to take back someone else’s, to thank one’s own, and to bring the rest to the door of a straight back home.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Oppression","title_ru":"Lord of Oppression","why":"The ten brings the fiery force to its limit, and Saturn turns the expansion of Sagittarius into the weight of duties and constraints. The energy becomes too much for free movement."}},"reversed":{"short":"The knitting crumbles or is thrown: the limit has come - either you learn to say \"no\" or the load breaks your back.","keywords":["discharge","delegation","crushing","abandonment","limit-weight"],"archetype":"The burden requires a solution. The bright option is that the person unbuttons the weight, some of the load is foreign, some of the load is unnecessary, and the straightened back wonders how many years it has been carrying, and this is a lesson in delegation and the right to no, said without fault.\n\nThe darker version is the more severe: the knitted one is the one that knocks the owner down, the health, the relationship, or the business breaks down under the weight that they refused to share in time, and the opposite extreme is the resetting of all obligations at once, when they throw away their own obligations, and liberation is different from escape, one thing: they left behind them.","daily":"The limit has come: either you suddenly refuse to take care of yourself, causing a storm in the accustomed, or you break down physically, there are possible breakdowns that require money and hands not only of yours, the right move is a quiet revision: a to-do list, from it is deleted the other person, the rest is distributed in writing.","career":"Boiling point: the employee leaves the burning projects, the manager removes the excess areas, the team demands a revision of the norms, sometimes the collapse of the structure, which for years was held on the enthusiasm of two, the leader should delegate for real; the subordinate — formalize the amount of work or leave.","love":"Partnerships are skewed to the limit: one goes on strike, and it turns out how many functions have been performed for years in silence; breakup is possible as a release from the burden of love; if the union is alive, crisis is a chance to rebuild distribution; if dead, to throw off the knitting - mercy for both.","health":"Your body has scored: exacerbations of chronic diseases, back problems, nervous exhaustion, all the way to tears from the lights on. Your body does what you didn't dare to do, stops. Treatment is impossible without changing your life: start with sleep and one canceled duty, therapy will only work in a new reality.","esoteric":"Resetting pocket bags: The practitioner sees that he has carried for years other people's programs, birth fears, obligations of deceased contracts. The card is favorable for rites of return of another person and the withdrawal of vows that you did not make. Careful: the released hand should remain open, not empty - along with the cargo do not give the gift.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Oppression","title_ru":"Lord of Oppression","why":"The ten brings the fiery force to its limit, and Saturn turns the expansion of Sagittarius into the weight of duties and constraints. The energy becomes too much for free movement."}}},{"id":"wands-page","name_ru":"Page of Wands","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"wands","number":null,"img":"wands-page.webp","element":"Fire","astro":null,"upright":{"short":"The Young Herald of Fire: the thirst for discovery, fresh ideas and the energy of a beginner for whom the world has not yet been solved.","keywords":["messenger","curiosity","enthusiasm","novelty","liberty","beginner"],"archetype":"Page looks at the green sprouts on the top of the staff, as if he had discovered for the first time that the tree was alive, behind the hills, on the belt of the helmet, he's ready to hike tomorrow, that spirit of the pioneering disciple: little knowledge, curiosity for ten, and every day promises discovery.\n\nThe card describes the energy of beginning without the burden of expertise: try, ask, run, find out. The strength of Page is precisely that he is not afraid to know anything. In the layouts, he often brings news about a new business — a letter, a call, a proposal that will pinch in his chest, and points to a young man full of fire.","daily":"A day of surprises of good tone: a surprise message, an invitation, an idea of why not. I want to move -- a new route of walking, a master class, a disassembled pantry with a forgotten find. Good time to play with children: the younger ones today say the most interesting things.","career":"Fresh wind: the intern offers a good idea, you are assigned a new direction, you get an invitation to study or an internship, the card is favorable for mastering the profession from scratch and the first public steps. Don't demand from the stage of status - his currency of experience and connections; the courage of stupid questions is more expensive than the sight of an all-knowing expert.","love":"The novel begins as an adventure: lightness, laughter, walking until the morning and no scripts. The page brings literal news — a message from a person from the past or the first \"hello\" from a new one. The card advises couples the language of the pioneers: an unusual date, a tent overnight, a joint adventure.","health":"The tone is young regardless of passport: the body responds to games, not coercion. The best recipes of the day are bicycle, trampoline, dancing, any activity for pleasure. Emotional lifting itself improves sleep and appetite. The enthusiasm of the beginner is prone to overload — add loads gradually.","esoteric":"A student who has begun to dream prophetic dreams: first self-contact with the subtle world, pure and strong, not yet touched by patterns. The card is favorable for starting learning, first practice with a new tool, travel of strength. The holy impudence of questions opens doors that solidity bypasses."},"reversed":{"short":"A spark without a wick: ideas fade and fade, words outpace deeds, and anxiety poses as enthusiasm.","keywords":["immaturity","scatteriness","bad news","talkiness","stoppage","fuzziness"],"archetype":"The beginner who stays at the beginning: a hundred courses without one completed, a thousand promises without being fulfilled, his fire goes to spectacular declarations, not to deeds, sometimes it is just age and inexperience, sometimes infantilism, conveniently hiding behind charm for years.\n\nThe second side is the distorted news: rumors, gossip, misread messages; double-check the news when the Page is upside down. The third is the silenced inner child: the person has forgotten what it is to play and want, and envys the ease of others under the guise of fatigue. The card calls not to rigor, but to honesty: what do you really want?","daily":"The day is full: ten things started, zero done, the phone eats up the evening, promises are made faster than execution, there may be annoying news — transfer, cancellation, gossip in a chat room. The salvation is simple: one screen, one task, an hour of concentration. In the evening, do something uselessly joyful to hear yourself.","career":"Childhood growth sickness: a coworker promises more than he does; you grab everything and break short deadlines, dampening your reputation; news that comes may change plans — check the source before you react. Pick one skill and bring it to the level of \"skill\": reliability is older than the certificate collection.","love":"The fun-easy-to-take-responsibility phase is where the partner evades definitions, flirts with correspondence, disappears and returns with flowers, or is it you who hide behind jokes from the depths, sometimes the card warns of rumors affecting the couple, do you need a companion or an audience?","health":"Uneven rhythms can get you into trouble: hyperactivity until midnight, apathy before lunch, food on the run, sleep in snails. Childhood illnesses can remind you of themselves as adults. Return regimen as a form of care, not punishment: the same time of rising, eating at the table, walking without headphones.","esoteric":"A young spirit playing with fire is not by the rules: practices are started and abandoned, tools are bought and forgotten, knowledge is told by ear. A card warns of spiritual chatter and your own spiritual shopping. Go back to the first practice and finish it: depth is always more modest than collection."}},{"id":"wands-knight","name_ru":"Knight of Wands","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"wands","number":null,"img":"wands-knight.webp","element":"Fire","astro":null,"upright":{"short":"Rider on a soaring horse: impulse, charm and willingness to race where others only plan.","keywords":["rush","adventure","passion","charm","swiftness","boldness"],"archetype":"The knight of the wands flies faster than the wind: the cloak flies, the horse stands on its hinds, the helmet does not fasten — once. The fastest card of the deck embodies a pure impulse: he falls in love with the horizon, throws himself at a challenge and starts five things at once — and he manages.\n\nHis power is contagious: he wants to live louder next to him. The price of speed is that the Knight is bad at distinguishing between fast and forever. He is the hero of the start: if you want to finish, take him to accelerate, and at a distance, the one who breathes evenly. Today is his time: the world belongs to those who jump.","daily":"The day will be galloping: a spontaneous trip out of town, a surprise meeting, a renovation half finished for dinner, a great time for activities that have been delayed because of solidity: go-karting, horseback riding, a night movie show. Finish at least one you started and you have a good day.","career":"Storm: the project starts before the competition, the deal closes in three days, you fly to the negotiations across half the country. A card is favorable for sales, startups, emergency tasks where you need speed and courage. Knightly energy decides the entrance, but not the escort — immediately assign who will lead the matter further.","love":"The romance of the hurricane: acquaintance in the morning, date in the evening, plans for the night, looking. The Knight of Wands is the most passionate deck holder, generous in gestures and words, sincere exactly to the next horizon. Single is a bright adventure; couples - a flash of past passion in a joint escape from everyday life. Enjoy the wind, but do not build castles out of first delight.","health":"Energy over the edge: the body requires extremes -- sprint, motorsport, dance until you drop, fast metabolism, great tone, wounds heal in the eyes. The main risk is speed itself: sprains, bruises, burns from rushing. Check the equipment and do not miss the warm-up.","esoteric":"The warrior-agent who follows the call without a card: purity of impulse as a method. The card is accompanied by pilgrimages, dedications, the practice of decisive action. It also tests the motive: do I call or run away? When the impulse is directed by service, it opens doors that calculation bypasses for years."},"reversed":{"short":"The horse carries or stands up: the energy is over the edge without a goal, promises are made faster than they are fulfilled, the path is broken.","keywords":["impulsivity","foiled","recklessness","spraying","hollow-promise","delay"],"archetype":"The knight rushes without taking the road, breaks other people's borders, and after a week he does not remember why he jumped, or the reverse picture: the horse stands, the rider sulks - there is energy, there is no movement, and anger from his own inaction spills out on his fellow men.\n\nBoth are powerless, and the card also describes a man whose beautiful promises fail: \"Tomorrow we will begin,\" \"In a month we will marry,\" \"I will give up everything for you.\" Test knights with deeds, not with the speed of vows. Lesson: bridging is not the enemy of freedom -- one goal, one term, one horse, and then wee.","daily":"A day ripped like a bumpy ride: late, rushing with mistakes, reworking. Probably canceling a trip, breaking a transport, a ticket for haste. Homes get tired of the swing \"soars up and collapses.\" The tool is simple: a written list for the day and the rule \"finish first, then start.\"","career":"Adventure or paralysis: a colleague sparks an idea and disappears in the implementation phase; you lead three projects and fail each timeline; you can have a broken contract, a cancelled business trip, a conflict over amateurism; you get the power and resources before you jump, which is boring, but that's how ideas get to the market.","love":"Passion with roll: the partner blinds with gestures and disappears at a critical moment, promises peace and does not come to the meeting. There is jealousy without reason, finding out at speed, deciding to move at midnight. If you are a rider, check if you are pressing at a pace. Proximity is tested by the second kilometer: who is left when the wind subsides?","health":"Swings from hyperactivity to apathy hit the heart and nerves: pressure surges, trauma from rushing, inflammation in the background of exhaustion, the consequences of extreme entertainment. The body does not need a ban on movement, but the steering wheel is a coach, a plan, warm-ups. And honest sleep: without it, any impulse is an accident.","esoteric":"Power sent without an address: rites boomerang, anger returns with disease, spiritual leaps in tradition spray the accumulated wealth. The card warns of people wreaking havoc in the guise of fire and vows made in a rush. Return the reins: one practice, one vow, one path."}},{"id":"wands-queen","name_ru":"Queen of Wands","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"wands","number":null,"img":"wands-queen.webp","element":"Fire","astro":null,"upright":{"short":"The mistress of fire: charisma and warmth, business acumen and magnetism of a man who knows his own value and warms his own.","keywords":["confidence","charisma","heat","self-sufficiency","business-likeness","magnetism"],"archetype":"The Queen's throne is carved with lions, and at her foot a sunflower has curled up -- a fire turned to the light. She looks straight, with a little challenge: the queen, who is setting her own hearth. In the suit of wands, she embodies mature fire -- not gust, but constant burning: the warmth of the house, the drive of the business, the magnetism of the personality.\n\nThe queen is a mistress in the best sense of the word: her power nourishes others without exhaustion. She leads projects, hosts, loves passionately and lives big. The card states that femininity and power do not argue with each other when both grow out of self-esteem. Her lesson is to shine not with combustion, but with burning.","daily":"Housewife's Day: you do everything -- lunch for six, important calls, a run. You're in your element, with lots of things to do and lots of people. It's good to bring beauty to the interior, to get friends at the table, to have a family party. The energy is spent generously and comes back doubly.","career":"Professional peak: you lead a team, you deliver brilliantly, you combine several projects without loss of quality. The card is favorable for managers and everyone who builds business on personal charm — sales, PR, education, hospitality. Colleagues come to you for both a solution and a charge: that is leadership.","love":"The love of mature passion: you attract without pursuing, and you give warmth without dissolving. You pair up with even fire, loyalty and generosity, a home you want to return to. The Queen promises to meet a person who is worthy of your energy level. Just don't play out of reach - sincerity is stronger than play.","health":"Healthy, provided that self-care is included in the to-do list: The Queen tends to serve everyone by forgetting to eat. The basis of her strength is regularity: eating, moving, resting on schedule. Dancing, bathing, sunshine are useful. The \"burnout\" symptom is a signal to slow down before illness occurs.","esoteric":"The witch-master of the hearth in the old sense: the power of the house altar, the amulets of the family, the magic of hospitality and the word spoken at the table. The queen of wands patronizes the practices of abundance and home protection, working with fire and the sun. Her secret is order in her own flame: first she kindled, then she gave."},"reversed":{"short":"The fire turned inward: behind the bright facade - jealousy and complacency or burnout and quiet loss of oneself.","keywords":["jealousy","complacency","burnout","loss of self-esteem","manipulation","irritability"],"archetype":"The upside down Queen is the mistress who lost her hearth. The first pole is outward: despotic, jealousy, the need to command everyone who is in the circle, resentment at not recognizing. The second is inward: the facade is bright, and the void is inside, irritation and the quiet question, \"Who am I without my roles?\"\n\nOften, the card describes a person who has been a mom, a mistress and a motor for years until it is discovered that his own fire is not being fueled, envy and pickiness are symptoms of hunger for heat, not evil nature, treatment begins with permission to take care of yourself, not least.","daily":"A day of stress: little things get annoying, homely \"doing nothing right,\" trying to control everything ends in a fight, or vice versa - apathy and \"leave me alone\" in broad daylight. Don't demand the usual brilliance: minimum things, a warm bath, early withdrawal.","career":"The climate has gone bad: the boss picks on her, the colleague takes credit, you give away the harshness and then you regret it. There may be a crisis of an overloaded leader — there is power, there is no energy. Delegate and acknowledge fatigue where it is safe — the team exhales.","love":"Jealousy and control poison the alliance: checking the phone, counting the grievances, demanding proof of love. Sometimes the card shows a couple where one shines and the other warms his fame as an entourage. Ask yourself honestly: do you love a person or fear losing a role with him? The warmth returns with tenderness to himself.","health":"Your body signals burnout: hormonal swings, female flares, migraines, eating breakdowns, emotional stress jumps from irritability to tears, you need a doctor, rest and exercise reduction, not a vitamin on top of three jobs: recovery starts with withdrawal, not with addition.","esoteric":"The Queen inverted is a hearth covered with ashes: the practice is formal, there is no strength; there may be damage to fade or, more often, self-prohibition of your own radiance. The card indicates envy in the environment and attachment to old grievances. Start simple: light a candle for yourself, not for the ritual, and listen to what you feel."}},{"id":"wands-king","name_ru":"King of Wands","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"wands","number":null,"img":"wands-king.webp","element":"Fire","astro":null,"upright":{"short":"The Visionary on the Throne: Scale of Thinking, Enterprise Courage, and Power That Leads, Not Pressures.","keywords":["leadership","vision","enterprise","scale","power-holder","inspirational"],"archetype":"The king of wands sits on a throne with lions' faces, holding alive a sprouted staff: the power that creates, not guards. He sees the whole picture — the market, the country, the decade — and he can light up others with this picture, the most charismatic of the four power cards.\n\nHis strength is the mature version of the Ace: not a spark, but a fireplace that lights up entire teams, and he opens doors, gives his word, takes his chances, and generously shares his victory, and the card asks the same thing: don't wait for permission to build what you see, because the throne is based on trust, and trust is based on truth.","daily":"Close-up day: you decide what year it will be, not what to eat for dinner. It's good to take responsibility for it -- to put together a family council, to help a friend with a crucial conversation, to open a door with word and connections. Generosity and clarity are back in a hundredfold today.","career":"Your leadership hour: starting your own business, getting promoted to a director, taking the company to the next level. The card is favorable for strategic decisions, big deals, public speaking. People are willing to follow you - formulate a vision specifically and do not make promises that they do not intend to keep.","love":"The adult-fire relationship: you know what you want, and you speak it out, taking the initiative and protecting the union on your own. Warm and quietly beside the equal - and stuffy to the one you choose to live for. The lonely King promises to meet a strong, accomplished person. The main temptation is to turn love into control.","health":"The margin is big, but the stakes are high: heart and pressure are the first indicators of a leader's overload. Keep fit through regularity, not feats: sports, examinations, sleep. Psychosomatics is honest: the body will get sick from an overwhelming burden. Power over yourself is more important than power over others.","esoteric":"The Sorcerer's Card: Power with Responsibility, Teaching, Foundation of Schools and Traditions. The King of Wands patronizes those who create systems and impart knowledge, his staff sprouted because it was put into action. The practice of this card is to take no more than you can communicate and answer for those you have lit."},"reversed":{"short":"The throne has swung: power without vision turns into despotism, impulsive decisions and a loss of trust.","keywords":["oppressiveness","impulsivity","hubris","abuse","loss of authority","fuzziness"],"archetype":"The inverted King is the ruler who has confused power with pressure. The first option is that despots are decisions alone, opinions are turned into noise, goals change in mood, the environment is afraid rather than believing. The second is that weakness under the crown is that promises are not kept, responsibility is reduced, authority is waning before our eyes.\n\nBoth portraits are a story of fire without a hearth: charisma is there, no foundation. The card comes to those who have reached power before maturity or hold onto it without respect. The card question is: do you lead people where they are better off — or where you are more comfortable? Trust is restored in one way: by promises fulfilled.","daily":"It's a day of complacency or confusion: you give directions that no one understands, you cancel agreements, you break with loved ones, then make amends with gifts, or you dodge a simple decision, and it's made without you. Before every harsh word, take a moment to pause: today it's worth more than an hour of persuasion.","career":"Leadership is on edge: rash orders, personnel swings, conflict with advisers who told the truth, loss of contract due to overconfidence or scandal with a partner, the subordinate should record the agreements in writing and not sign anything on emotions, if you are the leader, regain the right to be wrong.","love":"In a relationship, it's a dictatorship or a king who surrenders, either your partner lives by your rules under the threat of storms, or you keep silent while the union collapses, there's a new person who is beautifully courted and doesn't do a word. Love abhors the throne: equality is the only sustainable form of intimacy.","health":"The cardiovascular system is the first to be responsible for complacency and stress: hypertensive crises, rhythm disturbances, insomnia after winning days, the risk of starting health with the conviction that it will pass itself - or throwing yourself into fashionable techniques without a doctor. The body needs a sovereign, not a tyrant: regime, examination, calm.","esoteric":"The fallen master of the subtle world: the power taken without right goes through the ego - the practices give flashes and devastation, the students leave, the channels are blocked by pride. The card warns of false teachers and of its own thirst for power over someone else's will. The remedy is old: service without posters returns measure to any staff."}},{"id":"cups-ace","name_ru":"Ace of Cups","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"cups","number":1,"img":"cups-ace.webp","element":"Water","astro":null,"upright":{"short":"The source of the senses is revealed: new love, inspiration and a generous gift of warmth.","keywords":["love","emotionality","feeling-fullness","inspiration","compassion","blessing","creative impulse"],"archetype":"The hand from the cloud stretches out a bowl full of water to the edges: five jets of water, a dove with a disk, flowering lotuses. Waite has this image of a gift from above — a feeling that comes not by calculation, but as a blessing. Cups are the element of Water, and the Ace opens the spring itself: love and creative power have not yet taken shape, but are already hitting with the key.\n\nThe card represents a new emotional beginning, a love, a deep attachment, a creative flow or a spiritual fulfillment, and it is the purest water of suit: the possibilities are wide, the heart is ready to love and give, and the world reciprocates.","daily":"Open Feelings Day: a surprisingly warm encounter, reconciliation after a quarrel, good news from your family, start a family tradition or call someone you haven't spoken to in a long time, and the conversation will be easy and bring relief to both.","career":"The birth of a heart-breaking idea: a new project, a creative application, a first recognition. Colleagues are kind, help comes by itself. Start something you really want to invest in, and the joy of the process is then converted into the result.","love":"One of the great love cards is meeting, acknowledging, proposing, or having a heart-to-heart conversation, and then everything changes, and the feelings are mutual and playless, and the relationship is a clean start, and for couples who are dreaming of a child, it's a frequent hint of conception.","health":"The rush of vitality and rapid recovery from illness. Emotional health heals the body: relieved stress and the return of taste for life make more drugs. Pregnancy planning is favorable; water in all kinds is useful - pool, baths, walks by water bodies.","esoteric":"The ace of the cup is the image of the Grail: descending grace and the awakening of the heart center. The card is drawn to call love, to heal relationships, to open a creative channel. It tells you that the answer will come not through logic, but through quiet knowledge of the heart.","gd":{"title_en":"The Root of the Powers of Water","title_ru":"Root of the Powers of Water","why":"It is pure water to a specific form: a source of feelings, receptivity, love and emotional fulfillment."}},"reversed":{"short":"The cup is overturned: feelings are blocked, love does not reach the recipient, inspiration flows away.","keywords":["heart-lock","emotion-stricken","irresponsibility","ravages","disappointment","stagnation","op-ed"],"archetype":"An inverted cup can neither accept nor hold: the water spreads, the gift remains unaccepted, feelings are there, but they are too tight — the person has forgotten how to express them, is afraid of vulnerability or has long decided not to feel so that it does not hurt.\n\nThe card is about repressed experiences, unrequited feelings, devastation after something that should have been happy, often brings sad news or cancellation of a long-awaited event, not a sentence, but a signal: the heart canal is clogged and must be carefully cleaned without requiring immediate happiness.","daily":"Coldness of the home: conversations are short, the scheduled meeting is canceled. Don't keep your anger silent, it turns your house into a glacier. Say out loud what you're missing, even if it seems \"and so clear\": inefficiency is more important than conflict.","career":"Work is losing its taste: business is routine, ideas are not working, criticism is more powerful than usual, you can have a situation where work has been devalued. This is not a time for harsh decisions, figure out what killed inspiration, and get back the meaning of work.","love":"Irresponsibility or asymmetry: one loves, the other allows himself to love; the partner is closed to talking about feelings. If a couple is expecting a child, the card may indicate a delay - it is more important to care for each other than to chase yourself with a calendar.","health":"Decline and psychosomatics: Repressed emotions are comatose in the throat and heaviness in the chest, swelling and lethargy are possible, sleep, water, a diary of feelings, talking to a specialist, forcing yourself to \"reason\" is counterproductive now.","esoteric":"Clogged heart center: Love practices don't work until old pain is released. Start with purification -- forgiveness, letters without sending, working with the inner child. You can't fill the vessel without pouring musty things out of it.","gd":{"title_en":"The Root of the Powers of Water","title_ru":"Root of the Powers of Water","why":"It is pure water to a specific form: a source of feelings, receptivity, love and emotional fulfillment."}}},{"id":"cups-two","name_ru":"Two of Cups","name_en":"","number":2,"type":"minor","suit":"cups","img":"cups-two.webp","element":"Water","astro":"Venus in Cancer.","upright":{"short":"Two hearts agree: mutual sympathy, the union of equals, harmony in a pair or a working tandem.","keywords":["mutuality","attraction","partnership","harmony","balance","engagement","trust"],"archetype":"A young man and a girl exchange cups; above them a Hermes caduceus and a winged lion. Every detail of Waite's drawing says one thing: the meeting of two equals heals and transforms, \"I\" and \"you\" add up to a stable \"we.\"\n\nTraditionally, the card means mutual sympathy and a contract of hearts: attraction, engagement, peace after a quarrel. Its language is broader than romance - any partnership where the exchange is equivalent: tandem, co-authorship, a union of like-minded people. To the question \"Is it possible to union?\" The two cups answer \"yes\" if both are willing to give as much as they take.","daily":"It's a good time for anything that's done by the two of you: dinner together, cleaning for two, a conversation that's been delayed for a long time, reconciliation is easy, household issues are solved in one sentence, if there was tension in the family, today it's enough to have a small gesture to meet.","career":"Tandem time: co-founding, strong lead-subject, bargaining that is both parties' best; the ideal time to offer or accept a partnership is trust high; projects with clear roles are surprisingly high; single-handed work is less productive.","love":"Reciprocity, engagement, wedding, second honeymoon, lonely people are going to meet with a tangible, almost physical attraction, where both read each other's thoughts, and the relationship is going to be a conscious choice: we're together, and it's a decision, not a habit.","health":"The body recovers when there is support: treatment is easier in a couple or group; harmonious intimate life directly affects tone and sleep; couples practices are favorable - yoga, massage, dancing: the psyche calms down where the whole is taken.","esoteric":"Alchemical marriage: the combination of opposites into a larger whole. The caduceus on the card is the sign of Hermes, the patron saint of healing, so the card is used in rituals of reconciliation and bonding. Lesson: the magic of a relationship begins where both look at each other, not at profit.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Love","title_ru":"Lord of Love.","why":"Venus connects and attracts, and Cancer seeks emotional intimacy and secure bonding, and the two make a pair, so meaning almost literally becomes Love."}},"reversed":{"short":"The exchange has broken down: an imbalance of “give more than I get,” strained relationships, brewing rupture.","keywords":["disorder","pairing","distance","quarrel","mistrust","gap","power-struggle"],"archetype":"The cups don't come together: each holds his higher, and the exchange stops. The winged lion loses power where equality has disappeared, instead of union, there is a deal with unilateral advantage.\n\nThe card indicates imbalance, tension, trust abuse, sometimes it's just fatigue and accumulated petty grievances, sometimes it's a symptom of a deep mismatch, where \"we\" exists by inertia, and in any case, an honest renegotiation of the terms of the union is required.","daily":"Domestic rift: arguing about sharing responsibilities, feeling like you're not being heard, talking over the lip. Don't audit your claims at the peak of your anger, pick a quiet hour. Often, your partner just doesn't know you're feeling unequal.","career":"Partnerships are cracking: deposits are becoming unequal, promises are being fulfilled upside down, decisions are being made behind your back; check the documentary side of agreements; don't rely on verbal assurances; if you're tandem, redistribute responsibility.","love":"Cooling: quarrels go round and round, jealousy and power struggles grow, intimacy has been replaced by a formal \"normal\" card that doesn't always mean a breakup, but always requires an honest conversation - if it doesn't happen, the distance will keep growing.","health":"Conflict hits the nervous system and the heart: insomnia due to resentment, pressure surges, chest lumps; chronic tension in a pair reduces immunity faster than infection; pairing practices are useless until the conflict is resolved; start with individual stress relief.","esoteric":"The broken alchemical union is a test of meaningful connections. In energy management, the card helps cut off inanimate attachments and complete outmoded contracts. The lesson is harsh: love lives where equality exists; where power rules, there is a deal.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Love","title_ru":"Lord of Love.","why":"Venus connects and attracts, and Cancer seeks emotional intimacy and secure bonding, and the two make a pair, so meaning almost literally becomes Love."}}},{"id":"cups-three","name_ru":"Three of Cups","name_en":"","number":3,"type":"minor","suit":"cups","img":"cups-three.webp","element":"Water","astro":"Mercury in Cancer","upright":{"short":"A holiday in good company: friendship, shared joy and a legitimate reason to raise the cups.","keywords":["friendship","celebration","close-knit","joyfulness","reunification","teamwork"],"archetype":"Three wreathed women raised bowls of toast: harvested, done, time to celebrate together. Waite's scene conveys a rare state of happiness that one wants to share, not hide. It's a card of sisterhood and brotherhood, a circle of people who know your stories and are still happy to see you.\n\nIn tradition, the Three Cups means celebration, reunion and community support, joy in sharing is multiplied: success deserves celebration, and grief shared with friends is halved, and the card also heralds the return of a person who has not been seen for a long time.","daily":"The calendar is filled with occasions: birthdays, gatherings before midnight, meeting classmates years later, calling guests first is better than waiting for invitations, even boring things are fun in the company — cook dinner with the children, go shopping with a friend.","career":"Team success: the project is closing, and it's a tribute to the whole group. It's a great moment for team building, corporate and public recognition of the contributions of colleagues. Networking brings opportunities — half of the proposals come through people you know. Praise the team aloud and share your laurels.","love":"Easy period: you just have a good time with each other without checking and hard conversations. Often the card indicates a holiday next to the couple — engagement, anniversary, wedding. Single promises to meet through friends: someone in the general circle looks noticeably warmer than others.","health":"The psyche rests: laughter does heal, and the feeling of \"I'm waiting for my own\" reduces anxiety better than sedatives. The only caveat is moderation at feasts: the festive table should not become a system.","esoteric":"The energy of the circle: the threeness as the fullness of manifestation, the power of common intention. The card is used for rituals of gratitude, the consecration of a common cause and the strengthening of friendship bonds. It reminds you that the loner is vulnerable - find like-minded people, because even the bowls on the card are raised in a concerted gesture.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Abundance","title_ru":"Lord of Abundance","why":"Mercury distributes and binds, and Cancer nourishes, and the Troika reverses the process that has begun, and feeling begins to circulate freely between people and turns into abundance."}},"reversed":{"short":"The holiday is disrupted: gossip around your name, a third extra or a din that no longer warms.","keywords":["gossip","isolation","third-hand","holiday-dump","excess","cooling-off"],"archetype":"The inverted figures lose their balance: the toast turns into gossip, the general circle into a crowd where it is easy to remain misunderstood, where the straight Three gave support, the inverted one shows its dark side: talking behind its back and friendship, held only at feasts.\n\nThe card means a cancelled celebration, a spoiled holiday, a quarrel within the company. The other pole is excess: fun has become a way to escape from problems. Sometimes it is a \"third extra\" that destroys the intimacy of a couple or trust within the three.","daily":"Plans are crumbling: guests are canceled at the last minute, family dinners are upset. Be clear about the frankness: what's told in a narrow circle can come back distorted. Don't discuss the absentees, it's the main channel of leakage and the source of future conflicts.","career":"The noise is not where it should be: office intrigue, back-end discussions, ideas are being passed off as their own. Meetings become mutual claims. Stay with the facts and correspondence, don't get involved in coalitions, and if the project was celebrated ahead of time, check if everything is closed.","love":"And then there's the third thing: jealousy of your partner's friends, interference from your family, in the worst case scenario, cheating, and the single person should be careful about flirting with the company, because a fun evening can turn into a morning regret, and it's good for a couple to build boundaries with the outside circle.","health":"Excess makes a point: hangovers become regular, sleep is shallow, liver and stomach are the first to signal, emotionally drain companies, then empty, check what you treat with a glass: if fatigue or loneliness is not the problem with guilt, but with the cause.","esoteric":"Warning of the group's blurred energy: a circle created to support you has started working against you, a card is used to unravel gossip and remove involuntary envy, the lesson of the inverted Three is to learn to celebrate alone so that joy does not depend on witnesses.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Abundance","title_ru":"Lord of Abundance","why":"Mercury distributes and binds, and Cancer nourishes, and the Troika reverses the process that has begun, and feeling begins to circulate freely between people and turns into abundance."}}},{"id":"cups-four","name_ru":"Four of Cups","name_en":"","number":4,"type":"minor","suit":"cups","img":"cups-four.webp","element":"Water","astro":"The Moon in Cancer","upright":{"short":"The person does not see the bowl offered: apathy, satiety and chances lying right under his nose.","keywords":["lethargy","contemplation","slippery","satiety","boredom","retreat","revaluation"],"archetype":"The young man sits under a tree with his arms crossed; he has three bowls in front of him, and the fourth one is reached out from a cloud, he looks past. Waite's drawing is precise to the point of cruelty: the man is so consumed with discontent that he does not notice the gift.\n\nTraditionally, the card means apathy, satiety and a missed sentence. It's not grief, it's emotional anesthesia: everything is \"normal\" but nothing is pleasing. Sometimes the Four describes the necessary pause in maturation and the honest question \"What do I want?\" The only danger is to delay the pause so that the look never rises.","daily":"The day is gray: your favorite activities don't take up, the TV shows go in the background, the food is not good. Don't fight the pause force, but don't stick: do one little unusual thing - another route home, call an old friend, a dish that has never been cooked.","career":"Professional plateau: problems are solved by inertia, interesting sentences seem like repetition of what you've been through. Right now, it's easy to miss a chance that you'll later call a turning point. Don't sign up hot, but don't swing away automatically -- consider every sentence for at least a day.","love":"Emotional satiety for the future: the partner is there, and it seems that he is not; one of the two has gone into himself and does not respond to attempts of rapprochement. The lonely card is honest: there are candidates, but “all are not.” Ask yourself: has the world become worse or the ability to wonder temporarily shut down?","health":"Apathy has physiology: lethargy, drowsiness, sweet cravings. The body needs a gentle reset, not stimulation -- sleep patterns, phone-free walks, less caffeine. It's worth checking vitamin D and ferritin, the physical cause of grayness is more common than people think.","esoteric":"The contemplative side is underrated: the young man under the tree is like a hermit before illumination. In spiritual practice, this is a time of great silence, when old desires must be heard to hear a new call. The hand from the cloud will remind us that help is always near, it is only a matter of looking.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Blended Pleasure","title_ru":"Lord of Mixed Pleasure","why":"The moon is strong in Cancer and gives a lot of emotional fulfillment, but the Four fixes the state. The fullness becomes immobile — hence the pleasure in which satiety already appears."}},"reversed":{"short":"The look is raised: stagnation ends, the offer is noticed, curiosity and appetite return to life.","keywords":["wake-up","granting","stupor","freshness","determination","thanks"],"archetype":"The man finally lifts his head from the ground and sees his hand with the cup. The stagnation that seemed eternal was only a long breath; the apathy retreats not from volition, but from the spark — the casual conversation, the morning when I wanted to get up before the alarm clock.\n\nTraditionally, it's the way out of hibernation: accepting a long-suspended sentence, ending fruitless regrets, recapturing the ability to want. The flip side is the risk that the contemplation period has become an end in itself, and finding yourself has become a screen of fear of living. The test is simple: did action come, not just thoughts?","daily":"The house comes alive: the accumulated business is done easily, the desire to cook and receive guests returns, the hunt for the smallest things awakens - flowers in the apartment, the pool, disassembled mezzanine. Use the lift immediately: the energy of awakening is valuable in the first days, until inertia catches up.","career":"The fog is dispelling, the task has made sense, or there's an offer worth moving for, and it's a good time to accept the previously rejected option of going back to negotiations, taking the project, and determination now works better than the perfect plan: step first, then clarity.","love":"Relationships are given a second chance: the partner is seen again, with strangeness and warmth; the conversation, which has been uncooked for months, passes quietly; lonely people begin to respond to messages and agree to meetings; the first step is no longer perceived as defeat; reconciliation is possible.","health":"The tone increases day by day: deep sleep is restored, appetite is normalized, the body asks for movement. Set the effect in a regimen: light in the morning, water, reasonable exercise. The body that rests in pause gains shape surprisingly quickly.","esoteric":"Spiritual meaning is gratitude as a key: a door that is not amenable to effort opens with a simple thank you. The practice of reclaiming interest is a list of daily little joys, awareness in everyday activities. The gift was always there; the direction of the gaze was not the hand of the cloud, but the direction of the gaze.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Blended Pleasure","title_ru":"Lord of Mixed Pleasure","why":"The moon is strong in Cancer and gives a lot of emotional fulfillment, but the Four fixes the state. The fullness becomes immobile — hence the pleasure in which satiety already appears."}}},{"id":"cups-five","name_ru":"Five of Cups","name_en":"","number":5,"type":"minor","suit":"cups","img":"cups-five.webp","element":"Water","astro":"Mars in Scorpio","upright":{"short":"Three bowls are overturned: loss and regret command attention, but the two bowls behind are intact.","keywords":["loss","sorrow","regret","loss","tears","disappointment","loss-focus"],"archetype":"The figure in the black cape stands with his head down, three cups overturned, two full ones behind him, but he can't see them; then there's the river and the bridge, invisible in the mountain, and the composition honestly describes the attention device: the lost occupies the entire screen.\n\nThe five cups are a card of loss and sorrow: a break, a collapse of hope, a farewell. It doesn't advise holding on -- grief takes time and a right to be lived. But it fixes the proportion: much is lost, but not all. The card's question is: when will you turn to the remaining cups?","daily":"Regret Day: You find old correspondence, you get bad news, something important is broken literally or figuratively, you let yourself be quiet, you cry too, work, don't decide at your peak, and ask your loved ones to just be around without advice.","career":"Professional blow: a broken deal, a failed launch, a key client leaving. It hurts, but it's a failure of the project, not of you as a specialist. Discuss without self-flagellation what's left -- experience, connections, reputation -- and what you can build on tomorrow.","love":"A breakup or a hard conversation that leaves everything different, and I'm not grieving for a past feeling, and I can't jump over the stage, and the card warns of the temptation to burn bridges in a row: give sorrow a time and a limit, and then give it to the scores; emotions are now distorting the scale.","health":"Grief is bodily: a lump in the throat, heaviness in the chest, jumps in appetite, weak immunity. The body mourns with the soul - give it heat, water, regime and sleep. It is dangerous to drown out the senses with alcohol: this card is treated with tears, talk and time, not anesthesia.","esoteric":"Initiation through loss: what has flowed must have leaked, freeing the channel. In practice, the card is used to work with incomplete grief — letters to fire, rituals of goodbye. The profound lesson is to grieve aloud and to the end, then the surviving bowls will turn to you.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Loss in Pleasure","title_ru":"Lord of Pleasure Loss","why":"Mars in Scorpio acts sharply and deeply, destroying emotional stability, which in the Crisis Five is experienced as a loss of pleasure and painful disappointment."}},"reversed":{"short":"Turning from the Broken Cups: Accepting Loss, Forgiveness, and the First Steps Back to Life","keywords":["acceptance","forgiveness","escaping","let-off","healing","return of interest"],"archetype":"The cloak rises from the ground, the hero turns around and sees two whole bowls. Grief does not disappear by wobble, it ends because it has been lived. Regret ceases to hold the past and becomes an experience from which a lesson is learned.\n\nTraditionally, it's acceptance, forgiveness, and recovery; the bridge behind it is the only sensible direction. Sometimes the card warns of something else: the person is stuck in the role of the eternal sufferer and bears the loss as an identity card, then you have to choose whether to move on or continue the funeral of the one that is over.","daily":"It comes back: you want to clean up, you want to answer your friends, you want to plan, you know, the old pain of remembering will sting and let go. It's a good time to give away debts of promise: to go to your family, to return the book, to apologize where it's time to go, and to make small endings make room for new things.","career":"Recovery: The energy for new negotiations is there, and the past failure becomes a \"no-go\" case, and it's a great time to ask for a second chance, which is more likely to be given to someone who has honestly experienced a failure than to someone who pretended not to.","love":"The way out of mourning: the ex is remembered without anger, the old resentment is forgiven, a new person is let in without comparison every minute. If a couple has been through a crisis together, you can see who stayed. Heart is open again: caution is needed, but it is time to take off the armor.","health":"Sleep is leveled, appetite is back, shoulders are straightened — the body is the first to report the worst, immunity is getting stronger, chronic fatigue is receding. Secure the effect with care: bath, massage, long walks; sedatives are reduced smoothly and with a specialist.","esoteric":"Cleansing fire and removing mourning attachments: burn the list of grievances, thank the past, close the door with a symbolic gesture. The gift of the card is the ability to turn the loss into a depth: those who have passed it consciously become the best comforters for other people.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Loss in Pleasure","title_ru":"Lord of Pleasure Loss","why":"Mars in Scorpio acts sharply and deeply, destroying emotional stability, which in the Crisis Five is experienced as a loss of pleasure and painful disappointment."}}},{"id":"cups-six","name_ru":"Six of Cups","name_en":"","number":6,"type":"minor","suit":"cups","img":"cups-six.webp","element":"Water","astro":"The Sun in Scorpio","upright":{"short":"The Garden of Childhood: Warm Memories, Innocent Joys and a Gift from the Past","keywords":["nostalgia","childhood","old-timer","gift","innocence","warm memories","simplicity"],"archetype":"In the old garden, children exchange bowls of white flowers, one handing out a gift, another with serious gratitude, so children play adult without knowing the calculation, the scene smells of summer and syrup: a memory of a time when happiness was simple.\n\nThe six cups are a card of nostalgia, childhood memories and past gifts: a meeting with a school friend, a grandmother's house, a letter from a forgotten person. It talks about kindness without back-thinking and what roots nourish: to understand the present, sometimes you have to go back to where it all began.","daily":"The reason to get a box of photos is to go to your hometown, to visit the old people, to eat a meal from the children's menu, simple joys work better than entertainment, ice cream, swings, play in the yard, show the children the backyards of your youth and tell them what the world was like then.","career":"It's going to come in handy with the first-earning experience, the student projects, the long-standing fascination, maybe going back to your old employer, or reviving an idea that was ahead of time, and thanking your first mentor and sharing it with newcomers -- generosity to the past is paid for by trust.","love":"Romance with history: the former writes years later, the classmate turns out to be a neighbor, the old feeling flashes back again - already grown up, but recognizable. For stable couples, the card gives a gentle simplicity: hands, laughing at shared memories, plans, as in the beginning.","health":"It's good for the psyche to go back to safety: memories where you were loved really reduce stress. Playing, creativity without a purpose, unplanned laziness are good for the psyche. Watch your teeth and back: the food excesses of children are not easily absorbed by the body.","esoteric":"A card of the family memory: the intergenerational bond, the invisible support of ancestors, a legacy waiting to be recognized, used to gently heal childhood trauma through the image of a safe garden. A reminder: innocence is not naivety, but the ability to trust the world with sight; a skill for life.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Pleasure","title_ru":"Lord of Pleasure","why":"After the Five crisis, the Sun illuminates and restores the emotional life of the Scorpio. The Six brings harmony - pleasure returns through warmth, memory and trust."}},"reversed":{"short":"It is time to grow out of the old garden: life in memories interferes with the present, childhood requires to let go.","keywords":["past","idealization","mature","let go","independence","wing-walk"],"archetype":"The inverted bowls shed flowers: the past stopped feeding and began to suck; the person lives in the museum of his youth and measures the present by the standards of that time; the pink haze is convenient: there are no accounts, no conflicts and no binding decisions.\n\nThis is a card of childhood separation: growing up, leaving the parental home, ending a period that has been delayed beyond deadlines, sometimes it indicates unlived old pain that must be addressed without softening filters. The card is fair: the garden is beautiful, but you have to live behind its gate.","daily":"The house reminds us of separation: the question of moving, the decisions that mom used to make, the adult children should stop waiting for approval for every step, parents should let go, Discuss the things of the past: boxes stored for twenty years require either a shelf or a bag.","career":"The end of apprenticeship: the role of the perpetual intern is tight, old developments do not cover new tasks, you can leave your place of residence. The mistake is choosing a job because it was good there: the atmosphere is not a criterion; does your salary and profession grow there?","love":"Relationships stall when both play childish roles: whims instead of asking, the expectation that the partner will become a parent; the possibility of graduating an old story is not a tragedy, but the end of a chapter; couples should build their own way of life, not copy someone's family script.","health":"You can see past stagnation in your body: sleep before lunch, sweet as comfort, childhood sickness for no reason, your body asks for adult exercise, exercise, schedule, and scheduling. Get a medical exam: part of your \"weak childhood health\" is just not taking care of yourself.","esoteric":"Rite of Initiation: The child's ego must die for an adult magician to be born. The work involves an honest inventory of childhood wounds without blaming the parents and abandoning the \"I'm not loved\" attitude. As long as the inner child commands the parade, the force drains into old plots; once initiated, it becomes yours.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Pleasure","title_ru":"Lord of Pleasure","why":"After the Five crisis, the Sun illuminates and restores the emotional life of the Scorpio. The Six brings harmony - pleasure returns through warmth, memory and trust."}}},{"id":"cups-seven","name_ru":"Seven of Cups","name_en":"","number":7,"type":"minor","suit":"cups","img":"cups-seven.webp","element":"Water","astro":"Venus in Scorpio","upright":{"short":"Seven bowls in clouds full of seductive visions: there are options, but which one is real?","keywords":["plurality","illusion","dream","hard-choice","temptation","fog"],"archetype":"The dark silhouette stands in front of seven bowls suspended in the clouds: the winner's head, the shining ghost under the veil, the snake, the castle, jewels, the wreath, the dragon. An abundance that paralyzes: all options beckon, none tested, and time goes by.\n\nThe card represents a wealth of possibilities mixed with illusion. It's a showcase of desires where the present is hard to tell from the gloss: not every shiny bowl is full, but behind some there is a snake. While you go through the fantasies, life itself makes the choice - and usually the worst of all options: none.","daily":"Forklift day: three invitations for the evening, five plans for the weekend, a dozen tabs with \"the same.\" Try the one-chalice rule: pick a single thing and finish it. Be careful with shopping according to mood - the sparkling on the screen often dims in the hallway.","career":"Promises are pouring in: new projects, exciting jobs, collaboration offers. Before you dream, check reality: budget, deadlines, who pays. Write down options on paper, cut off fabulous ones, and choose two maximum for deep study — spraying is more expensive than error.","love":"Candidate showcase: an old friend hints, a colleague flirts, an app sends matches — nice and nothing serious: comparison prevents you from seeing a living person. In a pair, a card means the temptation of \"what if\": check your fantasies with the question \"what do I really want?\"","health":"The psyche is overwhelmed with unmet desires: insomnia from thinking \"if only,\" weakness, cravings for stimulants. The brain needs detox from options -- turn off notifications, shorten social media for a couple of days. Clarity comes in silence, not in another swipe.","esoteric":"Seven bowls in the clouds are seven lessons of discernment. This is a card of imagination: the power to create images is great, but without the discipline of focus, it draws worlds instead of building them. Practice is a unidirectional intention: one goal, one visualization, one step on the ground.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Illusionary Success","title_ru":"The Lord of the Illusional Success","why":"Venus in Scorpio increases desire to obsession, and the Seven disturbs the balance, beautiful possibilities easily turn into temptation, illusion and addiction to pleasure."}},"reversed":{"short":"The fog dissipates: it is time to soberly choose one cup and abandon the other six.","keywords":["insight","sober-up","deciding","focus","effusiveness","missed opportunity"],"archetype":"The bowls fall to the ground, visions lose their gloss and show the true value, what was thought to be treasure turns into tinsel, the monster turns out to be a common task, a hangover from dreams is unpleasant, but it is after that that that you can actually solve.\n\nIt's a return to reality and a decisive choice: you name the desire out loud and cut off the excess. The flip side is the bitter recognition: some of the possibilities have leaked, some of the \"options\" have been self-deception from the beginning. Accept the loss of time as a lesson payment and choose carefully.","daily":"It's time to finish what you've started: repairs you started in the spring, disassemble boxes later, subscriptions you forgot to cancel, make a list of commitments and honestly close half, and giving up someone else's \"wants\" sounds calm: you have the right to choose where your life goes.","career":"Professional clarity: you can see which project feeds and which eats up time. Decide by numbers, not emotions, giving up everything that does not pass the test of the question \"what will I have in a year,\" the danger is reversed - in a hurry to grab the first cup you find.","love":"The moment of truth: a three-line romance must be declared the main one or let everyone go; the fantasy of the \"ideal friend\" ceases to obscure living people; for couples, a sober conversation about money, life and children: the truth now heals, false politeness destroys.","health":"After a period of distraction, the body responds to the regimen: restoring sleep, relieving anxiety, reducing dependence on caffeine and scrolling, and a week of simple rules — going to bed at the same time, eating without a screen, moving daily — gives an amazing recovery rate.","esoteric":"Sobriety rite: the veil is taken off the ghost in the bowl. The practice is to recognize self-deception -- a fact-check diary, shadow work, a refusal to say, \"what if.\" The vision, once it's turned on, doesn't turn off.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Illusionary Success","title_ru":"The Lord of the Illusional Success","why":"Venus in Scorpio increases desire to obsession, and the Seven disturbs the balance, beautiful possibilities easily turn into temptation, illusion and addiction to pleasure."}}},{"id":"cups-eight","name_ru":"Eight of Cups","name_en":"","number":8,"type":"minor","suit":"cups","img":"cups-eight.webp","element":"Water","astro":"Saturn in Pisces","upright":{"short":"The man goes to the mountains, leaving eight full bowls: what he achieved stopped warming, he calls the road higher.","keywords":["leaving","sense","let-off","new way","quietness","roadway"],"archetype":"The figure with the staff leaves at the moon eclipsed by the sun, and there are eight carefully composed bowls behind, full, whole, undeserving, but the hero does not escape from the trouble, but from the fullness that has become emptiness; the red spot on the moon marks the inner rift.\n\nEight cups -- leaving for more meaning: getting fired from a good job, breaking up without scandal, moving out of a cozy city -- it's not an escape, it's a pilgrimage. The card is honest: you'll have to pay the price of leaving with the loneliness of the road -- and it's worth it if leaving is true.","daily":"The time of the gathering: disassembling the closet and giving away the unnecessary, giving up the usual obligations, taking a vacation \"not as usual.\" Perhaps for the first time you will say \"no\" to a family ritual that is draining, traveling alone and practicing silence are beneficial - whether it is a weekend hike or an evening without talking.","career":"You've outgrown your role: your salary is fine, your team is good, and you don't want to get up in the morning, it's a signal, not a whim. The card favors a change of direction: study, a new profession, your own project. Leave cleanly - with the transfer of business: bridges here cross, not burn.","love":"Relationships can end not because they were bad, but because they became impossible to do well: feeling is gone, keeping the form is a betrayal of the essence. It's a quiet adult break without accusations. Sometimes it's softer, a pause or a time to think. The main thing is honesty with yourself before explaining to others.","health":"Chronic fatigue from being someone else's role requires not vitamins, but a change of script: long hiking trails, mountain air, social stress reduction, take care of the spine and feet - physical, deep and healing sleep during this period.","esoteric":"One of the major cards of the spiritual exodus is like Abraham leaving his hometown, or a monk entering the desert, and the eclipse on the moon indicates that the call comes from the subconscious, the mind only forms it. The ritual of exit: list what you leave, worship it and step on; the staff in the hero's hand is faith that is enough for the road.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Abandoned Success","title_ru":"Lord of Abandoned Success","why":"Saturn cools and limits the fluid nature of Pisces, and water no longer feeds desire, and man is withdrawn: what he has achieved no longer gives inner meaning."}},"reversed":{"short":"The departure is postponed again: the fear of the unknown is stronger than the pain of a place in which it has long been crowded.","keywords":["fear","entanglement","patience","fear","wandering","back-to-back"],"archetype":"A man put a backpack up and put it at the door a month ago, and the cups are standing still, and so is he: he counts the arguments to stay as if their number adds weight, and the fear of freedom is disguised as prudence: \"not time,\" \"should be saved,\" \"then.\"\n\nThe card means self-defeating stagnation, where you suffer what you've admitted to be wrong, fearing the void at the door, and the other option is leaving as a lifestyle: never-ending work and partnering to do anything else, just to stop and not look inside, and then running away pretends to be a search, and the road leads nowhere.","daily":"The eternal preparation for change: courses are paid, a resume is written, a suitcase is half-stuck in the pantry and nothing moves. Determine what scares you: often not change, but someone else's disapproval look. Take the indivisible step of booking a ticket for a specific date.","career":"You can preserve the situation: you sit for years in a project that you criticize, for fear of losing stability, or you throw between companies where each new place quickly disappoints, the problem goes inside. Ask honestly: are you leaving or going to? The answer will tell you the price of the next shift.","love":"A relationship that both have long since buried, but still has: convenience, a mortgage, a \"child will grow up\" or a partner who packs regularly and stays in limbo each time, the card's requirement is either honest fixing or honest leaving.","health":"Chronic patience is a bodily pain: psychosomatics, panic attacks, comforting addictions from food to TV shows, fear of change keeps muscles in suspense -- shoulders, neck, jaw -- need proof of safety: breathing, massage, small, manageable changes.","esoteric":"The incomplete ritual of exit: the door is open, the threshold is not crossed, the energy flows into holding two worlds at once. Practices: take one rejection to the end, send a goodbye letter, remove things from your old life. While the staff is in the corner, the journey has not begun — take it at least symbolically.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Abandoned Success","title_ru":"Lord of Abandoned Success","why":"Saturn cools and limits the fluid nature of Pisces, and water no longer feeds desire, and man is withdrawn: what he has achieved no longer gives inner meaning."}}},{"id":"cups-nine","name_ru":"Nine of Cups","name_en":"","number":9,"type":"minor","suit":"cups","img":"cups-nine.webp","element":"Water","astro":"Jupiter in Pisces","upright":{"short":"The card of wish fulfillment: a satisfied person crossed his hands - what was asked for came true.","keywords":["wishful thinking","complacency","enjoyment","wealth","prize-winning","hospitality"],"archetype":"The man in red sits on a wooden bench with his arms folded; behind the back of the arc are nine full bowls, the figure radiates contentment without malice — a person who ate well, did a lot and knows his worth.\n\nImportant clarification: Nine fulfills personal earthly desires — comfort, recognition, a delicious life, not an abstract “all at once.” It comes after effort as a well-deserved dessert and teaches you to take pleasure without guilt: the ability to enjoy what you have achieved is a skill like the ability to work.","daily":"A little party without a reason: dinner at a favorite place, a long-delayed purchase, an evening without schedule. Make a specific wish - the card fulfills precise wording, not a vague \"want happiness.\" Invite guests: your generosity now warms everyone.","career":"Time to pick up: the contract is signed, the prize is awarded, the project is recognized as a success. A good time to ask for a promotion is visible, the arguments sound weighty. The card patronizes those who can present the work done; the public joy of the result is the presentation, not the bragging.","love":"Saturation: you want to spoil and be spoiled, relationships are joyful without drama. Single is one of the best meeting cards that easily folds up. For stable couples, the second honeymoon: travel, renewing the bedroom, returning play and flirting.","health":"Health reflects contentment: good appetite, good sleep, alertness. The card is favorable for recovery and plans to \"better\": the gym, started now, usually do not quit. The only caveat is the measure: the festive table is appropriate, the system becomes it early.","esoteric":"Nine bowls are associated with the richness of the inner world: outer satiety reflects self-agreement; mascot card for intention rituals: write down a wish, put a bowl of water next to it, thank you in advance; Jupiterian generosity reminds us that the performed is worth dividing, then the flow does not run out.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Material Happiness","title_ru":"The Lord of Material Happiness","why":"Jupiter is traditionally strong in Pisces and expands emotional fullness. Nine gives the climax of suit, so there is a sense of happiness, prosperity and fulfillment of desire."}},"reversed":{"short":"The desire has been fulfilled, and there is no joy: satiety, superficial pleasures, dream-dream-dream.","keywords":["dream-full","satiety","complacency","excess","superficiality","disappointment"],"archetype":"The hero still sits with his arms crossed, but the pleasure pose has become a mask, and the bowls have ceased to fill. The classic story: got what he asked for, found emptiness. The promotion ate the evenings, the wedding was a household, the prestigious purchase pleases right to the checkout.\n\nThe other side is excess: pleasures have gone from being a condiment to being a content of life and anesthesia from asking, \"What do I live for?\" Sometimes a card indicates someone else's complacency around -- a person so content with himself that you're not in his picture of the world.","daily":"Overcrowded and overcrowded: the fridge is full and there is nothing; the weekends are scheduled and there is no rest; conduct a pleasure audit: what is really yours and what is imposed by advertising; unload one day completely - without delivery, screens and mandatory entertainment.","career":"Success has been a tinsel: there is a job, there is no influence; a prize has been given, and the value of work has been devalued; you work on image, not on meaning, that is the beginning of burnout. Answer honestly: what did you really want? Often it turns out that you are not chasing your cup.","love":"Beautiful photos of couples and silence at dinner: relationships are fine for everyone but you. The single card warns: chasing the trappings of a novel leaves the heart hungry. Change the criterion: not \"how it looks,\" but \"how I feel with this person.\"","health":"Excess is becoming medical: overweight, liver, sugar spikes, sugar cravings, alcohol as a way to reward yourself. The body reports that pleasure is no longer nourishing. Start with a weekly food and mood diary, and it will show you what you are eating dissatisfaction.","esoteric":"The false grail lesson is that the cup was full, but not yours. Write down your wish list and write a why across from each one, which is how you choose to want to be induced by your own birthing and social media, and the real performance begins where the showcase ends.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Material Happiness","title_ru":"The Lord of Material Happiness","why":"Jupiter is traditionally strong in Pisces and expands emotional fullness. Nine gives the climax of suit, so there is a sense of happiness, prosperity and fulfillment of desire."}}},{"id":"cups-ten","name_ru":"Ten of Cups","name_en":"","number":10,"type":"minor","suit":"cups","img":"cups-ten.webp","element":"Water","astro":"Mars in Pisces","upright":{"short":"A rainbow of ten cups above a family: peace in the home, love without conditions, happiness without proof.","keywords":["family-happiness","harmony","love-house","unity","soul-world","happy ending"],"archetype":"Under a rainbow of ten shining bowls, the couple looks up at the green hills, the children dance next to each other, and this is the archetype of \"living happily ever after\": not the passion of meeting each other, but the quiet, lasting happiness of belonging, where everyone is seen and loved whole.\n\nThe cups are the top of your suit: emotional fulfillment, peace in the home, intergenerational unity. It promises a happy resolution to a long story, and reminds you that wealth is measured by the number of people you care about. It's also about peace with yourself: when internal conflict is settled, the house is no longer a battlefield.","daily":"A home day that you remember for years: a shared table, guests without tension, children playing, adults laughing. Family council is now a success — big decisions are made easily and coherently. Call your family, make peace with your family, start the tradition of Sunday breakfast.","career":"Harmonious phase: the team is in no business, it's not just money, it's successful family business and people close to you, it's a good time to ask for flexible schedules for family, which is a request that's now met with understanding, remember: career is part of life, not a replacement for it.","love":"One of the great cards of marriage is love that has been tested in life, decision about children, moving into a common home, reconciliation of families. Single people promise to meet a level of seriousness — not a spark for the evening, but a potential family. Existing unions reach a new level of trust.","health":"The psyche rests fundamentally: the feeling of the back reduces stress hormones, deep sleep, chronic sores subside, health is strengthened by simple things — walking together, eating at home, laughing. The card is favorable for planning children and restorative programs with the support of loved ones.","esoteric":"The prototype of the heavenly city and the completeness of the element Water: ten vessels full and standing as the arch of the world. The card is attracted to the consecration of the house, the rituals of family unity and reconciliation of birth. The supreme magic of Cups is not love spells, but the ability to create a space where people are safe to love.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Perfected Success","title_ru":"The Lord of Perfect Success","why":"The ten brings the emotional cycle to fullness. Golden Dawn has a perfect success; Crowley emphasizes the downside of fullness: when the bowls are full, satiety comes."}},"reversed":{"short":"The rainbow has faded: the discord in the house, the war of values and the facade of prosperity, for which everyone is tired.","keywords":["family breakdown","quarreling","divergence","well-being facade","alienation","paradigmaticism"],"archetype":"The arch crumbles: the same family, the same landscape, but an invisible wall grew between loved ones, the Straight Ten showed happiness as fact, inverted as scenery: photos collect likes, and behind the scenes everyone lives in his room and his silence.\n\nThe card represents the disharmony of the house: the conflicts of generations, the divorce of face-saving, the struggle over whose truth becomes the family ideology. Sometimes softer are the different values that once seemed compatible. The old way of life no longer works; it's not necessarily a breakup, but a reassembly is necessary.","daily":"The background rings: only household conversations, dishes beat more often than usual, everyone avoids the common kitchen. Don't save the facade at all costs, have an honest family conversation without accusations, starting with \"I\", not \"you.\" If you live with your parents, check the boundaries: part of the wars goes beyond the territory.","career":"The home crisis is affecting work: concentration is falling, hospitalization is increasing, decisions are made irritated, there may be an office version of the same theme, where the team is divided into camps under the slogans of shared values. Don't make sudden career moves on emotion: stabilize the rear first.","love":"Storm: quarrels over trifles, cooling off, arguments about children and money, the question of \"save the union.\" Look beyond the claims - they usually have one unexplained question: \"Are you with me at all or near?\" His answer is more important than the outcome of any quarrel.","health":"Family conflict hits everyone, including children: headaches, chronic exacerbations, adult insomnia; children are more harmed by silent war than honest divorce; take care of neutral territory and adult supports — therapist, friends, sports — and don't drag it all alone.","esoteric":"A broken hearth that needs relaying: the old family ritual has served its purpose, practices like cleaning the home, revising birth scenarios (\"everyone in our family suffers\"), consciously assembling new rules. The gift of the card is great: the chance to build a house according to your own design, not your own.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Perfected Success","title_ru":"The Lord of Perfect Success","why":"The ten brings the emotional cycle to fullness. Golden Dawn has a perfect success; Crowley emphasizes the downside of fullness: when the bowls are full, satiety comes."}}},{"id":"cups-page","name_ru":"Page of Cups","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"cups","number":null,"img":"cups-page.webp","element":"Water","astro":null,"upright":{"short":"The fish jumps out of the bowl: unexpected good news, a creative bell, permission to be sincere.","keywords":["good news","kin","creative","jolt","sympathy","sincerity"],"archetype":"The young man looks at the bowl from which the fish jumps, and he doesn't shrug off the miracle. The only character in Waite's deck who takes the impossible seriously. Page is the messenger of the unconscious: ideas come suddenly, feelings are announced without a schedule, and news is used to delight.\n\nThe card means a message of emotional nature: recognition, invitation, news of addition, touching little thing that makes the day. The second facet is the inner child: the ability to wonder and create without looking back \"how is it right.\" Page teaches you to trust the first impulse of the heart: the unexpected and slightly shy often turns out to be the real thing.","daily":"Nice surprises: a package without waiting, a message from someone you haven't heard of, a childish drawing in your honor, a time of light creativity -- making something with kids, keeping a diary, singing louder than usual, allow yourself one \"stupidity\" that adults don't have.","career":"A fresh idea -- maybe a little wild, but yours: sketch it out without criticizing it on the fly; it's good to start learning, especially creatively, to ask for mentoring, to take the initiative of \"what if.\" Young colleagues will bring unexpectedly valuable eyes; don't shy away from the proposals submitted.","love":"A new feeling dawns: a timid message, an awkward date, a sympathy that is not talked about yet. There may be good news -- a friend's engagement, a pregnancy, a confession. Param Page advises you to bring back the game: notes, gifts for no reason, joint stupidities. Sincerity disarms more than strategies.","health":"The emotional background is light, like a child after a walk: lightness, good appetite, sound sleep. The psyche asks for games and water — pool, watercolor, sand castles. The card is favorable for conception and communication with children, which cures nerves itself; just do not overfeed yourself with impressions.","esoteric":"The fish in the bowl is a classic sign of message from the deep: intuition speaks in images, and Page can hear; the card is used to develop clairvoyance, work with dreams, and connect with the inner child; spiritual growth begins not with discipline, but with trusting the first quiet clue."},"reversed":{"short":"The cup is overturned from the inside: whims instead of feelings, a broken dream, a creative tap is blocked by resentment.","keywords":["swelling","capriciousness","disappointment","creative-block","touchiness","escapism"],"archetype":"The flipped Page believes in miracles, but demands them immediately and necessarily for himself. The fish has turned from a bowl into a shelf trophy. It's emotional infantilism: the feelings are real, but expressed in resentment and silent \"guess for yourself\" war; only the childish role remains strong.\n\nTraditionally, there's a cancelled good news, a broken romantic hope, a creative blockage. Sometimes a card describes a moody nature nearby, exhausting with its changeability. It asks, how long are you willing to wait for someone to grow up, and don't you expect them to?","daily":"The day is a mess: the promised is delayed, the mood jumps from trifles, the loved ones are annoyed with one look, check if the inner child is literally hungry: lack of sleep and missed lunch turn adults into moody children, you need honest rest, not “rest” on the phone.","career":"Immature is in the little things: deadlines float, feedback is perceived as an insult, an interesting task is thrown in the middle, creatives are calm — ideas are there, hands are not reached. It is treated with small daily: fifteen minutes of work is more important than the heroic “start Monday”.","love":"The eternal teenager is in the mirror or next to you, the partner sulking instead of talking, demanding proof, resenting the truth. Be careful with the charming \"artist with a vulnerable soul\" - he needs a mother, not a companion. If the resentment lives in you, it's time to grow up: self-pity has already paid the bills.","health":"The body is affected by unstable emotions: appetite swirls between refusing to eat and eating, superficial sleep, energy jumps, exhausting the nervous system, and regimen helps as a form of care, not punishment: eating by the clock, screens away an hour before bedtime, children predictability of adults.","esoteric":"The blocked channel of the inner child: creativity and intuition feed from the same source, and resentment overlaps both: practices are letters to your childhood self, a return to an abandoned passion without a purpose, working with the shadow of capriciousness. When angry at someone else's immaturity, ask where you never recognized yours."}},{"id":"cups-knight","name_ru":"Knight of Cups","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"cups","number":null,"img":"cups-knight.webp","element":"Water","astro":null,"upright":{"short":"The knight rides with the cup: a romantic gesture, a beautiful proposal, an act at the call of the heart.","keywords":["proposal","invitation","romanticism","charm","heart-break","creativeness"],"archetype":"The knight in the winged helmet is slowly riding, holding the bowl as a gift or a message. He doesn't rush like the other knights of the deck: his element is not an attack, but an invitation. So you get letters, confessions, application projects -- beautiful gestures in which you dare to show feeling. This hero is an artist and a lover who follows beauty.\n\nThe card means an offer or an invitation that is emotionally meaningful: a matchmaking, a creative chance, a call from the heart that requires an answer. The knight acts aesthetically and gently. His question is not \"is it right,\" but \"is it coming back\": when the heart says \"yes,\" the mind usually catches up later and agrees.","daily":"Beautifully done things: a bouquet for no reason, an invitation to an exhibition, a letter to an old friend, a spontaneous sunset trip. The day is a courtship in a broad sense - visit Grandma with pies, invite people for coffee. The world reciprocates with the first person to hold out the cup.","career":"The warmer offer: creative project, participation in a beautiful business, a dream trip. Apply for competitions and grants, come out with an idea for leadership, now you hear more carefully than usual. Act elegantly: the Knight wins not by pressure, but by the taste of the pitch.","love":"The main romantic plot: a confession, a spectacular date, a man who is beautifully courted and does not hide sympathy; Single - a charming fan with obvious intentions; couples - a revival of gallantry: dinners by candlelight, dancing in the kitchen. Answer gestures: proud silence quickly cools the fervor.","health":"Emotional lifting is better than vitamins: eyes burn, shoulders spread, sleep is light. A good time to start dancing, swimming is any practice where movement is about pleasure, not duty. The heart responds gratefully to joy; don't drive the body with stimulants for height flight.","esoteric":"The winged helmet is a sign of inspiration descended to action: the idea ceased to be a thought and went with its feet. Esoterically, it's the messenger's card -- including the message you yourself are carrying to the other heart -- use it to attract a worthy partner, to sanctify the beginnings, to ritual the first step."},"reversed":{"short":"The cup was empty: beautiful words without content, a moody romantic, a withdrawn sentence.","keywords":["hollow-promise","false-brightness","capriciousness","put-down","emotion-manipulation","cloud-walling"],"archetype":"The knight is still beautiful in the saddle, but the bowl is empty and the route leads by. He promises the golden mountains in a convincing voice and disappears at the first count. Charm is put at the service of the ego: fantasy novels without intention, projects that live only in presentation. Beautiful packaging is not a lie in itself - but here it replaces the content.\n\nThe card means a retracted sentence, frustration with an idol, emotional instability nearby, and it's about the inner state: dreams have become a way to not live, but anesthetize life; \"finding an ideal\" covers up the fear of intimacy. Test words with deeds with a simple question: what did this person do instead of saying?","daily":"Dealings that were broken: a friend promised and didn't come, the masters were gone, \"call me in the week\" was gone. Don't make plans on your word -- write down the important things in writing. And test yourself: how many promises did you make out on enthusiasm? Canceling your own words is the same immaturity, in profile.","career":"Inspired projector: presentations are great, deadlines are waning, responsibility is blurred. Don't invest in projects without budget, schedule and specifics - the beauty of an idea does not guarantee its existence.","love":"Donjouan script: lush courtship, words of fate, and a complete reluctance to anything real. Jealousy, dramas from scratch, a person who loves the image of you, not you. If you are in love with your own dream of it, come down to earth: live people are chosen among the living people.","health":"The swings between inspiration and apathy are exhausting: pressure surges, nervous exhaustion, cravings for alcohol \"for the mood.\" Charm requires fuel - check what you're filling it with. Grounding practices: strength, routine, handwork help. The body needs rhythm, not a wave of delight with failure.","esoteric":"False messenger and blurred will: the energy of feeling is not collected in a direction, so it is scattered with beautiful gestures. The card warns of illusions in relationships and requires the verification of visions by fact. Work with it is to turn inspiration into obligations: one silently fulfilled promise is worth ten beautiful ones."}},{"id":"cups-queen","name_ru":"Queen of Cups","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"cups","number":null,"img":"cups-queen.webp","element":"Water","astro":null,"upright":{"short":"The Queen looks into a closed bowl on the seaside: deep empathy, intuition and the ability to accept someone else’s pain without drowning in it.","keywords":["empathy","intuition","depth","care","acceptance","silence"],"archetype":"The Queen sits on a throne at the water's edge, and she looks mesmerized into the ornate bowl -- the only one closed in Waite's deck -- she doesn't spill feelings right and left: her world is inside, and it's as vast as the sea behind it, and it's a mature emotion to feel deeply and remain whole.\n\nThe card represents compassion, intuition and spiritual wisdom: a person who is approached to cry and come out more easily; the Queen listens without judgment and sees the subtext of words; her power is paradoxical: she can guide the flow without fighting it; the card's advice is to trust the quiet knowledge that comes not through analysis, but through the heart.","daily":"Everyday life asks for gentleness: to talk to a friend, to cook special for a tired loved one, to water flowers in silence. The house works like a port in a storm - people are drawn here themselves. Watch the dose: help is great, become a round-the-clock ambulance - no. Keep the evening.","career":"The value of the moment is human: negotiating with a difficult client, supporting a colleague before burnout, resolving conflict in a team. You read between the lines best — use it in hiring and mediation. For creative professions, the card gives access to subtle material: the psychology of heroes, the atmosphere, the nuance.","love":"Deep without drama: the partner feels accepted, including the things he doesn't say, the relationship goes to a level of intimacy where hugs speak longer than words, your sensitivity is not a defect, it's a magnet, just filter out those who come only to complain.","health":"Health is driven by an emotional rhythm: you get sick from negativity, you get well from silence and water, swimming, baths, walks by water, enough sleep, Empaths hoard the stuff of others in their bodies, so rebooting alone regularly is not a whim, it's hygiene.","esoteric":"The closed cup is a mystical vessel: knowledge that cannot be told can only be contained. One of the most mediumistic cards of the deck is dreams, premonitions, reading states. Practices are a dream diary, moon rhythms, the art of listening. The throne is not on land by chance: it is necessary to sympathize from stability, not from the wave."},"reversed":{"short":"The sea swept over the throne: borders dissolved, the pain of others displaced their own, sensitivity became vulnerability.","keywords":["dissolved","emotional dependence","wound-sensitivity","sacrifice","mood-swing","obsessive"],"archetype":"The queen still looks into the bowl, but she can't see the bottom: her life drowned in other people's circumstances. The straight position held the shore, the inverted one merged with the wave - saving instead of her own life, a relationship where \"we\" ate the \"me.\"\n\nThe card represents emotional instability: tears at every occasion, manipulation of resentment, passive aggression in the guise of caring. Sometimes it's a draining person nearby, sometimes it's you who have forgotten the question, \"What do I want?\" Kindness is not canceled; it needs to be reshaped: the real depth must have walls of a vessel.","daily":"A day spent for everyone but yourself: other people's problems solved, yours not started; mood depends on someone else's message. Do an experiment — say no to one request a day and notice that the world doesn't collapse.","career":"Empathy without borders turns into problems: the tasks of others, the covering of other people's mistakes, the deadlines that drown you, you are either reproached with \"nervousness\" or used as a guild vest. Return the role of a professional: sympathy for a colleague is good after five o'clock, not instead of his report.","love":"Codependent scenario: dissolving in your partner, saving someone who didn't ask, jealous of their world without you, or vice versa, the partner drowns you in his experiences and you forget your face, the diagnosis is accurate: where there are no two separate people, there is no relationship, there is a merger, ending in suffocation.","health":"Overcrowding is visible on the body: migraines before the rain, a lump in the throat from the uncried, intestines on nervous grounds, exacerbations before the cycle. You need regular discharge: sports to fatigue, crying when asked, therapy as the norm, not a last resort.","esoteric":"Flooded Temple: the gift of clairvoyance is on constantly and without a filter, hence exhaustion and confusion of \"where mine is, where is stranger.\" Return control: visualizing the walls of the vessel around your field, daily cleaning, grounding. While you are an open window into alien worlds, become the door you close yourself."}},{"id":"cups-king","name_ru":"King of Cups","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"cups","number":null,"img":"cups-king.webp","element":"Water","astro":null,"upright":{"short":"The king is calm in the midst of a troubled sea: power over the senses, wisdom of the heart, generous firmness.","keywords":["maturity","self-control","wisdom","diplomaticity","generosity","foothold"],"archetype":"The throne floats in the turbulent sea, but the King is still: the hand holds the cup flat, the waves are high, the fish and the ship play behind the back. The main idea of Waite's drawing is that the skill is not to remove the storm, but to remain yourself inside it. The fire of the will that governs the water of the senses is the royal alchemy of the Cups.\n\nThe card represents emotional maturity: a person who knows his rage and tenderness and is not afraid of either, and therefore does not control anyone through them; a diplomat, a mentor, a father who can say no so that relationships persist; he is generous without show of show and strength.","daily":"The role of anchor: a family dispute that you can hear from both sides and make a difference without winners or losers; a good day for a serious conversation with your parents and reconciliation with your relatives; your peace of mind is contagious; use it wherever everyone raises their voice.","career":"Peak management maturity: conflict negotiations, layoffs, customer complaints, they go through you and don't break you. You're heard when you speak quietly. Great mentoring and mediation times. Decide with a cold heart: consider the feelings of the parties, but determine the outcome in essence.","love":"Adult romance: reliability instead of swings, depth instead of performances, respect and honest conversations about feelings, including uncomfortable ones. Single people, meeting someone mature and internally strong, often more experienced than you. If that description is yours, it's time to propose.","health":"Balance: a strong heart physically and figuratively, even pressure, stable mood. Stress you process quickly - it is dangerous to only accumulate it for years under the mask of \"I'm fine.\" Water is useful in all kinds; silent patience and the habit of dragging everyone is harmful: even the king needs shore.","esoteric":"Water: the fire of the spirit that subdues the ocean of emotion, the master who serves the senses without enslaving them. The card is used in the rituals of the world, the sanctification of mentoring, the work with anger through acceptance. The supreme lesson of suit: power is not not not to feel, but to feel everything - and choose how to act."},"reversed":{"short":"The sea entered the throne room: equanimity outside, a storm inside; feelings became instruments of pressure.","keywords":["storm-storm","emotional blackmail","coldness","instability","softness","opportunism"],"archetype":"The king is still, but calm has become a facade: under the crown are unlived storms. The first face is a manipulator who knows exactly where to press to do what he wants: coldness as punishment, guilt as a tool, love as currency. The second is a weak king: endlessly understanding and incapable of binding anything; drowns all who hold on to him.\n\nThe card means immaturity in the position of power: the boss playing favorites; the father punishing with silence; the partner deciding everything with the mood. It warns of internal discord — when the mind says one thing, the feelings another, and the body already hurts from incongruity. The call of the card is not discipline against the feelings, but an honest agreement with them.","daily":"Climate depends on the invisible hand: grievances are presented as care, decisions are made in silence, then the sound of \"I told you so.\" If it's the style of the loved one, call things in words, calmly and in front of witnesses. If you recognize yourself, find where you press on guilt instead of direct conversation.","career":"It's a manipulative leader or a chaos of silent decisions, where today, tomorrow, the opposite is mood, logic is powerless. Document agreements and don't get into emotional games: there's a loss. Your version of risk: decisions hang for months because it's scary not to like someone.","love":"Cold War or the tyranny of gentleness: the partner punishes with distance, includes a magnificent savior if he wants control, behind an impeccable facade, there is treason. If you are the carrier, ask the main question: what do you achieve with love and what with fear? The answer will determine the future of the relationship more accurately than forecasts.","health":"Underneath the facade, there's pressure: hypertension, heartache with complete \"I'm calm,\" nighttime anxiety attacks that are denied by the day, suppressed anger doesn't go away -- it moves into the vessels. There's a safe way out: resistance in sports, written rage without a recipient, therapy. Silent patience is the most expensive habit of this card.","esoteric":"The perverted Water Adept: Knowledge of currents is used to steer other people's wheels -- suggestion, love spells, rescue games. Audit the motives of every \"good deed\" for a person or for power over him? Real mastery of the element begins with a refusal to control someone else's will, otherwise the water will ask for a debt."}},{"id":"swords-ace","name_ru":"Ace of Swords","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"swords","number":1,"img":"swords-ace.webp","element":"Air","astro":null,"upright":{"short":"Breakthrough of Clarity and Moment of Truth: A sharp, honest thought cuts through the accumulated confusion and opens a straight path forward.","keywords":["clarity","break-out","truth","intelligence","fairness","determination","novelty"],"archetype":"A hand in a cloud clenches a bare sword with a wreath on the edge: the insight comes from outside, suddenly and undeniably. This is the beginning of a new intellectual cycle — the fog of guesswork dissipates, the situation is seen for the first time as it is.\n\nThe sword is double-edged: the truth cuts off the excess, but it can also hurt the one who pronounces it. The wreath promises victory through understanding, the rocks by the cloud - that there are no easy triumphs. The idea is ripe, the solution looks the only right one: green light for the mind.","daily":"A complicated household issue is resolved with a single, accurate call, and the argument ends with a wording that everyone agrees on: It's a good time to sort through the papers, clarify the agreements, abandon the obsolete. You have important letters and conversations today, the words are exactly the goal.","career":"The idea is recognized as right, the presentation is brilliant, the divisions are conflicted by arguments, the card favors negotiation, litigation, project defense, wherever strong logic wins, lead the new direction: fresh leadership on your side, just keep the wording short and specific.","love":"Relationships need one honest phrase: a card helps find it: omissions are replaced by clear agreements about the rules of the game. The lonely promise is an acquaintance where the mind first catches: sharp language, reading, the ability to argue beautifully. Feelings are connected by second ones, the foundation is built on respect and candor.","health":"The test will finally reveal the true cause of the ailment, and the treatment will be targeted. In medical matters, the Ace can indicate an operation that is timely and successful. Headaches and insomnia go away when you stop chewing the intractable and write down the plan on paper.","esoteric":"The pure element of Air: the practice of concentration, the power of the spoken word, the cutting off of bindings, the protection of space. The sword of the aces is charged by talismans to win a righteous cause. The oath or contract held together by this card takes on the weight of a spell - the word becomes an act.","gd":{"title_en":"The Root of the Powers of Air","title_ru":"Root of the Air Force","why":"Pure Air is the power of thought, discernment and decision, and the ace is not an opinion, but the very principle of clarity and intellectual cut-off."}},"reversed":{"short":"The point is downward: the thought turns against the owner, turning into chaos of ideas, distorted information or verbal cruelty.","keywords":["confusion","misinformation","brute force","verbalism","self-deception"],"archetype":"The hand still clutches the sword, but the blade cuts blindly: clarity is replaced by many contradictory opinions, advice excludes each other. Where the straight ace triumphs reason, inverted shows the power of irritation, arguments are fought for victory, not for truth.\n\nThe second is power without conscience: hardness where there is firmness, pressure where persuasion is needed, victory is a fiery victory: the opponent is broken, but reputation crumbles with him. Sometimes the card speaks of an inner censor drowning his own insight in doubt.","daily":"Small frictions break out into big fights: a bad phrase at breakfast spoils the whole evening, documents get confused, news comes in contradictory, the day goes to clean up the already decided, do not make important decisions on nerves and double-check any information, especially the one told by others.","career":"Meetings become barbs, decisions go to the louder, the project can be criticized without constructive or taken away without explaining the reasons, the worst move is to respond with a blow: write down the agreements and wait until the general excitement subsides itself.","love":"The word becomes a weapon: the relationship-clarification leaves fragments that are found for months to come, the cold logic goes against the feelings, \"you're overreacting,\" and the measure of victory should not be a broken partner, but a preserved relationship.","health":"Warning against medical errors: look for a second opinion before radical intervention; nervous system wear and tear — stress hits the head, eyes and sleep; Be careful driving and in sports: rush and irritation dramatically increase the risk of cuts, bruises and accidents.","esoteric":"The backlash of the word: backbiting and gossip are back to the sender, aggressive practices are now contraindicated, cutting off the \"evil emotion\" anchorage will only strengthen the connection, the opposite works - silence, posting from the news, sweeping away accumulated offensive phrases from the house.","gd":{"title_en":"The Root of the Powers of Air","title_ru":"Root of the Air Force","why":"Pure Air is the power of thought, discernment and decision, and the ace is not an opinion, but the very principle of clarity and intellectual cut-off."}}},{"id":"swords-two","name_ru":"Two of Swords","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"swords","number":2,"img":"swords-two.webp","element":"Air","astro":"The Moon in Libra","upright":{"short":"Dead end of her own free will: a woman with a blindfold holds two crossed blades, delaying the choice life demands.","keywords":["deadlock","choicelessness","balance","truce","avoidance","weighing"],"archetype":"The blindfolded woman is sitting with her back to the sea, holding two crossed swords, and the pose is perfectly symmetrical — but it's not peace, but the frozen balance of two forces that are too scary to choose between. The blindfold says the main thing: there is no answer, not because it doesn't exist, but because you voluntarily closed your eyes to the truth.\n\nTwo swords are a pause where life requires a move, sometimes it's a wise truce: the weapons are lowered, and compromise is ripened in silence, sometimes a long seat on the fence, when both options are explored up and down, and the heart pretends that there is no choice at all.","daily":"The day puts choices you carefully don't accept: change or fix, go or dissuade. While you weigh, life kindly pauses things -- use it as a rest. The answer comes early, if you stop interrogating him.","career":"The stalemate: two sentences, two strategies, none of them outweigh. You may be dragging out a nasty conversation, hoping it will work out for you. You can choose by the main criteria: there will never be complete certainty. If the conflict has reached a dead end, you can arrange a truce and get stronger in the calm.","love":"The relationship is at a fork, and both pretend there is no intersection. The question of the future is in the air, it's scary to start it. Perhaps a truce after a quarrel: weapons are down, the causes of the conflict are not carefully discussed. The card gently asks: how much longer can we live on standby?","health":"Your body reflects stagnation: clamped shoulders, stiffness, lethargy in the absence of disease, your body awaits your decision, just as your doctor expects you to answer, \"Cure or not.\" Deferred examination now: uncertainty is cured by facts, not by persuading you to wait.","esoteric":"The threshold between the two paths: the initiate stands with his eyes closed, and the world freezes with him; the ideal for meditation is inner silence, listening before the answer is heard; in magic, the two are used for truce rites; but the enchanted \"no\" exhausts: the threshold is created to step through it.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Peace Restored","title_ru":"Lord of the Restored World","why":"Libra tends to balance, and the Moon wobbles. The two holds opposites in fragile balance - so it's not a serene peace, but a restored peace."}},"reversed":{"short":"The bandage slides without relief: circumstances force you to choose, and an excess of information and other people's opinions finally muddies the picture.","keywords":["elbow-drift","flow","truce-break","choice-making","anxiety"],"archetype":"The bandage falls, and it doesn't bring relief: the facts are too much, every new opinion cancels the old one, and the more you know, the harder it is to choose, and indecision has become a lifestyle: a person is so afraid of making mistakes that he makes uncertainty a permanent place of residence.\n\nAnother story is the collapse of the truce, the silent conflict is revealed at the worst moment, and it turns out that the silence was not peace, but the accumulation of ammunition. The balance of avoidance collapses at the first touch of the truth. Any movement is now more honest than perfect immobility.","daily":"The little things that we do in our household -- the tariff, the purchase, where to give the old thing -- add up to an alarming pile, and each one needs an answer today, and the options disappear, the deadlines expire, and separate the inevitable from the unimportant: decide the first one right away, strike the second one out, and try to take everything into account completely paralyzes everything.","career":"The project is idle because of your hesitation, the bosses demand certainty, the competitors choose for you. Reports agree on one thing, intuition says another. The card warns that the reputation of the person with whom you can not agree, values every week of delay — make a working, imperfect decision.","love":"The lull is over, the partner is tired of waiting, and he asks you to decide or let go, the inconsistencies fall out at once, the avalanche of clarifications covers both, for singles it is a perpetual \"I'll see\" where everything is decided long ago without you, silence is also the answer, only the worst.","health":"Chronic unselected tension turns into symptoms: insomnia with a spinning head, a lump in the throat, pressure surges; the body can literally force a delayed decision to be made by a disease; the second aspect is information intoxication: reading forums instead of visiting a doctor increases anxiety.","esoteric":"The energies of the two paths extinguish each other: circles don't close, conspiracies crumble in half-word, the cause of impure intention or fear of choice, a two-step job: remove the bandage when you honestly see your desire, then ground yourself and with one gesture close the rejected door.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Peace Restored","title_ru":"Lord of the Restored World","why":"Libra tends to balance, and the Moon wobbles. The two holds opposites in fragile balance - so it's not a serene peace, but a restored peace."}}},{"id":"swords-three","name_ru":"Three of Swords","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"swords","number":3,"img":"swords-three.webp","element":"Air","astro":"Saturn in Libra","upright":{"short":"A heart pierced by three blades under a stormy sky: pain inflicted by words, betrayal, or a bitter truth that can no longer be denied.","keywords":["heartache","betrayal","bitterness","tears","gap","sorrow"],"archetype":"The most recognizable image of the deck is a red heart in a shower, and three swords enter it from above, from the side, from below. The pain is doubly mental — the swords belong to the element of the mind, so the head plays over and over again the wounding scene: confession of treason, public humiliation, a letter that divides life into \"before\" and \"after\".\n\nBut the card has a second line: rain is the end of a thunderstorm, not the beginning. Although even painful, it liberates, the illusion is dissected with the heart. Saturn in Libra adds a lesson of justice: where obligations are broken, the count comes necessarily. This pain must be called by name - only the one named can be released.","daily":"A nasty conversation that's long overdue: with a neighbor about noise, with a relative about money, with a friend about debt, and there may come news that will sway you -- rejection, tariff increases, other people's negligence that hurts. Don't drown out the irritation: one honest conversation now saves months of numb tension later.","career":"Criticism, failure of a deal, or conflict in a team: the project is deployed, the report is disassembled in front of everyone, cuts are possible. The message is to separate the painful form from the content: in hard feedback, there is almost always a grain that will make you stronger. Sign the documents carefully: the three punish negligence.","love":"Here, the card speaks in the first person: betrayal, exposed lies, a breakup, a triangle in which all three of them hurt. The main blows are the words spoken hotly or intentionally. If a couple survived a storm, the three require honesty without anesthesia: silence will turn the wound into an abscess.","health":"Acutes: inflammation, fever, pain, nervous exacerbations. Heart and blood vessels are the first to respond to stress, monitor your performance. The card is also about surgery: painful, but to save you. The main recipe is not to drag the pain alone: tears reduce stress hormones, support accelerates recovery.","esoteric":"Three swords, thought, word and deed: three ways to wound; a card shows where you've been hurt and what time to mourn; grief practices are letters to the abuser that burn; tears are like cleansing the field; a three is a sanitary of the soul: it opens the abscess so that it doesn't poison the whole body of the relationship.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Sorrow","title_ru":"Lord of Sorrows","why":"Saturn fixes boundaries and divides, and Libra is a union, and in the Troika, the idea becomes a fact, and the fact of separation is experienced as sadness."}},"reversed":{"short":"The blades slowly come out of the heart: the wound heals and forgiveness becomes possible, or the pain is hidden inside and continues to work there.","keywords":["healing","forgiveness","release","grudge","recovery"],"archetype":"The inverted Three reads in two ways: One is light: the tips turn down, the worst is behind, the heart restores the ability to feel. There's an apology or at least an understanding; the person finds himself remembering the past without the usual spasm; this is a card of therapy and reconciliation.\n\nThe second is shadow: the wound is not cured, it's preserved. \"I'm fine\" is pronounced with the blades alive inside: cynicism instead of trust, an old story told with the same fever. Unforgiven resentment is an anchor that holds the rest of life. The heart owner chooses the branch.","daily":"Recovery from a fight: first peaceful tea, awkward hello, trying to get the house back to normal, or the opposite is rumble in the kitchen, where the claims are made to the pots rather than the recipient, and finish the process: being unhurt is worse than fighting openly, and a short message to someone you haven't spoken to takes the load off.","career":"After a failure, the team learns to work again: reputation grows, a new project compensates for the old one, a return to the old one is possible. The shadow option is a protracted war with the offender: memos and petty revenge eat up the forces that are better invested in the next success.","love":"After a crisis, the couple is given a second chance: apologies are spoken, rules are discussed, intimacy returns cautiously, like a bird on a windowsill. The flip side is cyclical wars: one resentment comes up at every opportunity, \"sorry\" has long been a formality. True forgiveness is measured by a lack of desire to remind.","health":"The recovery phase: the postoperative period is going well, the pain subsides, the tests improve, but psychosomatics reminds us of the depressed: unspeakable sadness settles in the body with chronic pain in the back, stomach, throat. If \"everything is normal\" and sleep is bad, the body argues with the head; return the channel to the senses.","esoteric":"The work of blade extraction: the rituals of forgiveness, the gentle cutting off of old bindings, the purification of the heart with candlelight. The rites of completion are effective, the symbolic burial of a deceased relationship. The shadow side is healing as eternal procrastination: the annual collection of techniques instead of one real let go.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Sorrow","title_ru":"Lord of Sorrows","why":"Saturn fixes boundaries and divides, and Libra is a union, and in the Troika, the idea becomes a fact, and the fact of separation is experienced as sadness."}}},{"id":"swords-four","name_ru":"Four of Swords","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"swords","number":4,"img":"swords-four.webp","element":"Air","astro":"Jupiter in Libra","upright":{"short":"Cathedral silence: the knight rests on the tombstone right in the armor - a respite between battles, without which the next one will be lost.","keywords":["rest","recovery","pause","contemplation","solitude","build-up"],"archetype":"The knight lies in the temple with his hands folded in prayer; one sword under him, three hanging over him idle. The battle is won or lost - the forces have ended the same, and the only worthy move now stop.\n\nThe important thing is that the armor is not removed: the knight is not a deserter, he is preparing. It is a strategic rest - a sleep before the decisive day, a vacation after the Aurral. Jupiter in Libra promises that recovery will bring back not only strength, but also luck: from this silence come the best solutions.","daily":"Cancel appointments, turn off the news, sleep as much as the body asks. Things are half-medicated: disassemble one drawer, not an apartment; respond to three letters, not forty; the card allows you to decide nothing today - pause now is the right thing to do.","career":"The project phase is over -- don't start a new one on the go. Take a day off or go into gentle mode: the decisions of the exhausted player will cost more than a pause. The quiet retrospectives and planning without execution are useful. Your own respite is as legitimate as someone else's.","love":"Relationships enter a safe haven: keeping quiet together, not filling in pauses with words, is also close. After a stormy period, it is useful to be apart: a short separation brings taste back to meetings. Single people - permission not to fix loneliness immediately: sometimes it is a workshop where the heart gathers.","health":"The direct card of recovery: sanatorium, hospital, rehabilitation, normal sleep. The body repairs what is broken in battle - give it materials and time. The nervous system needs a mode: meditation, breathing, massage. Morning breakdown is not anxiety, but a bill for overload paid for by rest.","esoteric":"Temple silence is the state between the tasks: retreat, fasting from information, practicing silence. The sword at the chest of a knight is the concentration of one thought; three above it is the rejection of unnecessary things. It is favorable to work with dreams: during such rest, something comes that does not break through the noise of the day.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Rest from Strife","title_ru":"Lord of Rest from Struggle","why":"Jupiter expands the possibility of agreement, and Libra seeks balance, and after the Troika, the system is temporarily stabilized: not final peace, but respite and truce."}},"reversed":{"short":"The rhythm of rest is broken: the body requires a pause by shouting, or the respite is delayed to stagnation, and the person has already forgotten why he got up.","keywords":["exhaustion","sleeplessness","pause","stagnation","back-to-back"],"archetype":"Two poles of the same problem: One: recovery is impossible, people are pulled to work in the middle of recovery, conscience is not allowed to go on vacation, coffee masks what is long overdue to cure. Armor grows into the body.\n\nThe second pole is mirrored: the pause has become suspended animation; the rest, conceived as a respite, is made a way of life; the \"preparation\" lasts so long that it is forgotten, for which it was prepared. The general signal of the card is that energy is controlled, not waited for, and the inability to stop is punished by a forced stop.","daily":"Sleep deprivation accumulates, little things fail, irritation flares up from scratch, or vice versa: the days are glued together in a long sofa, and even rest ceases to rest. The recipe is a frame: a hard climb, a walk, one mandatory item on the list. A small discipline will restore the taste for work and celebration.","career":"Abruptly, after a week, the holidays are delayed for the third year, mistakes are more frequent with overtime to correct them, the next station on this path is an unplanned hospital. The opposite story is professional hibernation: skills rust, letters hang for weeks. One thing is treated - an honest schedule with boundaries.","love":"The couple lives like dormitories: schedules don't overlap, conversations are reduced to logistics, intimacy is canceled until better times, fatigue is read by the partner as indifference, and the opposite is possible for a greenhouse - fleeing from the world together instead of living, you need a balance of silence and going out.","health":"Exhaustion: superficial sleep, immunity is losing ground, old sores come up all at once — the body compels you to count: back, virus, pressure. The other side is stagnation without movement: lying down does not restore. The formula is boring and effective: sleep on schedule, movement is dosed.","esoteric":"The practice is blocked on two sides: no strength to concentrate, or meditation has become an escape from life; the aura needs cleansing — nature, water, earth return to tone; the warning of spiritual avoidance: endless retreats instead of real tasks give beautiful stagnation; it brings out the simplest action.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Rest from Strife","title_ru":"Lord of Rest from Struggle","why":"Jupiter expands the possibility of agreement, and Libra seeks balance, and after the Troika, the system is temporarily stabilized: not final peace, but respite and truce."}}},{"id":"swords-five","name_ru":"Five of Swords","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"swords","number":5,"img":"swords-five.webp","element":"Air","astro":"Venus in Aquarius","upright":{"short":"A grinning winner collects other people’s blades, the defeated leave after a swelling: a gain that is shameful to put in the diary of achievements.","keywords":["conflict","win-win","trickery","defeat","loss","win-win"],"archetype":"A man with a sly grin picks up other people's swords; two defeated men walk away without turning around, and the sky remains torn, a score that is formally crushing, in fact a minus for all involved: a conflict where victory has been more expensive than a relationship.\n\nThe card is two-faced. Sometimes you're the one with a grin: the trophy is won by pressure or intrigue and it doesn't make you happy, it gets the contempt of others. Sometimes you're the ones who leave: the argument is won more brazenly, and the main question now is what to do with that experience. Five teaches you to distinguish between right and effective.","daily":"It's a domestic conflict that's been won on nerves: you insist on your own, you win back the parking lot, you put your relative in his place, and you play through the sediment all day long. It's cheaper to end a domestic war with a truce than to win. In the evening, honestly ask yourself, did I defend interest or self-esteem?","career":"Office fights without rules: a colleague appropriated an idea, a boss criticized publicly, a tender was taken by dumping, buried margins. You may be acting hard yourself, effectively realizing that bridges are burning. Count not only trophies, but also bills. After losing, watch the behavior of the defeated: it is remembered longer than losing.","love":"A fight where the argument won and the pair lost: the partner is crushed by logic and fell silent, the distance has grown by kilometers. Old sins are put into action like ammunition - this is not forgotten quickly. The card's question is edged: are you allies in the same trench or opponents?","health":"Conflict-based stress: pressure surges, stomach shrinks, gastritis escalates after a hard conversation; aggression is dangerous when turned inwards; psychosomatics likes the unspoken; sports competition for anger is traumatic: today, swimming pool is better than martial arts.","esoteric":"The shadow side of the force: the magic of suppression works -- and binds the operator in a karmic knot. Revenge rituals return the performer to the form of his own cruelty. Healthy work is the analysis of the inner warrior: where do I cunning where I could speak straight? Defense is permissible, aggression is always duty.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Defeat","title_ru":"Lord of Defeat.","why":"Five breaks stability, and Venus in cold fixed air is not always able to reconnect, and social interaction breaks down into winners and losers."}},"reversed":{"short":"The blades are falling: the desire to find out who is whom is fading away – the slow clearing of rubble after the conflict and the reckoning of the war begins.","keywords":["reconciliation","pardon","reckoning","war-weary","conflict"],"archetype":"The afterword to battle in three senses: Abandon: someone first reaches out, it becomes clear that the war is more expensive than the lost face; some of the trophies are returned to the owners. Payback: intrigue is uncovered, allies have turned away, the reputation of the manipulator has begun to work against him.\n\nThe third sense is more subtle: the fatigue of fighting itself, the fact that one finds that one no longer wants to win even where one can, not weakness, but growing up: the force that fed the opposition seeks better uses, which is a turn the card calls the world — first internal, then external.","daily":"After a week of friction, the air is fresh: neighbors apologize, family pretends that Saturday's scandal was a dream, you want to make amends, buy something for the table, say an extra thank you. To take the first step is not to lose. But don't force it: some relationships need more silence than they seem.","career":"Conflict is over: the former adversary offers cooperation, the leadership admits excesses, the possibility of leaving a toxic environment — dismissal as demobilization, not defeat. If you pressed, trust will have to be restored: it is slower than winning an argument, but feasible. The best move is transparency.","love":"The post-ice age thaw: for the first time in a long time, talking about what's next, not who's to blame; someone saying \"sorry\" without \"but\"; old grievances losing their status as a battle flag; repair is possible if both agree to pay for it with honesty; the card gives cautious hope.","health":"Relief after prolonged stress: blood pressure decreases, sleep returns, the stomach stops shrinking. Any change of environment helps - vacation, another workplace, getting out of the toxic circle. Careful with conflict eating: anxious appetite is deceptive. Stretching, warm water, massage.","esoteric":"Détente: the nodes of conflict are unleashed, the damage is no longer resentful, the defense works are no longer necessary. It is a good time for candles for reconciliation and cleansing the house after scandals. The main principle: let go of the debtor is to free yourself first. The best defense against enemies is to stop creating them.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Defeat","title_ru":"Lord of Defeat.","why":"Five breaks stability, and Venus in cold fixed air is not always able to reconnect, and social interaction breaks down into winners and losers."}}},{"id":"swords-six","name_ru":"Six of Swords","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"swords","number":6,"img":"swords-six.webp","element":"Air","astro":"Mercury in Aquarius","upright":{"short":"The boat moves from the stormy waters to the quiet shore: a crossing through the inevitable, where sadness about what is left is mixed with quiet relief.","keywords":["transition","move","storm-walk","calming","past","crossing"],"archetype":"The carrier rules the boat silently, the passengers sit with their backs in their capes, and six swords stand in the boat - the luggage of what they are taking away. Behind the stern, the water is smooth ahead. It's a transition without heroism: a quiet, almost mournful escape from a situation that has become impossible.\n\nRetreat is wiser than winning: moving out of a city where everything reminds you of loss, a new job after burnout, a new shore of the golden mountains is not expected — there is simply calmer, and often it is exactly what you need. Swords in the boat remind you that experience can not be left on the other shore. The crossing turns trauma into a biography if you let it swim.","daily":"After a noisy streak, life gets straight: fixed, moved, disassembled boxes. Good little change of scenery -- reshuffle, trip to the water, new route. Literally move possible. A slight melancholy is normal: you pass an entire era of life; treated with hot tea and a to-do list in a new place.","career":"Change of scenery: transfer to another department, smooth exit from the exhausted project, the place where it is more calm, even a step below. Conflicts subside themselves, you should leave the war zone. Move with respect for what you have passed: recommendations and connections will soon come in handy.","love":"Relationships go from storm to calm — quietly, with a glance. A couple can move, start with a clean slate or learn to speak quietly. The opposite story can also be possible: peaceful spending without scenes — a boat takes everyone to their shore. Single people — acquaintance on the road or with a person from afar.","health":"The recovery is smooth: the acute phase is behind, the body is moving to stability. It's good to change the climate or the doctor - the treatment works better in the new place. It shows water: pool, sea trips, baths. Don't demand instant happiness: the crossing does not tolerate rush.","esoteric":"Guide card: helpers and transition forces lead the boat, trust is the main safety technique here, accompanied by the rites of change of place: housewarming, clearing space, wires of the dead stage of life. If life calls somewhere quieter, it is not a regression, but a route.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Earned Success","title_ru":"Lord of Deserved Success","why":"Mercury gets a systematic and detached intelligence in Aquarius, and the six harmonizes suit: the output is not through emotion, but through intelligent method, calculation and route."}},"reversed":{"short":"The boat is circling in place or backing up: the crossing hung over due to unfinished cargo, fear of a new shore or a secret desire to return.","keywords":["stuck-cross","past-less","change-resistance","return","sprinting"],"archetype":"The boat is worth leaving, leaving, leaving, going to leave, going to leave for a long time and seriously, but every Monday everything is postponed, or backtracking: circumstances pull back — the offer to return the position, the call of the ex, pity for the one left.\n\nA common reason for towing is unclosed cargo: unsettled goodbyes, unpaid debts, uncollected documents. Until the tail of the past is legally and emotionally decorated, the new shore holds its distance. And sometimes vice versa, flight to escape: cities change because it seems that the problem is geography. What you're running from is sitting in the same boat.","daily":"The suitcase is half-packed, the sale announcement hangs for weeks, repairs are started and abandoned. Small incompleteness multiplies — unwritten answers, uncapped calls. You may be forced to return from a trip or live together again \"while temporarily.\" Bring to the end one thing that pulls water, the move will return.","career":"The transition is frozen: the offer is received, it is scary to sign; the dismissal is announced, the deadlines move endlessly. The project is transferred back and forth, exhausting the team. There are possible difficulties with the documents for moving. Write down everything that should be completed before leaving, and close the list — otherwise the old place will hold by the sleeve.","love":"It's a breakup that never ends: things are cruising, the last conversation is in its fourth month, they both don't know if they're together or not, or the couple are hanging between the stations, putting off the next stage, and it takes honesty: either swim or admit that you want to row back, the middle of the river is not housing.","health":"The recovery stalls: the course is interrupted in the middle — \"it became easier, quit the pills,\" and the disease comes back in waves. Rehabilitation does not go because the nervous environment is the same. The diagnosis is re-calibrated, the prescriptions change. The recipe: complete the treatment and remove the source, not just the symptoms.","esoteric":"The practice of crossing is blocked: the rites on the road crumble, because the petitioner has not decided whether to leave; the spirits of the place are held for debts; the ritual of completion is necessary - an official goodbye to the place, people, yourself.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Earned Success","title_ru":"Lord of Deserved Success","why":"Mercury gets a systematic and detached intelligence in Aquarius, and the six harmonizes suit: the output is not through emotion, but through intelligent method, calculation and route."}}},{"id":"swords-seven","name_ru":"Seven of Swords","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"swords","number":7,"img":"swords-seven.webp","element":"Air","astro":"The Moon in Aquarius","upright":{"short":"The figure sneaks out of the camp with a heap of blades, looking over his shoulder: cunning, a detour and a secret that still holds.","keywords":["trickery","quirk","trickery","strategy","evasion","single-handed"],"archetype":"A tiptoe-toe man leaves a military camp with five swords; two are stuck, he didn't take everything, he took what he could. It's a game of bypassing the rules: not fighting, but a loophole; not the truth, but silence. Looking over the shoulder is the card's main gesture: noticed or not?\n\nThe two-faced card. In one light, it's survival savvy: when you can't win a game, the tactics that win are to get around, to not tell, to get away from a pointless fight. In another, it's betrayal: someone is already taking the most valuable things out of your home or company by smiling in their face. The moon in Aquarius adds a chill of calculation, where feelings are a tool.","daily":"You say one thing, you mean another thing; you move off the subject to avoid paying the bills. Sometimes it's a harmless tactic to keep the peace. But check the wallets and the arrangements: seven likes accounting holes. Don't gossip, what's said to third parties will come back to the recipient distorted.","career":"Intrigue: information flows to competitors, merit is appropriated by someone else, parallel negotiations are held behind you, your hidden maneuver is possible - confidential job search, bypassing the inhibiting authorities. The card requires quality of execution: ill-conceived cunning is revealed at the worst moment. Check accesses and signatures.","love":"There's a double bottom room in a relationship: correspondence that's hidden, meetings without explanation, treason, but perhaps also secret fatigue; in any case, the blindfold will take life off your partner's eyes, lonely people are waiting for a charming interlocutor who doesn't say a lot. Do you do it yourself? Ask: am I protecting the relationship or preparing a spare airfield?","health":"The hidden course of the disease: it's not manifest, so it's more valuable than the physical, to mask the symptoms with self-medication, to let the disease slip away, and the mental mind steals from itself, and the unspoken anxiety returns with night terrors.","esoteric":"The magic of halftones: hidden influence practices, rituals in secret, the art of moving unnoticed and reading other people's plans. The protective aspect is detecting energy theft and induced programs: if everything falls out of hand in external well-being, you need diagnostics. The limit is simple: the secret can be tactics, but not the goal.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Unstable Effort","title_ru":"Lord of Unsustainable Effort","why":"The moon adds changeability to the fixed intellectual Aquarius, and the seven makes the outcome dependent on the chosen tactics, so that the effort becomes unstable and may be in vain."}},"reversed":{"short":"The cloak is uncovered: the cunning is exposed or voluntarily admitted - and sometimes the deception is your own self-esteem.","keywords":["expose","recognition","return","self-deception","impostor"],"archetype":"The moment of truth for the snitch. The first story is: disclosure — the hidden comes up, the machination is visible in the reports, the avalanche of consequences is faster than explanation. The second is the candid confession: the man puts his swords in place because the severity of the mystery has become heavier than the possible scandal.\n\nThe third story is self-deception: nobody steals anything but self-confidence: the imposter syndrome whispers that merit is luck, knowledge is not enough, space is alien. The person steals his own right to occupy space. All branches converge on one point: the recognized truth heals, the crumpled rot.","daily":"Household secrets come out: an unsettled waste is discovered, someone else's secret is revealed that you'd better not know. If your conscience is sharpening on what you've lost, correct it right away while the price is low. And watch the internal dialogue: it's easy today to believe in your own failure without objective reasons.","career":"The intrigue is solved, the author is named, perhaps with your last name. Say first: a voluntary confession before charges saves reputation. The flip side is your own doubts: a promotion is offered, you are sure it is a mistake. Facts versus feelings: keep a list of real results.","love":"Secrets are no longer secrets: the partner discovers the hidden — or you decide to tell yourself. Scandal is likely, but honest scandal is more productive than the perfect facade. The second plot is self-depreciation in love: \"he finds out the real me, he leaves.\" The couple is tested not by the absence of secrets, but by how they survive their opening.","health":"Diagnosis catches up: tests show that the body has been silently patient, and treatment has finally begun. The price of masking symptoms comes quickly. The second plan is self-esteem health: self-distrust gives clamps, a lost appetite, a nervous cough before speaking. Small recorded victories help.","esoteric":"Magical audit: spells created half-true give back cravings; secret practices require honest intent; diagnostics reveals someone else's negativity that hasn't been completely removed; working with an impostor is the return of scattered power: listing what you've done, thanking your tools; the recognized gift starts working.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Unstable Effort","title_ru":"Lord of Unsustainable Effort","why":"The moon adds changeability to the fixed intellectual Aquarius, and the seven makes the outcome dependent on the chosen tactics, so that the effort becomes unstable and may be in vain."}}},{"id":"swords-eight","name_ru":"Eight of Swords","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"swords","number":8,"img":"swords-eight.webp","element":"Air","astro":"Jupiter in Gemini","upright":{"short":"A bound woman among swords: the cage is half built by circumstances, half by her own thoughts, and her door is unlocked.","keywords":["restriction","victim","self-blocking","helplessness","tightness","choice"],"archetype":"The woman stands blindfolded, surrounded by eight blades, the drama is in the details: the ropes lie loose, the bandage is removed with one movement, between the swords there are gaps for the exit. The cage is exactly half real: the second half was built by beliefs \"impossible,\" \"late,\" \"not for me.\"\n\nIt's a state of learned helplessness: constraints have become so common that they're no longer tested. Debt, contract, diagnosis, other people's expectations -- every sword seems invincible until you try to get around it. A card doesn't devalue a captivity -- circumstances are cruel. It refines the optics: the main captivity in the bandage.","daily":"A day is like running in a bag: commitments are layered, every movement hits the bars of a chart, write everything \"impossible\" on paper and ask each person, \"If I could?\" At least one link in the chain turns out to be a habit, not a wall. The task of the day is not to break the bonds, but to see their true thickness.","career":"The snags: a bonded contract, a position with no prospects, a leader who puts pressure on a sense of duty. There seems to be nowhere to go — the market is narrow, the age is old. Some of the prohibitions are long outdated: the market has changed, skills have grown. Start with intelligence — update your resume, talk to people. Intelligence does not require you to run, but restores your vision.","love":"The relationship became tight: \"for the sake of the children,\" \"he can't stand it alone,\" the bandage is worn with words of care. The partner can limit the real thing, but more often the jailer can - the scenario: the fear of loneliness is stronger than the pain of living together. Test: what rules apply, who made them, what happens if you break the softest?","health":"The therapeutic constraints -- diet, regimen, corset -- go from being treated to being a prison: people think they're sick where they're healthy; the fear of movement after injury delays recovery; the body doesn't need heroism, it needs a precise diagnosis of its own boundaries.","esoteric":"Magical binding: vows of the past -- obedience, loyalty, poverty -- are effective when the context is dead. Energy is pinched at the throat and eye level: one is not supposed to speak or see. Practice is an inventory of those vows: to revoke an outdated promise in writing and burn a list. Liberation begins with a word.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Shortened Force","title_ru":"Lord of Limited Power","why":"Jupiter tends to expand, but in Gemini it is broken down into many details and versions, instead of freedom, there is information noise and interference, the force is reduced and dispersed."}},"reversed":{"short":"The knots weaken: the victim discovers that the doors have been opened - liberation begins with a look, continues with a step.","keywords":["release","fresh-eyed","removal","break-out","foothold"],"archetype":"The moment the bandage slides: the woman sees the arena -- half the swords of the stick, the ropes are long untied, the edge is open behind her back. The first sense is liberation: the circumstances are mitigated, help comes unexpectedly, the loophole is where yesterday was a blank wall.\n\nThe second sense goes deeper: the author of the limitations changes: the person admits that he has built a large part of the cell himself, and liberation becomes a practice of dissolving one knot every day. The warning is close: freedom is as frightening as captivity. The person who is used to the cage can pull the bandage again. What will you do with the light you see?","daily":"Circumstances are tightening the grip: suddenly time was free, an impending commitment was cancelled, money was found for things you were afraid to think about, say yes to a sentence that was answered with an automatic \"can't.\" In the evening, count: how many of today's \"can't\" turned out to be conventions?","career":"Breakthrough: leaving a stifling position, abandoning a bonded project, unexpected offer. Rules are revised, the dispute ends better than expected. The main thing is to bring the release to the end: many find the door and stay next to you. Name the date of transition - uncertainty will return the cage.","love":"Addiction loses its power: the relationship is visible without fog — either the couple negotiates new honesty, or you choose the exit, the year hung open, the control of the partner weakens with the game of \"what he thinks.\" For those who are afraid of intimacy, the opposite is true: let the person be allowed in is not fatal. Freedom in love is the ability to choose without fear.","health":"Removing self-inhibitions heals the body: the patient gets out of bed he didn't want, the diet softens to reason, the movement returns the joints voice, the cause of the complaint, which has been tormented for years, was not the same. The caution is one: reconstitution of the body requires gradualism, do not rush from the cage into the pool.","esoteric":"The work of liberation: the removal of other people's programs and birth prohibitions, the termination of outdated obligations, the return of scattered power. Meditation on a card shows where you keep your cage locked up. Finish the ritual with action in the world: the first real step is mandatory, otherwise the force will be recaptured.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Shortened Force","title_ru":"Lord of Limited Power","why":"Jupiter tends to expand, but in Gemini it is broken down into many details and versions, instead of freedom, there is information noise and interference, the force is reduced and dispersed."}}},{"id":"swords-nine","name_ru":"Nine of Swords","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"swords","number":9,"img":"swords-nine.webp","element":"Air","astro":"Mars in Gemini","upright":{"short":"Night, nine blades on a black wall, and a man who has covered his face with his hands: anxiety devours from within, though no sword touches the body.","keywords":["anxiety","sleeplessness","nightmare","wine","despair","night-fear"],"archetype":"The man sits on the bed with his hands covered; there are nine swords hanging on the dark wall, and none touching the body. This is the key to the whole card: the attack comes from within. The night mind, after the break, judges life -- replays conversations, draws catastrophes, delivers sentences from which neither achievements nor loved ones save.\n\nThe most psychological card of the deck is the depression pit, the panic, the guilt that has become the background. The world around you can be quite bearable, suffering produces your mind. But the card has a hidden promise: the night ends on schedule, the pink dawn is already on the horizon. Almost everything that kills at three in the morning will not survive the morning.","daily":"Days pass under the background hum of anxiety: the little thing swells to disaster, the eternal \"what if\" accompanies every business, the worst nights. Put the fears on paper: a recorded disaster in the morning often looks ridiculous; less caffeine and evening news, more lively talk about what is going on inside.","career":"Work becomes a source of horror on duty: the report seems to fail, the silence from the leadership is a sign of trouble, there may be no real reason, nerves can no longer be distinguished. The counterweight is facts: the list of what happened is separate from the invented. Talking to the supervisor is more useful than nightly guesses.","love":"Relationships suffer from unspoken fears: jealousy without cause, anticipation of betrayal, reading correspondence instead of talking. You may be carrying old guilt — it wakes up at night. The card calls for bringing it to light: therapy, honest conversation, forgiveness of oneself. Love does not treat well what it was not informed.","health":"The first row is sleep and psyche: insomnia, nightmares, panic attacks, anxiety disorder. Somatics follows: migraines, spasms, gastrointestinal problems. This is the number one card for a visit to a therapist or a psychiatrist, and this is a normal, workable step. Remember the image detail: nine swords do not touch the body, the prognosis for treatment is good.","esoteric":"The night mind is a battlefield: accumulated fears, sometimes birth programs of trouble and guilt, working as a self-fulfilling curse. Practice is the exorcism of one's own mind: writing the names of fears, protective amulets for sleep, cleaning the bedroom with salt and candle. The demon of the night requires not exile, but hearing.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Despair and Cruelty","title_ru":"Lord of Despair and Cruelty","why":"Mars turns the mobile mind of Gemini into a conflicting, cutting thought, and the nine concentrates the power of the suit, and the mind begins to hurt itself or others."}},"reversed":{"short":"The first ray after a long night: fear loses its grip, help becomes visible - or anxiety goes deep and makes a nest there.","keywords":["lumen","sideways","fear-overcoming","quiescence","hope"],"archetype":"Two branches of reading. The light is dawn: the person raises his head, the worst expectations don't come true, anxiety loses credibility. Help comes in -- doctor, friend, psychologist, prayer -- and for the first time in a long night passes without trial. Recovery begins with small things: normal sleep and the ability to eat breakfast.\n\nShadow anxiety is legalized: it looks good, but fear has moved deep into the background, habit, character. Chronic alertness under the mask of \"I'm just careful\" is the same nine in business suit. The difference is simple: what was the last month of sleep and joy. The rollback on a difficult night does not change the general direction to the light.","daily":"Breathing is easier: a problem that has eaten weeks is resolved or found to be empty, the taste of food and the weather are again noticed. Work with the body - walk, water, breath squared. A good thing of the day is to thank those who supported during the dark period and accept an invitation that was previously refused.","career":"The band is leveling out: fear of dismissal was not confirmed, the audit ended in remarks, the leadership suddenly showed up. A colleague offers a hand - accept, self-sufficiency is not necessary here. Shadow option: formally working, and inside the constant horror of error - the reason for therapy, not another course on stress resistance.","love":"After a period of suspicion, the relationship gets air: the scary conversation goes smoother than expected, the partner turns out to be an ally, not a prosecutor. Forgiveness returns intimacy. Set new rules: fear to talk right away, not save up until the night. Old wounds benefit from family therapy — two times faster.","health":"The clear improvement: sleep is restored, panic is receding, the body is out of siege mode. Treatment is working — don't give up halfway: stabilization is deceptive. Prevention of relapse — regimen, fewer stimulants, specialist interventions even in the good phase. \"I'm fine\" insomnia — means only external order.","esoteric":"Dawn is practice: defense fields are strengthened, fears lose their flesh at the first honest examination; a dream diary is useful; the subconscious mind, when it stops frightening, begins to counsel; a warning about the cosmetics of the spirit: meditation to drown out anxiety only preserves it; the real work is friendship with your shadow when the lights are on.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Despair and Cruelty","title_ru":"Lord of Despair and Cruelty","why":"Mars turns the mobile mind of Gemini into a conflicting, cutting thought, and the nine concentrates the power of the suit, and the mind begins to hurt itself or others."}}},{"id":"swords-ten","name_ru":"Ten of Swords","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"swords","number":10,"img":"swords-ten.webp","element":"Air","astro":"The Sun in Gemini","upright":{"short":"The bottom is reached: the man lies face down, in the back ten blades — but the black sky is already rising the sun, and the blows are over.","keywords":["bottom","finale","betrayal","collapse","pain","dawn"],"archetype":"The most dramatic card of the deck is the body on the ground, the red cloak as the last sign of dignity, the whole suit in the back. It's a complete collapse: the end of a relationship, the collapse of a case, betrayal from your own. There's nothing to underestimate: exactly what was most feared happened.\n\nThe composition is ambiguous intentionally: ten blades are the limit, no more will enter; the blows are over, even if it seems otherwise. The drama is brought to the end for the sake of clarity - now we know exactly what died, and you can be buried instead of resuscitation. Sunrise over the calm sea - the second plot: from the present bottom the way is only up. The card says two sentences at once: yes, it's over; no, you're not over.","daily":"Everything at once: technology breaks, plans collapse, news finishes. The feeling of \"for what?\" is legal - do not silence it with business. A day without feats: minimum duties, maximum simple comforts - food, shower, a living voice of a friend. In the evening, mark physically that the chapter is closed: throw out the broken, delete correspondence.","career":"Professional failure: project shut down, you get fired or publicly blamed, partners get a backlash, don't sign anything in the early days, or judge the future from the pit: from the bottom, every horizon looks the same. Take away the documents and the recommendations, they'll come in handy sooner than you think.","love":"The end is final: betrayal is fully uncovered, there are no illusions left, there is no place to go back, there is no reason to go back, the pain is real - the card does not suggest that it be devalued by the words \"for the better\", only records the death of the bond. Sometimes it is the collapse of mutual hopes within the couple - illness, duty. After this card you stop wanting the former - and this is the beginning of a new one.","health":"Limit: exacerbations across all systems, temperature, pressure, insomnia; a diagnosis that you've been afraid of, or a crisis that requires professional help immediately; the main thing is that you feel deceptive and not a forecast; when you think hard, to the doctor and to people, don't be alone: a dozen are treated by being near you.","esoteric":"The arcanum of the end of the cycle: the old person died, and it's necessary to bury her, otherwise the corpse draws energy. The practices of goodbye are symbolic burial, epitaph letter, burning things of the past. Also karmic completion: the debt of this stage is paid, the lesson is passed. The worst scenario has already happened or canceled - there is nothing for fear to do.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Ruin","title_ru":"Lord of Destruction","why":"The ten brings the air to the limit of multiplicity and decay. The single center no longer holds the mass of contradictory thoughts, the structure is destroyed completely."}},"reversed":{"short":"From the lying position slowly sit down: the bottom is passed and the rise begins - or the person refuses to recognize the end and prolongs the agony.","keywords":["recovery","survival","slow-up","denial","lingering"],"archetype":"What happens after the shot is that the body moves. The first sense is recovery: the worst is over, the strength is back, the wounds are healed, life is resumed in modest steps. The person survived - this is the biography of the winner, although it does not feel like this yet: recovery is slower than desire.\n\nThe second thing is harder: refuse to accept the final. The top ten honestly said \"end,\" the flipped one pulls: another try, another chance. This is how you play dead relationships for years and re-borrow money for a loss-making business. The difference asks the question: do I go up or drag a corpse? Fight for the living — yes, the dead — let go.","daily":"Gradually, you're getting back to life: cooking again, answering your letters, laughing at trifles. Don't push it, one small achievement a day is enough. If you're three months into \"almost finishing\" something that's long overdue to burying, you're having a day to talk honestly to yourself. Plan the important morning: it's really kinder than the evening.","career":"Slow rebirth: the job after the layoff is better than the job it was, the team is reassembling, the reputation grows quieter than it ever was. Go back to the skills and connections that have been put aside. The reverse scenario is resuscitation of the dead: the company is on loan, no one dares to close the project.","love":"The relationship that survives is rebuilt: after an affair or crisis, the couple learns to live again, the trust returns in portions. Sometimes the second attempt is more successful than the first one, both have grown up. The flip side is that the connection died long ago, and they still break up - years of clarification and dying in circles. Do you build or sing?","health":"Recovery from a serious condition: the crisis is over, the indicators are leveling off, sleep and appetite return gradually. Rehabilitation requires patience - afterburning is harmful, the untreated returns, so the course is brought to the end. The shadow scenario is chronic: treated for years without an accurate diagnosis, because it is scary to look at the truth at the root.","esoteric":"Resurrection after magical defeat: power returns after someone else's attack or failure of practice, the field is cleared, the lesson learned. Good time to work with generic disaster scenarios - their power ends with the cycle. Warning of necrophilia of energy: holding the deceased ties with love spells does not resurrect, but binds both. The right wires are gratitude and a closed grave.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Ruin","title_ru":"Lord of Destruction","why":"The ten brings the air to the limit of multiplicity and decay. The single center no longer holds the mass of contradictory thoughts, the structure is destroyed completely."}}},{"id":"swords-page","name_ru":"Page of Swords","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"swords","number":null,"img":"swords-page.webp","element":"Air","astro":null,"upright":{"short":"The young man with his sword raised looks back at the wind: a curiosity and vigilance greedy for knowledge, not yet knowing discipline.","keywords":["curiosity","newsletter","teaching","alertness","sharp-headed","observation"],"archetype":"The page stands on a hill with a sword in the test stand; the wind rattles the hair, the look goes back to follow what is happening around. This is the spirit of the Air at a young age: the mind is greedy, fast, almost unassembled. The student and the scout, he collects information, tries on ideas, asks questions that adults have long ceased to ask.\n\nIts strength is the freshness of its eyes: it notices what others have been exposed to, and it hears the news that will soon become common; weakness is absent-mindedness: interests change faster than any course started ends; as a signal of alignment, the card brings news that require attention but not haste, and favors everything that begins with the word “interesting”.","daily":"The unexpected news, the fascinating topic, the sticky learning of something new, from recipe to language, the calls, the correspondence, the paperwork, the short trips are good. Write down ideas: there are many, but they are volatile. Check the rumors from the source - the information from third-hand comes distorted.","career":"Professional start or upgrade: new position, internship, first client, mastering the tool. Beginner's position now has the advantage of asking questions, collecting insiders, making contacts. There may be news of a vacancy or a competition. Advice: pick one topic for deep entry - widespread curiosity without focus dissolves the result.","love":"The romance of the mind: flirting in correspondence, talking until the morning, meeting where it is interesting to talk first. The relationship in the intelligence phase is both watching and teasing. The pair comes up with a fresh common theme: joint course, travel-research. Careful: spying on your partner is a bad sport, trust is more important than awareness.","health":"Good diagnostic time: examination, consultation, second opinion — information about your own body is obtained easily and on time. Keep a journal of well-being: observation reveals patterns that you can not see in fifteen minutes of reception. There is a lot of energy, but it is impulsive: warm-up is required, otherwise enthusiasm will end in stretching.","esoteric":"Apprenticeship: the learning period, the search for a school or teacher, the first self-practice, patronizing beginner fortune tellers and anyone who keeps observational diaries; synchronicity is taught to read the world as text; the protective side is information hygiene: filter what you let into the field; the word of the beginner already has weight."},"reversed":{"short":"The wind carries words: chatter instead of action, surveillance instead of interest, and a sharp tongue that cuts before the head thinks.","keywords":["gossip","haste","idleness","surveillance","immaturity","spraying"],"archetype":"The same wind, but without a rudder. Word became a weapon without a sight: gossip, messages sent before the thoughtful, sharp joke wrong there. Much is said, little is listened to, everything is known and nothing is profound.\n\nWatching has become surveillance: controlling other people's pages, reading correspondence, questioning under the guise of care -- curiosity is spying on the lives of others instead of building its own. The third story is spraying: ten courses started, none continued; knowledge is collected with stickers and does not become a skill. The card is not cruel: immaturity is a stage, not a sentence. But movement without development has a price.","daily":"The gossip of relatives, the chain of messages that eats the evening, the purchase influenced by random review. Words diverge quickly and expensively — said is a long time to rake in, pause before sending any sharp message, filter for news. It is more useful to silently finish one thing than to tell about five future.","career":"Office chatter is backfired: gossip comes back to the source, confidential information comes up where it shouldn't. The reputation of a person who doesn't keep his mouth shut rises. The other risk is imitation: courses without application, research without conclusions. One closed item blocks ten announcements.","love":"The slutty in the guise of wit: the partner is tired of being a stand-up audience; the jealous investigation — checking the phone, questioning the past — replaces trust with control; the intimacy doesn't grow; the single person has correspondence that doesn't turn into meetings: virtual flirtation is safer and therefore endless; the recipe for growing up is to talk about fears directly, not bite and peek.","health":"Information overeating is a nerve-wracking thing: mood swings, trouble falling asleep because of tape, nervous coughing. Voice and throat are the weak link: breakdowns from talking. Traumatic rush: cuts and bruises due to inattention, sports without warm-ups. Digital posts — hours without a phone in the morning and before bedtime — help.","esoteric":"Magical immaturity: the practitioner is thrown in the middle, the techniques are mixed without a system, words are spoken lightly, and they have consequences. The danger of talking about other people's practices and secrets without asking. The treatment is strict: one tradition, one practice on a schedule, a vow of silence about what is being done. The strength of the student's word grows exactly in proportion to the ability to hold it."}},{"id":"swords-knight","name_ru":"Knight of Swords","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"swords","number":null,"img":"swords-knight.webp","element":"Air","astro":null,"upright":{"short":"The rider flies into an attack against the wind: swiftness and focus on the target - speed that is not interfered with by doubt or weather.","keywords":["swiftness","pressure","determination","courage","focus","straightness"],"archetype":"The horse is pulled into a string, the cloak is crushed by the oncoming wind, the blade is brought in: the thought turned into action instantly, bypassing the stage of \"maybe we will wait.\" The Knight of Swords is the element of Air at full thrust, the hero-attacker who takes heights in one jerk.\n\nIts strength is the lack of brakes in a good way: fear of procrastination doesn't eat up energy. Its vulnerability is visible from the image: speed leaves no time for exploration — you can break into the wrong door or hurt someone behind you with a word. The card comes when it's time to act immediately — and asks: Is it really there you're rushing?","daily":"A day at speed: you get ahead of your usual time if you don't get distracted. A good time to jump is to take apart the blockage in one go, close the issue that's been hanging for a month. Plan one major assault, not five: the energy supply is finite. Be careful when you move, the road and the stairs today like the careless.","career":"Career sprint: launch without endless approvals, win the bid because you're first, the competitor is overtaken by a simple action. The card favors sales and negotiation to capture — wherever the initiative punishes the slow ones. Lead the arrow or take a difficult client. The only rule is: ten minutes to check the direction before the spurt.","love":"The romance of the hurricane: acquaintance in the morning, admission in the evening; the person appears suddenly, overwhelmed by directness and does not give time to think. Exciting — but passion without pause can be a storm that went by the morning. In a pair of cards, the decisiveness is brought: finally a proposal is made or a point in the eternal “maybe” is removed.","health":"A powerful burst of energy: your body wants movement and records — give it an honest workout instead of three cups of coffee. It's a great time to start a sports or rehabilitation program: push breaks procrastination. The flip side is the risk of overload: ligaments and your heart don't like sprinting after a year of sofa.","esoteric":"Magical onslaught: energy is sent powerfully and quickly - defense, breaking a dead end, working with the wind. Patron of messages: requests and conspiracies sent today reach quickly. Warning is close: intentions formulated in haste are executed literally and with errors - a second of silence before the release of force saves months of corrections."},"reversed":{"short":"The leap without a route: same speed, but the goals are blurred, words are cut, and courage turned into recklessness and anger at everyone around.","keywords":["recklessness","aggression","rush","scattering","burnout","rudeness"],"archetype":"The knight is still racing, where and why, power without a rudder: decisions before thoughts, words before testing, conflicts of trifles; a man cuts his shoulder where there is enough word; the second plot is a scatter: a dozen attacks launched, not one brought; the day is swept by a gallop, the result is dust.\n\nThe third is the price of sprinting: insomnia, intoxication, rage at all who \"slow down.\" The knight's burnout looks like anger, not apathy. The card offers what he hates most: to stop: laying down the horse, revisit the route, regaining his breath, and only then to re-spur.","daily":"It's annoying, words are spoken faster than you realize, you have to apologize, and rushing creates a mess: lost things, late things, broken on the run, evening fatigue when you feel like you haven't done anything, recipe: fewer items on the list, no important nerve conversations, exercise to dump steam.","career":"The perpetual rush has become a style: decisions pour in without analysis, mistakes multiply, the team has gone into a back-and-forth, candor has slid into rudeness, colleagues have been silenced in meetings, which is a bad sign. There is a potential conflict with superiors. Stop one attack and bring it to an end, it will restore respect faster than new promises.","love":"The partner lives in anticipation of the next burst: harsh words, hasty decisions, ultimatums that are regretted at night, the truth is presented in such a way that it takes weeks to heal it, a rushing romance started on emotion will collapse on the first everyday test, the phrase \"I'm angry, we'll continue in an hour\" retains more love than the most convincing attack.","health":"The system is at extreme speeds: pressure, heartbeat, clamps, exhaustion under the mask of anger. Typical injuries from rushes — sprains, cuts, road episodes; sleep is short and torn. The body does not ask for heroism, but for braking: smooth load, water, an evening without tasks. To ignore the request is to get forced to stop by the disease.","esoteric":"The backlash of the onslaught: the force sent in anger is distorted and returned sideways; the magic of haste breeds errors more expensive than the original problem; the practice requires grounding - to work out of silence, not excitement. The energy drains through anger: until the irritation is named and released bodily, it burns a resource. The technique of the day is three breaths of pause before every word and action."}},{"id":"swords-queen","name_ru":"Queen of Swords","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"swords","number":null,"img":"swords-queen.webp","element":"Air","astro":null,"upright":{"short":"The woman with the vertical blade looks straight into the future: clear mind, honest speech and boundaries that don’t have to be explained twice.","keywords":["clarity","independence","impartiality","honesty","borderline","discernment"],"archetype":"The queen is sitting in profile, facing the future; the sword is standing upright, not threatening, but measuring. Butterflies and angels on the throne remind us that tenderness is there, it just doesn't cancel order. It's a mature airborne mind, a man who has gone through loss and has not allowed it to cloud his eyes.\n\nHer strength is impartiality: facts are separated from emotions, her own and others'; her court is honest, sometimes uncomfortablely honest, and because of that she is trusted with complex issues; borders are transparent: manipulation breaks down on her, crocodile tears dry in the air of the throne; the queen's past is often marked by loss, but the card is not about the grief that grew out of it: the ability to discern, defend one's own and speak without lumping.","daily":"Adult day: quietly reject the person who used to get a yes, sort out the argument with one precise question, see who speaks for the cause and who for the effect. Legal affairs are good and agreements are good. Conduct a social circle audit: several contacts have long been drawing energy. Directness today is hygiene, not rudeness.","career":"Maturity: you're called a judge -- to evaluate a project, to understand a conflict, to give an opinion. Decisions are easy because you see the essence. Conditional negotiations are good; compromises are only deliberate; counseling, analytics, editing, auditing -- wherever you pay for accuracy. One caution: criticism should educate subordinates, not stigmatize.","love":"Love is in adult language: you know what you want, and you speak without hint, the partner gets clarity instead of a puzzle. The single card characterizes: the past history that could harden you turn into experience, and the next union is built on honesty. The partner is older and candid. The risk is to judge feelings by logic: not everything important is measurable.","health":"Health needs a system, not feats: a plan -- sleep, examination, movement -- is done without self-conceit. Your critical mind is now a doctor's ally: diagnostics and second opinion work well. Weaknesses like your neck, shoulders, teeth and anything that accumulates silent tension; speaking out loud relieves half of your symptoms.","esoteric":"The judge priestess: the practice of discerning true motives, recognizing lies and induced programs, cutting off alien influence in one word. Protects protective magic and cleansing space. The main law of her school is that the word is spoken rarely, weightily and seriously. Meditation on the queen takes its own severity as a form of care."},"reversed":{"short":"The blade turned to its neighbor: coldness pretends to be principles, criticism becomes execution, and borders become a blank wall.","keywords":["rigidity","bitterness","coldness","pickiness","revenge","isolation"],"archetype":"The sharpness of mind is preserved, the mercy is lost. The first story is ice: a person is so used to defend himself that he defends himself against those who did not attack; loved ones get dry instead of warmth, principles have become armor, inside which everyone, including the owner, is cold.\n\nThe second is justice degenerated into violence: criticism without compassion, remembering the old, retributing the cold, a queen like this who doesn't scream, she makes notes, and people around her fear, not respect. The third is internal war: unforgivable grievances have become a lens through which the whole world looks like a potential traitor; trust has atrophied by not using them. The sword was created for clarity, not for cold.","daily":"Life becomes a tribunal: the household walks on the string, there are more comments than praises. The alarm marker is the pleasure of someone else's mistake. The icy tone usually has a material cause: hunger, fatigue, old resentment. One warm act a day - calling mom, thank the courier - thaws better than self-conviction.","career":"The environment gets colder: ideas are cut from the door, subordinates bring only the safe, bosses look after the replacement softly, there is a possibility of conflict with a female colleague or supervisor - a battle of characters instead of work. If you criticize, add constructive; if you criticize, fix the facts in writing. Revenge is the worst career adviser.","love":"Relationships in the freezer: the partner gets sentences instead of talking, intimacy is replaced by a sin audit. Sometimes it's a response to real betrayal -- unpaid pain has petrified the heart. For singles, the bar is too high as armor: the exam is designed so that no one passes. The classic choice is to be right or be loved.","health":"The body avenges eternal mobilization: hypertension, jaw and neck cramps, stomach for repressed anger. Self-criticism turns into exhausting diets and war with the mirror; women's health is sensitive to long-term resentment. It is treated paradoxically by resolving weakness: crying, bathing, hugging are medically significant.","esoteric":"The danger of an embittered mind: revenge damage ties the operator tighter than the victim; purges don't help until the offense is released; there may be damage to loneliness or self-curse after treason — \"I never trust again\" works like a spell. The job of bringing back frozen heat and lifting the vows of a closed heart: forgive not for him, for your field."}},{"id":"swords-king","name_ru":"King of Swords","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"swords","number":null,"img":"swords-king.webp","element":"Air","astro":null,"upright":{"short":"The Lord of the Clear Mind on the Throne of Enface: Authority built on knowledge, honesty, and the ability to decide what others do not decide.","keywords":["authority","logic","fairness","ethics","strategy","responsibility"],"archetype":"The king sits straight as a sentence; the sword is ready to act, but does not thirst for it. Butterflies on the throne say that even harshness here serves transformation. This is the pinnacle of the air element: intelligence that has passed the school of life and become a system. Judge, strategist, scientist - anyone whose word becomes a decision.\n\nIt's powerful, the combination of knowledge and ethics: it distinguishes truth from profit, and it chooses truth even when it's uncomfortable, it's thought out to the consequences, it weighs just as much as it says, it's not good in the everyday sense, it's fair, it's more reliable. It often points to a particular person: a leader, a lawyer, a doctor, a father, and if it describes you, it's an invitation to take the throne: take responsibility not by force, but by clarity.","daily":"Big Decision Day: housing, school, treatment regimen, serious buying -- anything that requires gathering facts and saying one final yes or no. Promises are made in a balanced and fulfilled way. Good rule talk with kids and family is authority on your side. Avoid the extreme: after the verdict, allow yourself a dinner without a subpoena.","career":"Professional throne: elevated to a role where you decide, recognition of expertise, invitations to arbitration. Perfect day for contracts, lawsuits, strategies, hiring: head cold, criteria clear. If you're looking for a job, reach people higher: the recommendation of a weighty person now decides. Convince the facts: pressure you lose to your own image.","love":"Adult love: your demands are known and not ashamed; your relationship is either standard or free. In a pair, the king brings clarity: the conversation about the future ends with a plan, the conflict ends with rules, not the winner. You may have an older partner, a restrained one, his love is read in actions. The risk is to replace feelings with a regulation: the date schedule is not yet close.","health":"Systems: full screening, specialist care, protocol, performance monitoring. Well-planned treatment with a good doctor -- the specialist's hand is now solid. Discipline is easy to build and maintain. The weak link is the head: overstrain and migraines from responsibility; treated by delegation.","esoteric":"The top of the air hierarchy: the king's word creates -- prayer, command, or blessing has the force of law. Patron of spellwriters and all who build practice as a system of knowledge. The power ethic is built into the card: every order is returned to the executor three times, so the king judges himself first. The art of power is to decide in a way that does not override decisions."},"reversed":{"short":"On the throne is a tyrant or doctrinaire: logic without conscience, power without responsibility, and truth tailored to interests.","keywords":["tyranny","dogmatism","manipulation","abuse","complacency","cold-settling"],"archetype":"The power of the mind is preserved, the ethics are lost. The first is a tyrant: a leader, a parent or a partner, for whom people are functions; he does not shout, he presses with regulations and punishes with access to information. The second is a doctrinaire: truth is replaced by an unverifiable system; quotes against facts, regulations against common sense.\n\nThe third is the cold-water intriguer: the manipulation of documents and half-truths, the blow is legally flawless. If the card describes you, it shows the inner dictator: self-management has become self-torture, standards have become strangulation. The card's call is to restore meaning to the throne - power exists for order, order for life, not vice versa.","daily":"The internal prosecutor issues fines for every little thing, the domestics go through a string of demands, and there's a potential conflict with the official or the family: stubborn \"so it is\" against common sense. The information is distorted — read the fine print twice. Antidote: one action without utility, just because you want; the king is allowed to be human.","career":"The atmosphere is poisoned by power: the smug boss changes the rules retroactively, or you're in micromanagement -- the subordinates are afraid, the initiative is dead, the turnover is growing. The legal risks are high: fix the agreements, don't sign under pressure. Fight the system with evidence, not with emotion; build a backup airfield in parallel -- silently and methodically.","love":"Relationships are like interrogation: your partner keeps a record of your sins, loves conditionally, \"match, stay.\" Control is disguised as care: money, social circle, tastes are validated. If you're a tyrant, ask: when was the last time you asked, not ordered? Love doesn't stand up to audit, it lives on trust, which is killed by every test.","health":"Authoritarian mind hurts the body: the body's signals are ignored \"not to the point,\" self-medication by logic instead of examination, breakdowns from chronic control. Pressure, heart, stomach are targets of forbidden emotions: the king forbade himself to feel, and the body scored. The body does not obey orders - it needs cooperation: sleep, movement, a doctor you trust.","esoteric":"The twisted top: magic without ethics becomes the administration of others' destinies, and karma is turned on without concession to status. Spiritual arrogance — \"I know how to do it right\" — closes the channel of perception, practice stalls in repetition of memorized. Beware of pressure through esoteric services: charlatans with regalia and teachers demanding slavery. The treatment is one of humility to the unknowable: the real master differs from the tyrant in that he remained a student."}},{"id":"pentacles-ace","name_ru":"Ace of Pentacles","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"pentacles","number":1,"img":"pentacles-ace.webp","element":"Earth","astro":null,"upright":{"short":"The grain of new well-being: a concrete chance that, if successfully sown, promises material growth and a solid foundation.","keywords":["possibility","prosperity","new beginning","abundance","generation","chance","stability"],"archetype":"The hand of the cloud extends a gold coin, the sky offers gifts to the earth, and there is a flowering garden behind the arch below, the potential is already visible, but it needs to be grown, and the ace of pentacles opens the material cycle of the deck: it is not success itself, but its seed, given to you at a time when everything depends on the decision to take and plant.\n\nThe card is about a chance that looks like an everyday opportunity -- a job offer, a small amount to start, meeting a good person, the magic of the ace is that it doesn't promise miracles, it promises soil, and of all the beginnings of the suit, this is the most reliable one, because it relies on the earthly element: what is being laid now can take root and survive storms.","daily":"The ace brings a nice specificity: a surprise bonus, a bargain, a gift, a good day to start saving, to get your property paperwork, to make a down payment, and take an offer, even a modest one: a small stream today is a river full of water in a year.","career":"Professionally, the card marks a new business with a solid perspective: a job, a contract, a first client, or a start-up of your own project. The offer is not based on the brightness of the wrapper, but on the foundation — here it is. The start will take labor, but the resources are already allocated and the ground is prepared. A bold but sober step now will determine the trajectory for the years ahead.","love":"There's something real and grounded in a relationship, like meeting someone who's comfortable with you, or taking an existing union to the next level -- a co-housing, an engagement, a shared financial plan -- and it's about actions, not words, and if you're single, you're more likely to meet someone through work or business.","health":"The body has a recovery resource: time to strengthen the body and build habits that pay off in a hundredfold. Chronic is treatable with a systemic approach. Health resorts, treatments, healthy regimen are favorable, the recovery base is being laid right now.","esoteric":"The ace of pentacles is the root of the Earth, the point of the spirit's transformation into matter. The pentagram coin makes the card strong in monetary magic: the new moon planting of intentions, the first deposit in the piggy bank as a magical gesture. Meditation with a hand from a cloud teaches you to accept the gifts of the world without shyness or fear.","gd":{"title_en":"The Root of the Powers of Earth","title_ru":"Root of the Earth's Forces","why":"A pure earth is the potential of form, resource, body and material outcome, and it's not wealth as a result, it's the ability to make something happen."}},"reversed":{"short":"Chance slips out of hand: the benefits are out there, but the plan is not ready, the ground is not dug, and the fear of poverty is louder than common sense.","keywords":["missed opportunity","delay","lack of","scarcity","poor planning","greed"],"archetype":"The inverted hand doesn't give, it drops a coin. The opportunity was -- it wasn't seen, it was postponed or it was frightened. Sometimes it's someone else's generosity, it turned out to be bait: the sentence sounds beautiful, but the small print hides the disadvantageous conditions. In any case, the energy of abundance does not pass: the channel between \"want\" and \"get\" is filled with doubt, greed or habit of scarcity.\n\nThe psychological root of the card is the setting of scarcity: the person thinks that the good will be enough for everyone but himself, and he either clings to the inappropriate or rejects the good. The inverted ace asks for an honest answer: why is real opportunity more frightening than the illusory? While the question is open, new seeds will fall on the stone.","daily":"The background is small losses and annoying delays: a missed discount, a spoiled purchase, a payment forgotten on the last day. Not the time for big investments and risky transactions: check check checks, read contracts, postpone decisions for a few days. The stingy pays twice - today this proverb literally refers to you.","career":"You can have a project that has a nice facade and an empty budget, or you can have a proposal that's worse than the current location, and you can either delay or disappear altogether, and if you're looking for funds to support an idea, investors are cool: you're going to have to redesign the presentation, and you're not going to sign anything because of someone else's deadline.","love":"Relationships stand still because someone promises but doesn't: words about the future are not supported by steps; there is a union where one draws the budget and the other only consumes; conversations about money and housing end in quarrels again; the card advises you to look at actions: stability is not declared, it is demonstrated.","health":"The body signals resource depletion: recovery is slow because basic needs are ignored — sleep, food, movement. Treatment may be unavailable or delayed for savings, which will only make the result more expensive. Don't skimp on the main thing: health is an asset that can't be bought later.","esoteric":"Esoterically, the channel of abundance is blocked: money magic doesn't work while fear of poverty or shame for wanting wealth is alive inside; grounding practices crumble, wealth mascots don't keep it up to rethink motivation; generic poverty scenarios are useful: an often inverted ace shows an unlived ancestral agenda.","gd":{"title_en":"The Root of the Powers of Earth","title_ru":"Root of the Earth's Forces","why":"A pure earth is the potential of form, resource, body and material outcome, and it's not wealth as a result, it's the ability to make something happen."}}},{"id":"pentacles-two","name_ru":"Two of Pentacles","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"pentacles","number":2,"img":"pentacles-two.webp","element":"Earth","astro":"Jupiter in Capricorn","upright":{"short":"Juggling with chores and resources: flexibility, a sense of rhythm and a light hand keep balance in a changing world.","keywords":["flexibility","balance","multitasking","adaptation","priorities","guile","rhythm"],"archetype":"A young man in a buffoon's cap dances by throwing two coins connected by the infinity sign. Behind him, waves swing ships -- the world is unstable, but the hero doesn't fight the waves, he dances in their rhythm. The two pentacles are the art of keeping several spheres of life in motion at once without letting any fall.\n\nThe lemniscata overhead tells us that juggling is not an auroral, it's a lifestyle, a cyclical redistribution of attention. Today, one thing is more important, tomorrow, and flexibility is virtue, not unscrupulousness. The card respects those who can laugh in the middle of a swing and choose what priority is to take over everything at once.","daily":"Your home schedule is like a circus show: work, kids, shopping, repairing, everything takes place simultaneously. A two pentacles approve of your style: lists, switching, moving the non-urgent to tomorrow. A good time to combine things -- listen to an audiobook on the way, solve questions on the phone in line. Easy saves better heroism.","career":"The working reality is parallel projects, freelancing plus staff, seasonal workloads. The card confirms that you're coping with roles that would break many. The income comes in an unequal wave, but on average converges. It's useful to re-evaluate priorities once a week: which one really leads to the goal and which one just takes up hands.","love":"Relationships only have time if you're consciously sharing it, and the partner is busy, you're busy, and the card doesn't think it's a tragedy, provided that the meetings don't stay on a residual basis, and the humor and the playfulness strengthen the union more than serious conversations: have an evening without a agenda, just have fun together.","health":"The living organism loves to alternate: interval training works better than monotonous, changing activities restores strength faster than passive lying. Make sure that the swing \"load-rest\" does not turn into a storm: sleep should remain an untouchable island. The nervous system at this rhythm is the main resource, protect it.","esoteric":"The infinity sign above the juggler is an indication of the eternal cycle of energies that the master controls playfully. Jupiter in Capricorn gives the card a rare combination: expansion of possibilities within a rigid form. In practice, the card develops the switchability of consciousness, rhythmic breathing, the ability to enter and exit the flow of your choice.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Harmonious Change","title_ru":"Lord of Harmonious Change","why":"Jupiter wants to expand, but Capricorn sets the framework and the controls, so growth doesn't go directly, but through profit/loss cycles and constant adaptation -- the harmony of change."}},"reversed":{"short":"The balance is broken: there are too many balls, priorities are confused, and the most valuable falls with the most superfluous.","keywords":["overload","chaos","bustle","balance-sheet","erroneousness","sway"],"archetype":"Same juggler, but the dance is over: coins fly past your hands, waves hit the hulls of ships, and the mask of fun is frozen. Inverted deuce is a state where trying to hold everything turns into losing control over every case. A person takes a new ball without releasing the old ones, and calls it responsibility, although there is a reluctance to choose.\n\nThe card makes an uncomfortable diagnosis: overload is not a feat, but a form of flight. As long as all spheres are held to their word, none of them live fully. The card's question is simple: what ball are you willing to put on the ground? A conscious renunciation of part of the commitment is not a defeat, but the return of the ability to control the rest.","daily":"Days merge into a carousel of forgotten payments, late payments and unfinished business, and the unsolved questions piling up at home: the bill is not paid, the tap drips, the phone to your parents is delayed for the fourth day, the first thing you do is shorten the list: cross out half the points without regrets, trying to finish everything at once ensures that nothing is done.","career":"Projects overlap, timelines conflict, quality declines — the classic picture of an inverted two. Leadership can load tasks beyond the contract, and you silently agree. It's time to raise the issue of delegation or rejection: three brought to mind projects are worth more than seven, forever stuck in drafts.","love":"The partner gets a bit of attention -- between calls, on the run, tired at midnight, and the grudges piling up quietly, and then they explode over trifles, and maybe the busyness has become a shield from intimacy, and the card recommends an honest audit: if the relationship gets the crumbs off the table, it's worth either putting them at the table or admitting the truth.","health":"Constant switching is a nerve-wracking thing: insomnia, shoulders that rock in the evening, snacking on the go instead of eating, immunity is losing ground, old sores remind you of themselves, the body asks not for windows, but for routines: the same bedtime, normal meals, at least twenty minutes of complete immobility a day.","esoteric":"The energy is sprayed through a dozen channels, and none is filled to the depths, as this card is read in the practitioner's language: protection crumbles, intent dies out without gaining strength. Medicine is the principle of one thing: to complete the current before opening the new, and to close the energy doors behind you. A simple discipline without which all magic remains a fuss.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Harmonious Change","title_ru":"Lord of Harmonious Change","why":"Jupiter wants to expand, but Capricorn sets the framework and the controls, so growth doesn't go directly, but through profit/loss cycles and constant adaptation -- the harmony of change."}}},{"id":"pentacles-three","name_ru":"Three of Pentacles","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"pentacles","number":3,"img":"pentacles-three.webp","element":"Earth","astro":"Mars in Capricorn","upright":{"short":"Joint construction: the skill of each participant is formed into a common plan, and the work for the first time receives public recognition.","keywords":["team","mastery","collaboration","recognition","plan","quality","teaching"],"archetype":"Inside the unfinished cathedral, the mason puts the next blocks; next to the architect, the architect unfolds the blueprints, and the monk conveys the customer's wishes. Three experts, three roles, one idea, this is what is born that will outlive all the participants. The three pentacles are a card of professionalism: not genius aloneness, but the ability to work where your skill complements the other.\n\nThe important thing is that the boy at the stone is a student who learns by doing something, building a real temple, not by doing an exercise in a workshop. The card says that recognition comes to someone who works in plain sight and in harmony with others. Your skill is now building the material of something bigger than your personal career, and that's why it's growing so fast.","daily":"Housework is more fun for the company: house cleaning by the whole family, repairs with friends, a holiday where everyone is responsible for their own. The card favors agreements: defined areas of responsibility, eliminated half of the disputes. Don't turn down the help of neighbors and relatives, working together brings family dinners closer together.","career":"The business situation is exciting: the team is in the works, the project is taking shape, the customer or the boss is noticing the contribution of you personally, and it's a great time to learn by doing this -- internship, certification, learning a new tool -- learning is built on experience and reinforced, and if you've earned a promotion, it's now the most likely thing to happen, and you can see your results with the naked eye.","love":"The couple starts building something that lasts forever: a common life, a big purchase, maybe a wedding, and the relationship is perceived as a shared project, where everyone has their own area of responsibility and the right to expertise, and the outside view helps, the counseling of a psychologist or a wise family council is not taken as an intervention, but as a missing blueprint.","health":"The best results come from working with a specialist: a coach will write a program, a physical therapist will put in the equipment, a doctor will write a treatment regimen, self-activity is inferior to a methodical partnership with a professional, group classes are more useful than single classes: the team spirit supports when self-motivation is lacking.","esoteric":"Mars in Capricorn is a bellicose energy cast in granite form: an effort subordinate to design. On the subtler plane, the card is about initiation into craft: labor as a spiritual practice, every stroke of the incisor is prayer. The cathedral in the image is not accidental, it is the egregor of a common cause, within which participants grow faster than alone. Collaboration becomes initiation itself.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Material Works","title_ru":"Master of Material Works","why":"Mars in Capricorn is traditionally strong: action becomes disciplined and productive, and the Troika translates the idea into a real process -- hence construction, labor, and craft."}},"reversed":{"short":"Coherence is lost: everyone has their own truth, someone else’s experience is devalued, and the common cause stalls in disputes and marriage.","keywords":["disorder","low-quality","ignobleness","complacency","mismatch","marriage"],"archetype":"Construction stopped: the architect argues with the customer, the mason works as he understands, and the walls no longer match the blueprint. The inverted three pentacles is a story about how capable people produce mediocre results because no one wants to hear the other. Experience is devalued, instructions are ignored, ambition is more important than business.\n\nThe card has a second face, the non-recognition: the person does quality work that no one notices, and gradually stops trying. Both situations are treated the same way: by returning to the arrangements of roles and respect for professionalism, one's own and another's, the cathedral is built by those who agree that he is superior to any of the builders.","daily":"Home-based joint ventures are stuck: repairs are delayed because the masters are confused in their testimony; family plans are ruined by mutual \"I decided so,\" children ignore requests because parents say the opposite. Put in a simple order: write down who is doing what and by what date.","career":"At work, there are conflicting roles: two people doing the same thing, nobody does the most important thing, criticism flies indiscriminately, maybe your contribution is appropriated by others, or management requires results without giving resources, quality is falling, customers are unhappy, minimum protection is to document agreements and record your contribution.","love":"Relationships become a platform for proving that the couple doesn't believe the advice, and the couple doesn't have enough of their own strength, one puts in, the other takes it for granted, and this skews the foundations sooner or later, and bring back respect for the partner's work, even if his methods are different from yours.","health":"The disparate attempts to improve one's health have zero: a diet without a regimen, exercise without a technique, pills without a scheme, worse than self-medication instead of a visit to the doctor, health now requires a systematic approach and a professional plan, otherwise efforts will not only be in vain, but also harmful.","esoteric":"The energy of Mars without Capricorn form becomes a destructive noise: there is power, there is no direction. In practice, the card warns of circles where there is no agreement of intention: such a community does not strengthen, but extinguishes each participant. Check who you trust to work together, and do not give your power to those who do not respect your skill.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Material Works","title_ru":"Master of Material Works","why":"Mars in Capricorn is traditionally strong: action becomes disciplined and productive, and the Troika translates the idea into a real process -- hence construction, labor, and craft."}}},{"id":"pentacles-four","name_ru":"Four of Pentacles","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"pentacles","number":4,"img":"pentacles-four.webp","element":"Earth","astro":"The Sun in Capricorn","upright":{"short":"Hold and keep: Stability is achieved, but the grip is already turning into fear of losing, and life is shrinking to the size of a fortress.","keywords":["safety","control","accumulation","stability","retention","caution","possession"],"archetype":"A citizen sitting outside the city walls, clutching coins: one pressed to his chest, another crowning his head, another clamped under his foot, he has achieved much — and now his whole world is reduced to guarding what he has achieved. The four pentacles speak in terms of image: it is legal to protect what he has gained, but when security becomes meaning, a person puts himself outside the fortress wall of life.\n\nThe card has a bright side, and it's not a sham: saving, saving, standing up for yourself is a maturity that many people don't have. The problem starts where control replaces trust. The sun in Capricorn illuminates the stone safe from the inside: there's wealth, there's not enough light in it, the card suggests checking whether you own assets or anxiety, disguised as assets.","daily":"Being in the sign of reasonable savings: accounting for expenses, saving some income, buying reliable instead of fashionable. A card is good for consolidation - pooling accounts, putting things in order, getting insurance for housing. One caveat: if saving already forbids joy, it's not order, it's a cage with a beautiful lock.","career":"Professionally, the position of the fortress: stable place, proven strategy, abandoning adventure. You strengthen what you have: customer base, position, reputation. The shadow option is information greed, where the specialist hides knowledge and authority, fearing to become unnecessary. The value of the expert grows from exchange, not from secrecy.","love":"You're careful in your feelings, the heart opens in portions and is controlled. It protects against pain, but it keeps intimacy at arm's length. In a stable pair, the card is faithful and budget-conscious; the flip side is jealous accounting of who invested more. Trustworthiness is beautiful until it turns into possession.","health":"The body accumulates the unexpressed: clamps in the shoulders, clenched jaws, held breath — this is the anatomy of control. Energy-saving regimen is justified when exhausted, but constant tension of security wears out the vessels and back. The body needs a practice of letting go: massage, stretching, breathing exercises, literally teaching the muscles to stretch.","esoteric":"The sun in Capricorn is a light locked in a stone vault: the lesson of the card is that the treasure without a turn dies. In protective magic, the four are used to talismans of property and print on the purse, but the old masters added a condition: always give some, otherwise the seal will turn against the owner. Circulation is the law of the element of the Earth.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Earthly Power","title_ru":"Lord of Earth Power","why":"The Sun gives center and control, Capricorn gives structure and status, the Four gives fixation, and matter is held firmly, becoming a resource of power and security."}},"reversed":{"short":"The grip weakens: either the hand finally opens to exchange and renewal, or the acquired leaks through the fingers.","keywords":["loosening","generosity","wastefulness","loss","release","financial fragility"],"archetype":"The fingers broke, depending on what was in the fist. The inverted four describe two paths out of the petrified grip. The first is liberation: one lets go of old things, shares, spends on life, and it turns out that the world is not collapsing. The second is the collapse: control gave a crack, accumulated avalanche, because the dam was only held on fear.\n\nThere's a third reading, the extreme of generosity, where you give out over-the-counter, buying favor, because you have the same hunger inside, just turned outward. The scenarios are simple: liberation fills, compulsive giving devastates. The card asks you to distinguish generosity from leakage, just by the feeling after the act.","daily":"Your budget is shattered, spending is ahead of schedule, a big purchase is a hole, your savings are melting away, or you can just sell, give it away, get your cabinets out of the trash, and that's a relief. Check where the money goes: if it's anesthesia for anxiety, the effect is always temporary.","career":"Work stability has been shattered: restructuring, ownership change, responsibilities dilution -- the indestructible has been a set of agreements. Sometimes a card means voluntarily leaving a safe place for growth. In any case, the \"sit in the trench\" strategy no longer works: it's time to build a new set of supports.","love":"The pair's control has weakened, and what it has masked has been revealed: accumulated claims, cooling, other people's fatigue. There's a bright turn, too, where partners stop measuring deposits and let each other breathe. The dangerous scenario is holding the person with gifts and prohibitions: bought intimacy goes away with the money.","health":"It breaks down a regime that was held on rigid self-control: diet breaks down, exercise is canceled, sleep is reduced to night; the body takes revenge on years of spartanship with sudden failures — pressure, back, digestion; the opposite pole is relaxation to carelessness. Look for the middle: health needs not a jailer and not a slob, but a gardener.","esoteric":"The seal is ripped from the vault, which is how a card is read in a defensive practice: the fear-protected loses its power, because real protection is built on trust in the flow. The practice of letting go, voluntary donations, giving away excess clears the channel of abundance better than new amulets. The lesson of the inverted four is that the love-given returns, the held by force crumbles.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Earthly Power","title_ru":"Lord of Earth Power","why":"The Sun gives center and control, Capricorn gives structure and status, the Four gives fixation, and matter is held firmly, becoming a resource of power and security."}}},{"id":"pentacles-five","name_ru":"Five of Pentacles","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"pentacles","number":5,"img":"pentacles-five.webp","element":"Earth","astro":"Mercury in Taurus","upright":{"short":"The strip of deprivation: cold, lack and the feeling of locked doors - although the warm window burns closer than the desperate is ready to notice.","keywords":["difficulty","lack of","isolation","disease","loss","alienation","sideways"],"archetype":"Two walk through the snowstorm, one on crutches, in rags, and past them, warm and gold, the stained glass window of the church window glows, but they don't see it: heads are lowered in the snow. Five pentacles are a test card of resources and faith: money is scarce, health is failing, support seems unaffordable. But the composition stubbornly repeats: help is a few steps away.\n\nThe most insidious thing about this strip is not poverty, but the belief that nobody cares about me. It makes you walk past a burning window: not to call a friend, not to go to a court, not to ask. The card is honest: it's a tough period, pretending otherwise stupid. But it's just as persistent about the other: winter has a calendar end, and pride should not cost more than warmth.","daily":"Everyday life has shrunk: you count the change to your paycheck, you refuse to meet because you have nothing to buy, you can have community surprises, you can have a broken thing, you can get a fine, the card insists on taking the help you can get -- a favor, a family support, a friend's offer -- it's not a shame to ask, it's a shame to freeze.","career":"Jobs at risk: cuts, delays, easy orders, or finding a place has been dragged into despair. The market is not gracious now, and it's not a valuation of your talents. Consider a temporary part-time job, a related field, a position below the previous status: the bridge through the winter is built of boards, not ambition. The stained glass window on the card is a former colleague who is ready to recommend you.","love":"Cold and loneliness: whether or not there is a person around, the feeling is that no one warms up. Lack of money exposes the cracks of a couple — don't let them become a chasm. Don't isolate yourself from shame for the circumstances: shared difficulty is twice as easy.","health":"Health is missing the basics: heat, nutrition, a hospital time, chronic illness has worsened, treatment is delayed because of money or employment, the most expensive savings possible. Stained glass on the card is also a doctor, a clinic, a government program: they exist, find them before the body bills itself.","esoteric":"Mercury in the winter Taurus is a mind in material dead end, and tradition called it spiritual poverty: external impoverishment as a signal of cut off from the source; prayer, almsgiving, candles restore connection; the door is always open; the head is shut.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Material Trouble","title_ru":"The Lord of Material Difficulties","why":"The five breaks the stability of the Earth, Mercury begins to count, compare and worry about resources, and Taurus painfully feels a loss of security — hence material anxiety."}},"reversed":{"short":"Frost lets go: the strip of deprivation breaks down, the doors that seemed nailed down lend themselves - a return to warmth has begun.","keywords":["recovery","droop","support found","recovery","debt","hope"],"archetype":"The snow is still spinning, but the characters lifted their heads and saw the window. The upside-down five is the beginning of the crisis: the money is coming back, the work is being done, the body is starting to listen, people are responding. The card highlights the mechanism of change: they start with a small gesture -- the help they receive, the first call, the consent to take the proposed hand.\n\nShe also has a warning: the habit of survival lives longer than need; the person keeps saving on food with a full refrigerator and waiting for the trick of kindness; winter has taught him not to believe in warmth, but he has to learn again; if his head is left drooping, if pride forbids \"to glow with his face\", isolation will continue by choice.","daily":"The life is leveled: old debt is closed, compensation comes, the thing you need suddenly becomes cheaper, loved ones help with money and hands. It's a good time to make a recovery plan - pay off the obligations in order, put together a safety cushion. And allow yourself a little joy after a period of rejection: the symbolic \"first warmth\" fixes the turn.","career":"On the professional front, the breakthrough is: offer after a long search, return to the previous place, pay the hanging bill. Debtors start to pay back, customers come alive. Stick to success: update your resume, record the agreements in writing, thank the helpers — the ties warmed up in the crisis are the strongest.","love":"Relationships thaw: after a quarrel and silence, there is a conversation, after a separation, tenderness. Someone reaches out first, and it may be a partner, or it may be you. For singles, the end of the internal freeze, the desire to let people back in. Careful with the past: returning an old relationship requires checking if anything has changed except the weather.","health":"The recovery begins: the treatment is matched, the body responds with improvement, strength comes in little by little, a favorable period for rehabilitation and a gentle return to activity without records, the main thing is to complete the course and not to write yourself up early: the thaw is not yet spring.","esoteric":"The reverse five is reconnection: practices of gratitude, renewed exchange with the world, small regular offerings instead of large one-off ones. In birth rituals, a card is used to complete a program of deprivation -- symbolically remove the last garment of poverty. Traditional mystic advice: when you enter the warmth, look around and point it to the next cold.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Material Trouble","title_ru":"The Lord of Material Difficulties","why":"The five breaks the stability of the Earth, Mercury begins to count, compare and worry about resources, and Taurus painfully feels a loss of security — hence material anxiety."}}},{"id":"pentacles-six","name_ru":"Six of Pentacles","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"pentacles","number":6,"img":"pentacles-six.webp","element":"Earth","astro":"Moon in Taurus","upright":{"short":"The flow of generosity: resources circulate again, the scales in the hand of the giver keep the balance between generosity and justice.","keywords":["generosity","help","fairness","exchange","charity","support","abundance"],"archetype":"A wealthy citizen in a crimson cloak hands out coins to two beggars, and holds a scale in his left hand. He is not only kind, he is accurate: to each as needed, without ruining himself or humiliating those who ask. The six pentacles are a card of the correct circulation of abundance: what is received from above flows down and comes back again while the scale is held.\n\nThe card asks each side an uncomfortable question: What role are you in now? Acceptance is a skill no less than giving: it requires recognizing vulnerability and not paying with gratitude for your own will. And the scale giver is reminded that help without measure becomes a leash. True generosity levelles the world; the false one only paints the hierarchy in the colors of charity.","daily":"Everyday life is decorated with the exchange of good things: you support relatives with money or work, you donate to the right thing, you share food and time — or you are on the receiving side, and it happens carefully. It's a good day to pay back an old debt, to thank the helper, to leave a generous tip: what is given today returns quickly.","career":"The business climate is warm: bosses give bonuses, coworkers share their expertise, you become a mentor to the newcomer, you can have a lucrative barter, a favor for a favor on fair terms. If you're a leader, six advise fair distribution of bonuses: generosity to those close to you, blind to others, rocks the scales of the department.","love":"There's a sharing of care in a couple: one is cooking dinner, the other is treating the flu, both feel balanced. A beautiful period for gifts, surprises, support in a difficult episode. Card check is tone: help of the equal or patronage from above? Love with one-way traffic quickly turns into charity, and it usually doesn't grow to be a wedding.","health":"Careful hands help recovery: loved ones care, the doctor is attentive, treatment is available. If you are in power, share it — caring for a weakening relative or volunteering heals the helper. The body now responds well to nutrition and regimen: banal warmth, sleep and full food work as a medicine.","esoteric":"The moon in Taurus nourishes the world through matter: tradition connects this card with the law of tithes, the separated part sanctifies the whole. The scale in the hand of the merchant is an ancient symbol of karmic balance: every coin passed through the hands is written into both the giver and the taker. The practice of the card is the blessing of the money you give away: ordinary payment becomes the magic of exchange.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Material Success","title_ru":"The Lord of Material Success","why":"The moon is traditionally strong in Taurus: needs are supported by material resources. Six restores balance - the resource is and can be distributed, hence success and support."}},"reversed":{"short":"The scales swung: the help revealed threads, debts are not returned, and in each gift a hook is seen.","keywords":["conditional","inequality","debt-debt","dependence","manipulation","skew"],"archetype":"The scales fell out of the hand of the giver: coins are handed out according to mood, and position dictates the price of good. The inverted six is a distorted cycle: help has become an instrument of power, gratitude has become a currency asking for eternal guilt. The classic faces of the card are a philanthropist demanding servility, a lender collecting not money but dependence, charity for a showcase.\n\nThere is a mirror side to the upheaval: the one who takes too long, the person is used to living at the expense of others, and no longer distinguishes between support and feeding; or vice versa, he is ashamed to accept the necessary and loses strength. The card requires to restore the degree: every exchange must have a fair price known to both, where the price is silent, bondage grows.","daily":"Domestic injustice is coming from all over the place: relatives ask for money that will never come back; discounts overstate the sum; service obligates gratitude for the rest of your life; stop being upright — the word \"no\" is an act of hygiene today; and vice versa: if you have to, give back at least a part without waiting for reminders.","career":"At work, there are reward skews: equal effort is paid unequally, bonuses are paid to the people close to you, your work is dissolved in the wording of \"general workload.\" There is a boss who buys loyalty with kindness. Record achievements in writing and check with the market: silent patience is never valued by such systems.","love":"The relationship has been skewed: one is invested in money, time, emotion, another accepts it as the world's order, love is increasingly like a content with terms, \"I'm for you, you owe me,\" and gifts are accompanied by scores of expectations, the card is harsh: either the level of exchange is leveled off or the union is recognized as what it became - a deal.","health":"Body care has become hostage: treatment is available, but through borrowed money and other people's favor, and every treatment is worth self-respect, or vice versa, you're so used to being patient that you've launched something that's solvable. Take direct responsibility for your health: it shouldn't be the subject of someone else's charity.","esoteric":"In the subtler sense, the card shows the nodes of incomplete exchanges: past debts hanging on the canals, and gifts that bind the giver tightly to the recipient. The practice of purification is the completion of hangings: return, forgive the debt in writing, refuse the service with a hook. The old teachers warned: the taker pledges the will — check whose scales you hold.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Material Success","title_ru":"The Lord of Material Success","why":"The moon is traditionally strong in Taurus: needs are supported by material resources. Six restores balance - the resource is and can be distributed, hence success and support."}}},{"id":"pentacles-seven","name_ru":"Seven of Pentacles","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"pentacles","number":7,"img":"pentacles-seven.webp","element":"Earth","astro":"Saturn in Taurus","upright":{"short":"The pause before the harvest: labor is put in, the fruits are poured, and all that is required now is patience, evaluation and not pulling out the sprouts.","keywords":["patience","progression","investment","long-term","persistence","labour"],"archetype":"The gardener leans on the hoe and looks at the bush, which has six fruits; the seventh one just opened up at the bottom, and there's a lot of work done on the garden, but the harvest hasn't been done yet, and there's a time between work and results that can't be accelerated by any amount of effort. The seven pentacles are the strategic pause card: evaluate, wait, mature.\n\nSaturn in Taurus tastes like slow time: growth is measured in seasons, not days; young energy rushes to pick and count; mature energy can stand with a hoe, knowing that waiting is also work; second plot of the card is revision: decide honestly what to grow and what to dig for a new crop.","daily":"The home investment is maturing: the repairs are almost complete, the savings are growing, the child is growing in success. The action takes little: check the watering, not transplant the tree every week. The progress journal will calm the impatient mind with the facts of the journey.","career":"You're in the waiting phase, you're sending the project to the client, the investment is working, the application is being reviewed. Don't push the process through every day, the results will come on schedule. You'll also have a sober audit: what kind of effort is paying off, what kind of effort is wasting. A calm strategic decision is more expensive than urgent movements.","love":"Relationships in the growing phase: you put in attention and patience, and there's no immediate response. Don't demand a harvest a week after sowing, trust grows slowly. But if you're the only one sowing, look honestly at the garden: is there anything growing there at all?","health":"Your body needs time: the results of your training will show up in weeks, the treatment will gain strength gradually, the main enemy is impatience, pushing you to double your workload and drop courses in the middle. Continue in moderation and regularity with checkpoints once a month: health is your longest-term investment.","esoteric":"Saturn in Taurus is time ingrained in matter: the mystery of ripening, familiar to agrarian cults as sacred expectation. Intent sown at the right hour grows itself - don't pull it by testing. The ritual of seven is the revision of crops at the full moon: to look, thank, choose what to give a second season.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Success Unfulfilled","title_ru":"The Lord of Unfulfilled Success","why":"Saturn slows down and constrains the fixed Earth, and the Seven puts the result to the test: resources are invested, but growth is delayed, so the promised success feels like it's not realized."}},"reversed":{"short":"Impatience ruins crops: much effort, little return, and the hand is already stretching to dig out what should be grown.","keywords":["impatience","wasted effort","low-impact","disappointment","short-thinking","abandonment"],"archetype":"The gardener threw the hoe and left the field, either offended by slow fruit or digging a new plot without taking the harvest off the old one, an inverted seven is a broken cycle: labor was done, no result because the wait was cut off in the middle or the effort was initially in the depleted soil.\n\nTwo characteristic scenarios: Impatient: change of direction with each slowdown, and no crop survives to harvest; tired: years of contributions or relationships that were not going to bear fruit, and it's scary to admit. Both treat honest accounting: the numbers of invested and grown will bring clarity better than emotions.","daily":"Home projects are stuck: what you've started for months is hanging in the back, the money you've set aside is being snatched away in small things, the result is nowhere to be seen, and it's often not the curse, it's the lack of a system. Pick one process, finish it, and record the result -- the habit of completing is more important than the inspiration you're trying to replace it with.","career":"Investments don't pay off: the project eats up hours, the salary stays there, the training doesn't lead to a raise, and there are also possible mismanagement — resources are wrong, perpetual grinding instead of releasing the product. Don't give up everything: count what has a perspective and what is a beautiful waste of life.","love":"In relationships, the sense of contribution without giving back: you drive to dinner, remember the dates, and in response, silence or consumer tone. Impatient pushes to ultimatums, fatigue to icy indifference, both extremes are destructive. Calm talk about what everyone puts in the common bed is more useful than stormy scenes and silent counting of grievances.","health":"Fast circuits fail: the miracle diet fails, the subscription burns, the vitamins are thrown a third; frustration in slow medicine is more dangerous than slowness itself; go back to the boring groundwork — sleep, footsteps, water, a scheduled visit to the doctor — and give it three months: the body responds to those who do not leave it in the middle.","esoteric":"Saturn inverted in Taurus is a time out of obedience: intentions rot in the ground from too much scrutiny or lack of faith. Magical tradition saw here a lesson of immature sowing: desires abandoned from boredom, without price or time, do not germinate. The practice of correction is revising vows: write a time, a fee and a criterion for the outcome to the goals you want seriously.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Success Unfulfilled","title_ru":"The Lord of Unfulfilled Success","why":"Saturn slows down and constrains the fixed Earth, and the Seven puts the result to the test: resources are invested, but growth is delayed, so the promised success feels like it's not realized."}}},{"id":"pentacles-eight","name_ru":"Eight of Pentacles","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"pentacles","number":8,"img":"pentacles-eight.webp","element":"Earth","astro":"The Sun in Virgo","upright":{"short":"School of Mastery: monotonous work polishes skill, and repetition is imperceptibly transformed into art.","keywords":["mastery","diligence","teaching","repetition","craft","attention","skill-building"],"archetype":"The apprentice bent over the workbench and carves pentacles one by one: six ready-made ones hang on the wall, the seventh under the cutter, the eighth waiting in line. The head is busy with work, not dreams of fame; the city in the distance is the world that will one day need his craft. Eight pentacles is an apprenticeship card: skill is not born of a flash of talent, it accumulates by repetition.\n\nOne of the most honest deck cards is that it doesn't promise quick triumphs, but it guarantees results for the person who stays behind the workbench. The sun in Virgo illuminates the process -- the joy of precise movement. The work here is a form of life: each disc is slightly better than the previous one, and in that difference, a person grows up.","daily":"The house benefits from the hands of routine: new recipes, paperwork, mastered repairs of trifles; language, driving, gardening; in a month of twenty minutes a day, you'll be surprised at the difference.","career":"The learning and grinding period: internship, training, portfolio. From the inside, progress seems boring, from the outside, visible, and appreciated by employers later and most expensive. Bring the tasks to the end: the reputation of the finisher is the capital of slow but steady growth.","love":"Relationships speak the language of small things: breakfast, texting in the afternoon, talking without a phone in your hands. Love is a craft: study your partner's reactions like a master learns material. Single people work on their readiness for intimacy, not waiting for chemistry: communication skills are built by the same repetition.","health":"The body responds to consistency: technique is more important than heavy weights, short daily exercise is a rare feat in the room, good time for rehabilitation, physical therapy, posture, listen to body signals before they become symptoms.","esoteric":"The sun in Virgo is a spirit that polishes matter: a sacred craft where action is prayer with hands. Coins are mandalas, a repetitive form introduces meditation, labor becomes concentration practice. The card patronizes students of all schools: the first hundred mistakes are not failure, but payment for handwriting.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Prudence","title_ru":"Lord of Prudence","why":"Virgo analyzes and refines details, the Sun gives a steady focus, eight directs energy into a specific process — skill grows through careful work."}},"reversed":{"short":"Failure in the workshop: whether the work is humiliated and falls out of hands, or idealism stifles the process itself - there is no mastery in both cases.","keywords":["perfectionism","slob","idleness","spraying","concentration","entanglement"],"archetype":"The workbench is cluttered: the apprentice is in a hurry and spoils the workpieces, then spends hours polishing one detail, afraid to show it to the world. The flipped eight is a frustrated craft: the effort has ceased to connect with the result. The work is \"back off\" when the hands are doing and the head is long gone; or perfectionism, in which no thing is declared finished.\n\nThe third is the dead end of monotony: the same coins are cut for years, although skill has long grown out of the task, and the root of all scenarios is the same: the connection between labor and meaning is broken, restore it by updating the approach or honestly admitting that you have already learned this workbench.","daily":"Housework is done down the sleeves: half-tidying, cooking, the courses you buy are dusted in the third lesson, or vice versa, perfect house order eats up the evenings, and any deviation from the plan spoils the mood, and both sloppy and cult of perfection exhaust equally. Choose three things that do well, and let the rest go.","career":"Quality is falling: deadlines are running out, rush errors, a cracked reputation for a specialist, or endless reworking of a project because everything seems insufficient, sometimes it's a dead end position where there's nothing to grow: treated with a new approach to the current job or a new step - a course, a change of role.","love":"Relationships on autopilot: caring has become ritual without feeling, talking has become logistics, or the union is choked by the control of every little thing, connections need freshness — a new business together, a trip, an honest conversation about mutual boredom: the craft of love dies without apprenticeship.","health":"The training is done carelessly — the technique suffers, and instead of the benefit comes injury; or vice versa, the pursuit of perfect shape leads to overtraining, treatment is done irregularly or excessively diligently. The body now needs moderate accuracy: less arbitrariness, more adherence to proven patterns.","esoteric":"A frustrated craft is power in a dirty channel: practices are careless, signs are misread, intentions miss the mark. Perfectionism is no less harmful than laziness - both keep the student in place. Back to basics: simple exercises done carefully restore connection faster than complex techniques.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Prudence","title_ru":"Lord of Prudence","why":"Virgo analyzes and refines details, the Sun gives a steady focus, eight directs energy into a specific process — skill grows through careful work."}}},{"id":"pentacles-nine","name_ru":"Nine of Pentacles","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"pentacles","number":9,"img":"pentacles-nine.webp","element":"Earth","astro":"Venus in the Virgo","upright":{"short":"A garden grown by itself: a well-deserved abundance, independence and the ability to finally enjoy the fruits of your labor.","keywords":["wealth","independence","self-sufficiency","luxury","discipline","pleasure","confidence"],"archetype":"An elegant woman stands in a well-groomed vineyard, a falcon in a bucket on her hand, everything is created by her efforts: garden, order, peace, the right to take a slow turn. Nine pentacles are a card of self-sufficiency achieved by work and discipline: man has built a life that should not be tolerated.\n\nThe Falcon is a tamed passion, a sense of impulse control, and it alludes to the loneliness of the garden, but chosen rather than forced. Venus in Virgo turns neatness into beauty, aesthetics as a form of self-respect. It's time to take off the apron of the worker and put on the hostess' beret: use the deserved without excuses.","daily":"The life is radiant: the house is furnished to taste, the budget allows for joy without reporting, the day off belongs to you. The time of investing in quality is one good thing instead of three cheap ones. Spa, restaurant, day of silence: pleasure is no longer a sin, but the completion of the cycle of work.","career":"Professionally, you've reached the expert level: income depends on your competence, not on other people's decisions, the schedule is increasingly yours. You may be a freelancer, your own business, a narrow specialist with a name. The card advises you to consolidate the position: author's methods, personal brand, thoughtful investments earned in assets.","love":"You come into a relationship as a whole person, not a half person, and you need a partner as an equal gardener, not a lifeguard, not a project, and you have harmony, and you have space, and it makes you more interesting, and you have autonomy that attracts other adults.","health":"Health is a pride: regimen and prevention give you energy, sleep, even mood, good time for wellness programs and deep check-up, your body has long been on your side and will repay any care.","esoteric":"The falcon in the cornea is the tamed will: desires are not killed, but trained to serve the master, that is the key to the magic of abundance. The garden of the card is a cultured soul. The practices of the nine are prosperity as a state of consciousness, gratitude aloud, caring for the living as a ritual, the ability to be alone with yourself without emptiness.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Material Gain","title_ru":"The Lord of Material Profit","why":"Venus is responsible for value and pleasure, Virgo is responsible for quality and calculation, and the nine shows a mature result: the benefits are not achieved by waste, but by the ability to save and use the resource correctly."}},"reversed":{"short":"An empty garden with a full wallet: success stands on a showcase, and behind the facade - fatigue, dependence and loneliness.","keywords":["luxury","dependence","loneliness","fatigue","false independence","denigration"],"archetype":"The tangle has unraveled: the falcon has broken or turned out to be a decoration, the garden is overgrown, and the hostess continues to smile at the guests. The inverted nine is the external wealth that has separated from the inner content: prosperity on credit, independence-cell or labor that has eaten everything for which they worked.\n\nA frequent plot is an imposter of wealth: life is portrayed by other people's standards, and the cost of the performance drowns the real budget. The other is the winner on the deserted top: there are trophies, there is no one to celebrate with. Both are treated by the question: for whom and why am I building all this?","daily":"The house is nice, but it doesn't feel like home: the interiors of the magazine and the anxiety of the bill, the money goes to maintain the image, the real desires are put aside for years, and do a prop review: canceling a couple of status spending releases an unexpectedly large amount of air.","career":"Work has consumed life: careers are moving and there is no joy in them, vacations haven't been taken for years, income grows with fatigue, and perhaps success is held by one person, you, and that's a risk, not a compliment. The card recommends delegate, document processes, and remember why the business started: profit without pleasure is a bad deal with yourself.","love":"With the outer gloss, there is no warmth: the couple is beautiful in the photos and alien in the kitchen, someone gives things instead of time; lonely, the armor of self-sufficiency, under which the fear of letting someone into their territory hides; the wealth of the soul is measured not by the area, but by the number of doors open from the inside.","health":"Health is simulated: cosmetics hide sleep deprivation, coffee masks exhaustion, sports are replaced by buying uniforms, the body sends signals — hormones, sleep, nerves — and they are more persistent. The real luxury now is rest: full vacation, examination, treatment of accumulated. Pride should not cost more than a medical card.","esoteric":"The golden cage of the spirit: energy is locked in forms of success that don't make sense; status egregors borrow and bill. Authentication: What would you want if no one ever knew? The answer will show a real garden that's worth growing.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Material Gain","title_ru":"The Lord of Material Profit","why":"Venus is responsible for value and pleasure, Virgo is responsible for quality and calculation, and the nine shows a mature result: the benefits are not achieved by waste, but by the ability to save and use the resource correctly."}}},{"id":"pentacles-ten","name_ru":"Ten of Pentacles","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"pentacles","number":10,"img":"pentacles-ten.webp","element":"Earth","astro":"Mercury in the Virgin","upright":{"short":"The heritage of the family: strong foundations, family well-being and wealth that will outlive its creators.","keywords":["heritage","family","foundation","tradition","birth-support","long-term security","wealth"],"archetype":"Under the stone arches sits a gray-haired elder in a robe embroidered with grape clusters; next to two white dogs, and in the depths a young couple hidden by a tapestry. Three generations under one roof: the old man transmits, the young take in, the dogs guard the way. A dozen pentacles are the top of the suit: wealth is measured not by sum, but by continuity - by birth, by home, by business that will continue without you.\n\nThis card looks beyond the immediate benefits and asks, what do you invest in besides yourself? Legacy is built out of boring bricks -- wills, traditions, apartments, trees planted. A dozen is a sign that the foundation already holds and can be built beyond its own century.","daily":"Everyday life is colored by family: feasting, helping parents, talking about housing for children, family archives. Good day for legal affairs - inheritance, property, big purchases. And the sense of kindness grows from small: Saturday pancakes, a shared film, trips to the elders.","career":"It takes a long time to build things: a family business, a corporation, a business for successors; it can be a stable market or a partnership of two names; it works with capital: a name opens doors before a resume; the best test of strength is a system that survives your vacation.","love":"Relationships go to the clan level: getting to know your family, grandkid plans, marriage is the union of two tribes with their traditions and resources, long-time couples get a quiet depth: silence is two times more comfortable than someone else's holiday, a lonely hint: look for someone who wants to build for centuries, not for a season.","health":"Health is broadly considered: heredity, family habits, environment for children. Gather medical history of the family and cover genetic risks with examination. Family health rituals — general exercise, hiking — work more powerful than personal exploits: the body is trusted with the pack.","esoteric":"Tradition has seen here a working channel of communication with ancestors: ancestral forces to invoke and to rely on, dozens of practices — commemoration, home altar, restoration of broken traditions, you are a link in the chain, and power flows through the one who remembers both ends.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Wealth","title_ru":"Lord of Wealth","why":"Mercury in Virgo is particularly strong at organizing details, and the top ten complete the Earth cycle, with many resources, connections, and rules being added to a stable material system called wealth."}},"reversed":{"short":"A crack in the ancestral foundation: disputes over inheritance, the breakdown of ties and wealth that has not been continued.","keywords":["family-fighting","foundation","lost-legacy","tradition","short-termism","financial"],"archetype":"The arches have cracked: the old people are on the sidelines, the young are not listening, the tapestry is torn between generations. The inverted ten is wealth that has lost its footing: an inheritance torn apart by the court; a family where money has replaced intimacy; an empire that has collapsed because no one thought of successors. Formally, everything can look good -- cracks are still under plaster.\n\nThe modern face of the card is a rootless man who builds a life on a Friday basis and suddenly finds that there is nothing to rely on. Interrupted transmission is not just money: untransmitted recipes and stories also make up a ruined inheritance. Restore connectivity while the arches stand and the crack can be closed with conversation.","daily":"The house is strained by tribal overtones: the discussion of the will ends in shouting, generations do not talk, the debts of the elders are written on you, keep your distance in monetary conflicts and record the agreements in writing.","career":"The foundations are shaky: family businesses are cracking over heirs, companies are changing owners, promised shares are words, long projects are being curtailed for quarterly figures. Protection is legal purity: agreements, registered shares, reserve. Don't build prosperity on someone else's word, even your own.","love":"Relationships clash with gender: family versus partner, conditions, a wedding in a business negotiation format, or a couple who avoid the future: no children, no housing, only the present, a union without a foundation will not survive the first storm - an unpleasant conversation about the long-term cheaper than a disaster.","health":"Your body bills for birth programs -- your father's hypertension, your grandmother's diabetes, your stress -- it's not just your eye color that you inherit, you get a card of your family health, you get a basic checkup, and home care is more effective than medicine, and nutrition and atmosphere become your physical diagnoses.","esoteric":"The broken bond looks like a de-energized wire: the ancestral powers do not reach, their unused pulls down — unforgiven, unburied, forgotten. The practice of restoration is commemoration, writing to ancestors, completing their affairs. Until the chain is joined, personal magic stands on the sand.","gd":{"title_en":"The Lord of Wealth","title_ru":"Lord of Wealth","why":"Mercury in Virgo is particularly strong at organizing details, and the top ten complete the Earth cycle, with many resources, connections, and rules being added to a stable material system called wealth."}}},{"id":"pentacles-page","name_ru":"Page of Pentacles","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"pentacles","number":null,"img":"pentacles-page.webp","element":"Earth","astro":null,"upright":{"short":"Young practitioner: first serious goal, thirst for learning, and good news about money, study, or new business.","keywords":["teaching","new beginning","determination","good news","practicality","curiosity","step-step"],"archetype":"The young page stands in a green field, looking at the coin in its raised hand as if it were reading a message in it, behind it is a plowed field: the earth is ready, the experience is not yet, and this combination opens it to any future. The page of the pentacles is the spirit of discipleship in the world of matter: the first goal, the first work, the first serious interest in how the material world works.\n\nThe energy started without cynicism: the page doesn't yet know that \"it doesn't happen like that,\" so it tries. Its attentive view of the coin is a model of attitudes to possibilities: to consider up close before grasping. Often a card means a specific message - an invitation to study, a job offer, the beginning of a big road.","daily":"Everyday life gets a student note: a new course, a fresh budget, the first steps of adulthood — contracts, insurance, shopping planning — and maybe some good practical news: a tax refund, a call about an apartment, a discount you'd like to get.","career":"Professional beginnings: internship, first job, probation, new chapter in the profession. Not afraid to look new is the advantage of the page: it learns quickly and asks questions. Favorable for applications for programs, grants and start-ups. Small regular steps: page doesn't run a marathon, it learns to put feet.","love":"You know, it's a young, it's a cautious feeling: the sympathy, the test of the case, is to write first, to call for coffee. The card partner is serious beyond age: not loud words, but consistent actions. In a pair of pages, the theme of co-development is learning something together, saving for the first common acquisition.","health":"It's a great time to get to know your body: a health journal, basic diagnostics, first workouts with a coach. Health is built from the bottom up -- sleep, nutrition, simple exercise, and small, right steps have a noticeable effect. Just don't try to embrace anatomy in a week.","esoteric":"Page - Earth in its infancy: a student of the magic of everyday life, whose first altar is a desk, and the first spell is a to-do list. Signs come through the usual: a letter, a bell, a coin found. Drive your first tools — a deck, a notebook, a crystal — carefully and without haste."},"reversed":{"short":"Scattered notebooks: plans without discipline, learning without purpose, and the message you least expected.","keywords":["procrastination","unrealistic plans","irresponsibility","missed opportunity","mess","immaturity"],"archetype":"The page turned away from the coin, the look wandering in the clouds, the field behind it remained unploughed. The inverted page is a talent that has lost its course: hundreds of courses started, none completed; a grand plan that did not withstand the first week; adult life postponed until times that do not come by themselves.\n\nIt's not stupidity, it's immaturity of attention: there's a lot of energy, there's no focus, every new idea saves you from bringing the old one to life. The second story is the bad news in practical matters: a broken deal, a failed exam, a failure that preparation would avoid. Lesson one: the world pays not for ideas, but for what is done.","daily":"The house is sinking in the wrong places: the renovation is frozen in the \"beginning to live in a new way\", subscriptions are pulling money, documents are not issued, planning is turned into a genre of entertainment - beautiful diaries without records. Choose one household task and close it today. Small completeness cures slobberness better than new wish lists.","career":"The reputation of a promising person who doesn't: deadlines go by, details get lost, exams get stuck with skips, sometimes it's the wrong start, a profession chosen for a beautiful showcase, honest answers to the question \"what do I really want\" are more useful than another resume.","love":"Romance is languishing with infantility: the partner promises and forgets, the relationship is in correspondence, and the meetings are constantly shifting. You can hide in a slight flirtation yourself, so as not to take responsibility for real intimacy. The couple who thought of a common cause abandoned him at the start. The card offers a simple test of maturity of feelings: how many promises have been fulfilled in the last month?","health":"Health is put on hold: symptoms are ignored, prescribed not started, Internet self-diagnoses replace the doctor - dangerous savings. The body forgives a lot, but the credit will run out. Write down one small action on a particular day: analysis, walking, early withdrawal.","esoteric":"The flipped page is the energy of the Earth, crumbled in clods: intentions do not sprout because they are not embedded in the soil. Signs of the world pass by unnoticed, the messenger sleeps. The practice of return: the magic of small commitments to keep your word for the day; keep a sign journal. Tradition warned students: until you learn to complete the simple, the complex will remain theater."}},{"id":"pentacles-knight","name_ru":"Knight of Pentacles","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"pentacles","number":null,"img":"pentacles-knight.webp","element":"Earth","astro":null,"upright":{"short":"Hard, slow pace: reliability, methodicalness and stubborn completion are more important than speed.","keywords":["reliability","methodicality","patience","routine","thoroughness","persistence","duty"],"archetype":"The horseman on the heavy workhorse stopped and looked at the coin in his hand: no horse racing, no battle, the movement of the plow. While the other knights fly to the wind, this one plows field after field and knows the value of every hour of the road. The knight of the pentacles is the element of the Earth in motion: slow, irrepressible, like a glacier.\n\nIt's a confirmation of the turtle-rabbit strategy: boring regularity outstrips bright jerks, and a portrait of a man who has a word that can't be checked by contract. The things started under his sign end; the promises last longer than the mood.","daily":"The to-do list is closed methodically, item by item, the card favors cleaning, repairs, papers -- anything that requires perseverance, not inspiration. Take fewer items, but complete each one.","career":"You're the one who's trusted to do the critical, to do the neat, to do the time, to do the long projects that need the aging, to audit, to implement, to report, to get the promotion, to come in the subtle, to be reliable, to be given the knight's laurels at the end of the season, but forever.","love":"Feelings are tested by consistency: this partner does not surprise, but comes when he promised, and silently fixes what is broken, his romance is a warmed-up car in the morning and a fixed tap, lonely people should look at the quiet person next to them: slowness is not cold, but seriousness of intentions.","health":"The turtle regime is useful for the body: moderate daily activity and treatment strictly according to the scheme until the last day - a steady result with almost no injuries. The only condition is that you plan your rest as officially as the load, otherwise discipline will become a drill.","esoteric":"The knight of the pentacles is the ox-power of the elements: patience is like magic, and tradition saw him as a pilgrim walking, every step is a prayer, a card that helps to complete rituals, its formula is that strength builds up in what is done every day, even when no one is looking."},"reversed":{"short":"Stuck in a rut: there is movement, there is no sense - routine eats the living, and stubbornness poses as character.","keywords":["stagnation","boredom","idleness","stubbornness","burnout","fear"],"archetype":"The horse stands, the rider sleeps in the saddle: the road is over and no one notices. The inverted knight of the pentacles is the faithfulness of the path after the path has lost meaning. From the outside, he may look like a hard worker, but there is no one inside: work is done from memory, relationships are maintained by habit, change causes allergies.\n\nTwo poles, both about stopping. One is laziness and apathy: deadlines hang and thoroughness serves as an excuse. The other is a driven horse: workaholism without a purpose, where you can not stop so as not to hear the silence. Both are treated with an honest question: where am I going and do I want to go there?","daily":"Days are like steps: up, up, up, down, down, down, projects frozen in the middle, new things grunting, routines becoming shelter, not a support, break the rut with a little impractical thing -- dinner off schedule, a walk in an unfamiliar neighborhood: the living need air.","career":"Work is a swamp: tasks are repeated, there is no growth, and the fear of changing places is more than boredom, perhaps a colleague ballast or a head of retrograd, drowning initiatives. Make an honest inventory: what else is growing here? If the answer is \"nothing\", prepare the exit in advance, without waiting for the contraction.","love":"The relationship is preserved, it's all fine and it's not working, it's just everyday conversations, it's schedule-based intimacy, it's \"normal\" to hide the fear of a real conversation, one's stubbornness blocks the change that's coming, and the card leads not to a breakup, but to a conversation that you both fear more than it's worth.","health":"Body signals boredom: exercise reduced to mechanics, nutrition is monotonous, ailments are written off as age. Stagnation of weight and tone is the physical version of this card. Add a new one: change the type of load, pace of walks, seasonal products. Treatment is not allowed on autopilot: the course is either passed or re-assigned.","esoteric":"The sleeping rider is the power of the Earth, which has become inertia: practices are formal, rituals are repeated without fire, spirit leaves forms. Empty form is worse than open refusal - it attracts the undead to habits. The means is the renewal of vows: to rewrite rules, throw out dead rituals, leave those who are still breathing."}},{"id":"pentacles-queen","name_ru":"Queen of Pentacles","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"pentacles","number":null,"img":"pentacles-queen.webp","element":"Earth","astro":null,"upright":{"short":"The mistress of a flowering house: care, backed by a practical grip, and prosperity, which is generously shared.","keywords":["care","home-coolness","practicality","generosity","wealth","maternal warmth","earthly wisdom"],"archetype":"The queen sits on a stone throne among the flowering roses; the armrests are decorated with carved fruits, a rabbit flies at her feet. She does not fight for wealth, she has arranged it: the garden is fruiting, the house is full, the guests are full, and everything is held on her mind and hands. The queen of pentacles is the mature energy of care through matter: love expressed by dinner, comfort, a timely question.\n\nHer strength is the connection of the incompatible: business prudence and heartiness, practicality and sensuality. Care here is not weakness, but a gentle form of power. The queen's generosity comes from fullness, not from fear of being bad; to feed, to warm and to clean up is also great magic.","daily":"The house is at its best: it's deliciously cooked, the budget is reduced to trifles, the guests leave full, great family dinners and kitchen and bedroom arrangements, just put the \"I\" on the schedule: the royal garden needs its own gardener.","career":"Your profile is caring plus managing: a leader raising people, a doctor, a teacher, a cafe owner or a family business, you're valued for your mix of demanding and human, and financial acumen can turn a hobby into an income, and investing in the comfort of the workplace will pay off with increased productivity.","love":"Relationships are built like a well-groomed garden — regularly and with your hands: food, cleanliness, warmth, thoughtful little things. Feelings are expressed by deeds, and it works better than loud declarations. One caution: feed loved ones, but do not overfeed — care should not deprive an adult of independence.","health":"Health is fed by the simple: home-cooking, regimen, walking, attention to body signals, especially the recovery period after exhaustion, pregnancy and childbirth, all the programs to \"regain strength\" treat not only the diagnosis, but the lifestyle around it.","esoteric":"The Queen of Pentacles is the Earthly face of the Great Mother: abundance born of care, not capture. Tradition associates her with home magic -- herbs, kitchen sorcery, the blessing of the hearth. The rabbit at the throne is a sign of fertility of plans. The first installment in any magic of this card is order, candle and bread given to the traveler."},"reversed":{"short":"The care that stifles: dissolving in others’ needs, anxiety for wealth and love measured by purchases.","keywords":["hyper-guardianship","forgetfulness","corporealism","imbalance","purchase-love","exhaustion"],"archetype":"The garden is overgrown, and the queen is still setting the table for others. The inverted queen describes a failure of the care mechanism: it stopped circulating and flowed one way, there are several options: hyperprotection, in which loved ones lose their ability to do themselves; self-denial, when there is no time or money left for themselves; anxious love, with gifts and control, to drown out the fear of being unnecessary.\n\nThe cold card is caring as a tool: obligingness to show off, resentment to ingratitude, the score presented in hindsight. The common knot of all plots is self-worth, given to the need of others for you. Return the hostess to her own throne: first feed yourself, then family.","daily":"The whole house is held on you, and your common cold becomes a disaster — no one knows how to heat soup. Start delegate while you can teach, not burn: one piece of work someone has mastered already relieves the shoulders.","career":"You're indispensable in the worst sense: dragging other people's responsibilities, covering up mistakes, awards go to the loudest. Translate care into professional boundaries: help -- yes, burn out at the expense of others -- no. Your work should have the price you voiced.","love":"The partner has taken your care like the weather, a given without gratitude, and you buy the world as a couple at the cost of your own peace: gifts instead of conversation, service instead of intimacy. In another story, care mutates into control: phone, friends, menus under supervision. Release the leash and see who remains a volunteer.","health":"The body counts: chronic fatigue, hormonal disruption, headaches, the classic person you need but yourself, doctors, you say \"time,\" family, \"it will pass.\" It's time to get serious: examination, vacation, work with the root of anxiety. A dwindling source will not give anyone a drink.","esoteric":"The channel of love is blocked: the energy flows out without returning, and the practitioner is exhausted, saving everyone but herself. Tradition saw here the false generosity of bribing spirits with gifts instead of working on yourself."}},{"id":"pentacles-king","name_ru":"King of Pentacles","name_en":"","type":"minor","suit":"pentacles","number":null,"img":"pentacles-king.webp","element":"Earth","astro":null,"upright":{"short":"The Master of Matter: Success gained by skill and the power that protects, multiplies and is responsible for those around.","keywords":["succession","authority","enterprise","defence","wealth","responsibility","business-savvy"],"archetype":"The king is sitting on a throne decorated with carved bull heads, a sign of Taurus, the element he masters perfectly. The robe is embroidered with vines, behind him is the city he built. This is a man who has traveled all the way from the ace to the empire tens - and has become its master not by birth, but by skill. He is a master of matter: a businessman, a builder, a head on whom many are held.\n\nIts power is to connect vision with execution: to make a case, to make a profit, to take responsibility for the wages of others. This power that has been established is calm because it relies on results. The card comes either as a message about such a person nearby (patron, partner, father), or as an invitation to grow to this scale yourself.","daily":"Everyday big-caliber solutions: real estate, big investments, support for family in money and word. The card approves quality purchases for years and insurance for the main thing. One caveat: leave the calendar hours of simple rest without an agenda, otherwise the calendar will rule you.","career":"The top job is leadership, your own business, your status as an investor or an expert whose name works for you. You see the whole project, from the idea to the reporting, and you take calculated risk. It's a great time to make big deals and hire strong people. Your job is to make sure that the system is strong without you being there every day.","love":"In a relationship, you're a pillar: your partner feels secure, and you find it worth building a future together. The card often describes an alliance with someone older and very solid. The manifestations of feelings are specific: housing, security, plans for decades. One card request: don't replace tenderness with collateral, your loved ones need your presence, not just creditworthiness.","health":"The constitution is strong, the forces of repair are high, the main risks are excess: a rich table, stress of responsibility, a sedentary commander's rhythm; controlling pressure, weight and sleep will remain effective for decades; strength training and bathing work better than fashion methods.","esoteric":"The king of the pentacles is the fire of the earth: the will that animates matter, the limit of the element in the deck. Tradition saw him as the priest of abundance, the king whose generosity feeds the earth. On the subtle plane he teaches service by wealth: power as the weight of responsibility to those who are weaker. What you govern with gratitude serves in return."},"reversed":{"short":"The King Rotten from Within: Greed, Arbitrary, and Power Turned into an Instrument of Profit.","keywords":["greed","corruption","tyrant","profit-making","cruelty","financial","powerblindness"],"archetype":"The throne is overturned: the king clings to coins where he used to give away land; the inverted king is a power that has lost its function and left its privileges; his faces are diverse: a tyrant boss cutting budgets for a bonus; a businessman for whom people are expendable; a family man who keeps his house at bay in the guise of order.\n\nThe mechanism is always the same: fear of losing strategy and the blindness that power creates, the king who is the last to know the cracks because he is afraid to report. If you are in power now, keep people who may not like you. If you are in front of a king like this, fix the agreements and prepare the exits: empires of fear collapse quickly and hurt the innocent.","daily":"At home, money has become an argument and a weapon: spending one thing a lot incites a storm in another, talking about the future is forbidden, dividing up property is brewing. If you're a tyrant, try asking for a week instead of pointing out. If you're around, fix the facts without arguing about principles.","career":"The picture is disturbing: a tyrant boss, a partner withdrawing assets, a culture where profits are more important than people, and someone else's greed can hit you -- defaults, gray schemes, sudden cuts to entire destinations -- don't sign the dubious, keep copies of agreements and a backup employment plan.","love":"Relationships under the heel of the purse: budget control becomes control of life, \"I support you\" sounds like an argument, gifts become an instrument of guilt. Mirror story is a dependent exploiting someone else's responsibility. Where love is measured by currency, only equality or separation is possible.","health":"Hypertension, heart, stomach — the autocrat’s typical bill for chronic control and anger; ignoring signals ends in a sudden collapse; those living near a tyrant have their bodies protesting migraines and insomnia; treatment begins with politics: lift the siege and return the body to the status of a subject rather than a resource.","esoteric":"The fallen master of the earth is Midas of a new age: everything he touches, including those close to him, loses its life. The channels of abundance are clogged with a grip, money passes without leaving goodness, and protection on fear attracts threats. The practice of liberation is to voluntarily give up a part — by power, knowledge, means — and watch the flow unlock."}}];
